<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- Nkangala New Testament Zambia</book>
  <para style="h">Mateu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Muzimbu uacili uasonekele Mateu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mateu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="mt2">Muzimbu Uacili uasonekele</para>
  <para style="mt1">MATEU</para>
  <para style="imt">Citsindikiso</para>
  <para style="ip">Muzimbu ua Mateu uapua umo ua mavulu auana mu Litavasano Lialiha lije lilumbununa vuyoye vua Yesu Kilistu. Limo ku limo liauo vhalitumbula nguavo “muzimbu.” kulumbununa “muzimbu uacili.” Va asonekele hanima ya kutsa ca Yesu kuli Mateu, Mako, Luka na Iuano. Vaka kulilongesa kuvatantekeya muaka muka uje muzimbu ua Mateu vausonekele, vuno honi casa kupua mu miaka makumi atanu na limo hanima ya kutsa ca Yesu. Naua kuvatantekeya ku cihela cije vausonekelele, vuno honi vavengi vakasinganiekela nguavo hamo vausonekelele mu Phalisitane kaha naua hamo mu nganda ya Yelusalema.</para>
  <para style="ip">Muka kuusonekani ikeye vene Mateu, uje uapuile muka kutambula lisimu te kanda Yesu amuihule linga apue ndongisi yendi. Naua vamutantekeyela na lizina lia Levi. Mateu uapuile umo ua tunganda likumi na vavali kaha naua ua usonekelele kuli vaka kutanda Ciyunda. Eci vanacimuesa mu vitaleso hakupua makumi atanu na limo mu visoneka ku Litavasano Lialaja. Uatondele kumuesa ngue Yesu ikeye vene Mesiya, muyoyesi uakuhangula ua Njambi, uje ivahandekele vunanguizi vua hali ikeye. Mateu naua uasonekele viavingi via vumuene vua Njambi. Vayunda vatondele Mesiya kupua muene ua vumuene vua vimpande via mavu. Mateu uahakelele mana mukuhisa viyongola vije mukulumbununa vumuene vua vusunga vua Njambi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Muzimbu ua Mateu uapua livulu lia cili hakuputukila Litavasana Lialiha omuo lia vitaleso vihalio viaku Litavasano Lialaja. Livulu eli lianungakana Matavasano avali. Vaka kulilongesa naua vasinganieka nguavo Mateu hamo uesekele kutemunuisa cifua ca mavulu a Mosesa, aje akeo apua mavulu atanu akulivanga mu Litavasano Lialaja. Kuambulula ca Yesu ha munkinda (5-7) tuasa kucesekesa na Njambi ahana lishiko kuli Mosesa (Ndetulonome 19:3, 23:33).</para>
  <para style="iot">Muvanavitumbikilamo:</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Mateu aputuka muzimbu nakuhandeka ha kusemuka ca Yesu Kilistu na maputukilo a vipangi viendi mu kapetulu 1-4.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Cakuhatako Mateu alumbununa vipangi via Yesu na vilongesa viendi viavingi mu kapetulu 5-25.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Cakumanusuila mukusoneka ca Mateu cikeco cihandeka ha vipangi via Yesu mu kutsa cendi na kusanguka cendi (26-28).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1"/>
  <para style="s">Vakukuluila va Yesu Kilistu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luka3:23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1"/>Livulu lia vakukuluila va Yesu Kilistu, muna Ndaviti, muna Avilahama.<verse eid="MAT 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2"/>Avilahama uapuile ishe ya Isake, kaha Isake uapuile ishe ya Yakomba, kaha Yakomba uapuile ishe ya Yunda na vamunaina, <verse eid="MAT 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3"/>kaha Yunda uapuile ishe ya Peleze na Zela vaje vaina vapuile Tamale, kaha Pelezi uapuile ishe ya Hezelone, kaha Hezelone uapuile ishe ya Lama, <verse eid="MAT 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4"/>kaha Lama uapuile ishe ya Aminandave, kaha Aminandave uapuile ishe ya Naheshone, kaha Naheshone uapuile ishe ya Salemone, <verse eid="MAT 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5"/>kaha Salemone uapuile ishe ya Mbouasi uje vaina vapuile Luhave, kaha Mbouasi uapuile ishe ya Ovende uje vaina vapuile Lute, kaha Ovende uapuile ishe ya Njesi, <verse eid="MAT 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6"/>kaha Njesi uapuile ishe ya muene Ndaviti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 1:6">Kaha Ndaviti uapuile ishe ya Solomoni uje vaina vapuile te mpuevo ya Uliya, <verse eid="MAT 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7"/>kaha Solomoni uapuile ishe ya Lehovouame, kaha Lehovouame uapuile ishe ya Aviya, kaha Aviya uapuile ishe ya Asa, <verse eid="MAT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8"/>kaha Asa uapuile ishe ya Njosefati, kaha Njosefati uapuile ishe ya Njeholame, kaha Njeholame uapuile ishe ya Uziya, <verse eid="MAT 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9"/>kaha Uziya uapuile ishe ya Yotame, kaha Yotame uapuile ishe ya Ahaze, kaha Ahaze uapuile ishe ya Hezekiya, <verse eid="MAT 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10"/>kaha Hezekiya uapuile ishe ya Manase, kaha Manase uapuile ishe ya Amoni, kaha Amoni uapuile ishe ya Yosiya, <verse eid="MAT 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11"/>kaha Yosiya uapuile ishe ya Yehoyakine na vamunaina, ha ntsimbu ije vavatualele ku vunzinda mu lifuti lia Mbambilone.<verse eid="MAT 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12"/>Kaha kuhuma hakuvatuala ku Mbambilone, Yehoyakine uapuile ishe ya Sheyaletiyele, kaha Sheyaletiyele uapuile ishe ya Zelumbambele, <verse eid="MAT 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13"/>kaha Zelumbambele uapuile ishe ya Aviyunde, kaha Aviyunde uapuile ishe ya Eliakime, kaha Eliakime uapuile ishe ya Azole, <verse eid="MAT 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14"/>kaha Azole uapuile ishe ya Zandoke, kaha Zandoke uapuile ishe ya Akime, kaha Akime uapuile ishe ya Eliunde, <verse eid="MAT 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15"/>kaha Eliunde uapuile ishe ya Eliazale, kaha Eliazale uapuile ishe ya Matane, kaha Matane uapuile ishe ya Yakomba, <verse eid="MAT 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16"/>kaha Yakomba uapuile ishe ya Yosefa uje uapuile yala lia Maliya uje uasemene Yesu, uje ivatumbula Kilistu.<verse eid="MAT 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17"/>Kaha honi vikota vioshe kuhuma kuli Avilahama nakutuala kuli Ndaviti viapuile likumi na viuana, kaha kuhuma kuli Ndaviti kutuala noho vavatualele ku Mbambilone viapuile vikota likumi na viuana, kaha kuhuma hakuvatuala ku Mbambilone kuneha noho kuli Kilistu viapuile vikota likumi na viuana.<verse eid="MAT 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kusemuka ca Yesu Kilistu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luka2:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18"/>Honi kusemuka ca Yesu Kilistu cezile mucifua eci. Omo vaina Maliya vamulamene kuli Yosefa, kaha te kanda valimoneho vamumuene nguavo akemita lizimo lia nzili yaku Cimbembesi Uakulela. <verse eid="MAT 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19"/>Kaha Yosefa uje uamulamene hakupua ua vusunga, katondele kumuvuisa shuamua kaha uasinganiekele kuviana vulo muvushueke. <verse eid="MAT 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20"/>Vuno honi te acili nakusinganieka eci, taleni, kangelo ua Muene uasholokele kuli ikeye mu cilota nakuhandeka nguendi, “Yosefa, muna Ndaviti keti uteue kuambata Maliya mpueyove, omuo eci kuimita cali naco cinapu caku Cimbembesi Uakulela. <verse eid="MAT 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21"/>Akasema muana ua yala, kaha ukamuluka lizina liendi Yesu, omuo ikeye akovola vantu vendi ku vipi viavo.”<verse eid="MAT 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22"/>Vioshe evi vialingiuile mukushulisisa vije viahandekele Muene kuhitila muli kananguizi ua Njambi nguendi,<verse eid="MAT 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23"/>“Taleni, mpuevo uje kanda alimone na yala akemita kaha akasema muana ua yala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:23">kaha lizina liendi vakamutumbula Manuuele” (kulumbununa Njambi ali netu.)<verse eid="MAT 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24"/>Omo Yosefa uahindukile mutulo, ualingile ngue muje muamushikile kangelo ua Muene. Uambatele mpueyendi, <verse eid="MAT 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25"/>vuno honi kalimuene nendi kuvanga noho hasemenene muana ua yala, kaha uamulukile lizina liendi Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2"/>
  <para style="s">Kumeneka ca Vaka Mana vaje vahumine ku Ngangela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1"/>Honi omo Yesu uasemukile mu Mbetelehema ku Yundeya mu matangua a muene Helonde, taleni vaka mana vahumine ku ngangela vezile ku Yelusalema, <verse eid="MAT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2"/>vehuile nguavo, “Ali kuli ou nasemuka muene ua Vayunda? Tunamono ntanga tanga yendi mu ngangela, kaha tuneja nakumulemesa.”<verse eid="MAT 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3"/>Omo muene Helonde uevuile eci, ualiniengele cikuma, hamo navoshe vaje vakele nendi mu Yelusalema. <verse eid="MAT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4"/>Kaha uakunguluile vakuluntu voshe va tusasendote na valongisi va mezi a lishiko, kaha uavehuile kuje Kilistu napande kusemukila.<verse eid="MAT 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5"/>Vamulekele nguavo, “Mu Mbetelehema ku Yundeya,” omuo omu mukemo muvavisonekelele kuli kananguizi ua Njambi,<verse eid="MAT 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6"/>“‘Nove Mbetelehema, mu nganda ya Yundeya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">keti usinganieke nguove u uamundende hhakati kavaka kuyula vamu Yundeya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">omuo kuli yove kukahuma muka kuyula</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">uje akatuamenena vantu vange va Isaleli.’”<verse eid="MAT 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7"/>Amba honi Helonde uasanene vaka mana muvushueke, uavehuisisile ntsimbu muka ije ntanga ntanga yasholokele. <verse eid="MAT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8"/>Kaha uavatumine ku Mbetelehema uavalekele nguendi, “Yeni mukatondesese cikuma ha kanike ou, kaha omo muamuuana, muije muakunjileke linga nange naua njije nakumulemesa.”<verse eid="MAT 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9"/>Omo vevuile vije via handekele muene kaha vaile, kaha taleni, ntanga ntanga ivamuene mu ngangela yakele kulutue luavo noho yezile nakutulila ha cihela cije hakele muana. <verse eid="MAT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10"/>Omo vamuene ije ntanga ntanga, vavuahelelele cikuma na nzolela yakama. <verse eid="MAT 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11"/>Kaha omo vakovelele mu njivo vamuene muana na vaina Maliya, kaha vatsikamene ha mavuli avo nakumulemesa. Ambahoni vafukuile mu viambatelo viavo via vufuko nakumuhana mavuana a seho a ngolinde na mazi a kunika luengo luacili a fulankininsense na miila.<verse eid="MAT 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12"/>Kaha hanima yakuvanangula mu cilota linga keti vahiluke kuli Helonde, vahilukile ku cifuti cavo na ngila yeka.<verse eid="MAT 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vateuesela Yesu ku Ingito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13"/>Honi omo vaile, kaha taleni, kangelo ua Muene uasholokele kuli Yosefa mu cilota kaha auhandekele nguendi, “Hinduka ambata muana na vaina, kaha teuela ku Ingito, kaha yakakale kuje noho njikakuleka, omuo Helonde alinakutonda muana linga a mutsihe.”<verse eid="MAT 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14"/>Ambahoni uahindukile nakuambata muana na vaina ha vutsiki vuje vene nakuya ku Ingito. <verse eid="MAT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15"/>Vakele kuje noho Helonde uatsile. Cije capuile kushulisisa vije viahandekele Muene kuhitila muli kananguizi ua Njambi nguendi, “Njasanene munange uje uakele mu Ingito.”<verse eid="MAT 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vatsiha vanike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16"/>Ambahoni Helonde omo uamuene nguendi vaka mana vanamukuisa, uanienguele cikuma, kaha uashikile linga vatsihe vanike voshe vava mala mu Mbetelehema na mu vihela viakulihatako voshe vaje vakele na miaka ivali na vaje vakele muintsi lia miaka ivali yakusemuka, kuya ku ntsimbu ije yalilongesele ku vaka mana.<verse eid="MAT 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17"/>Ambahoni vialishulisile vije viahandekele kananguizi ua Njambi Njelemiya nguendi:<verse eid="MAT 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18"/>“Vovuile Lizi mu Lama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">lizi lia kulila na kulinienga cikuma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Lakele alilila muomu ya vana vendi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">katavele kumuzembeleka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">muomu voshe vatsile.”<verse eid="MAT 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vahuma ku Ingito vaya ku Nazaleta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19"/>Vuno honi omo Helonde uatsile, taleni, kangelo ua Muene uasholokele mu cilota kuli Yosefa mu Ingito, ua handekele nguendi, <verse eid="MAT 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20"/>“Hinduka ambata muana na vaina linga muye ku cihela ca Isaleli, muomu vaje vasinganiekele kutsiha muana vanatsi.” <verse eid="MAT 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21"/>Kaha uahindukile nakuambata muana na vaina nakuya ku cihela ca Isaleli.<verse eid="MAT 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22"/>Vuno honi omo uevuile ngeci Alekelau nasuana Yundeya mu cihela ca ishe Helonde, kaha uateuele kuya kuje. Kaha honi hakumunangula mu cilota, kaha uaile ku cihela ca Ngalileya. <verse eid="MAT 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23"/>Kaha uaile nakukala mu mbonge ivasana Nazaleta, linga vije vivahandekele tunanguizi va Njambi vilishulisise nguavio, “Vaka mutumbula Kanazaleta.”<verse eid="MAT 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3"/>
  <para style="s">Kuambulula ca Iuano Muka Kumbuitika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mako1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Iuano1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1"/>Mu matangua aje kuezile Iuano muka kumbuitika, uakele nakuambulula mu mpambo ya Yundeya, <verse eid="MAT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2"/>nguendi “Tengulukeni, muomu vumuene vua muilu vuli muyehi.” <verse eid="MAT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3"/>Omuo ou ikeye ivahandekele kuli Kananguizi ua Njambi Isaya, omo uahandekele nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">“Lizi lia umo ali nakutambeka mu mpambo ngualio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">Vuaheseni ngila ya Muene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">kaha sungameseni ngila yendi.”<verse eid="MAT 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4"/>Honi Iuano uazalele vuzalo vuakupanga ha maka a kamelu kaha ualikutile muiva ua cilambu mu mbunda yendi, na viakulia viendi viapuile vambimba na vuci. <verse eid="MAT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5"/>Vantu vezile kuli ikeye kuhuma ku Yelusalema na ku Yundeya yoshe, na ku vihela vioshe viakulihata na ndonga ya Yundau. <verse eid="MAT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6"/>Valitavelele vipi viavo kaha uavambuitikile mu ndonga ya Yundau.<verse eid="MAT 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7"/>Vuno honi omo uamuene Vafaliseo na Vasanduki vavengi valinakuija mukuvambuitika, kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Yeni vana vamanoka iya naminangula linga muteue ku vutenu ovu vuli nakuija? <verse eid="MAT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8"/>Imeni vushuka vuje vumuesa ngeci muatenguluka. <verse eid="MAT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9"/>Kaha keti musinganieke ngueni muhasa kuhandeka kuli yeni vavenia ngueni, ‘Tuli na Avilahama tatetu’, omuo njimileka nguange, Njambi asa kupuisa aua mavue kupua vana va Avilahama. <verse eid="MAT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10"/>Cipue hano vene ngimbu inalivuahesela laja kuteta miti kuputukila ku mizi, nankuma muti uoshe uje kuuimi vushuka vuacili vakauteta nakuumbila mu tuhia. <verse eid="MAT 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11"/>Yange njimimbuitika na mema linga cipue cimueso ngeci munatenguluka, vuno honi ou eja munima yange anjipulakana ku nzili, kunjafuililile cipue kuambata vinkaku viendi, ikeye akamimbuitika na Cimbembesi Uakulela na tuhia. <verse eid="MAT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12"/>Lisehua liendi lili mu livoko liendi, kaha akakomba ku lijunguilo liendi, kaha akakunguluila tiliku mu cishete cendi, vuno honi mujungu akautsimika na tuhia tuakuhona kuhua.”<verse eid="MAT 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kumbuitika ca Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mako1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luka3:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13"/>Ambahoni Yesu uahumine ku Ngalileya nakuya ku ndonga ya Yundau linga vakamumbuitike kuli Iuano. <verse eid="MAT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14"/>Vuno honi Iuano uatondele kumuvindika kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Yange capande kunjimbuitika kuli yove, nkuma naua yove uija kuli yange?”<verse eid="MAT 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15"/>Vuno honi Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Cilingiue ngoco vene hano, cacili kuli yetu kushulisisa vije vioshe Njambi atonda kuli yetu.” Ambahoni Iuano uatavele.<verse eid="MAT 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16"/>Hanima yakumbuitika Yesu, kaha hajevene uahumine mu mema, kaha taleni, melu ashokolokele kaha uamuene Cimbembesi ca Njambi cishuluka ngue livembe nakumutonkama. <verse eid="MAT 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17"/>Kaha lizi liahumine muilu ngualio, “Ou ikeye Munange injazanga, muli ikeye njivuahelela.”<verse eid="MAT 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu Vamueseka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mako1:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luka4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1"/>Ambahoni Yesu vamutualele kuli Cimbembesi mu mpambo linga vakamueseke kuli Liyavolo. <verse eid="MAT 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2"/>Ualiuminine kulia ha matangua makumi auana vutsiki na mutania, kaha hanima yakuliumina kulia uevuile njala. <verse eid="MAT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3"/>Kaha muka kumueseka uezile kuli ikeye nakuhandeka nguendi, “Nga u Muna Njambi, shika aua mavue linga ahimpuke mbolo.”<verse eid="MAT 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4"/>Vuno honi Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Vanacisoneka nguavo, ‘Muntu kasa kuyoya na mbolo lika kuahi, vuno honi na mezi oshe aje Njambi ahandeka.’”<verse eid="MAT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5"/>Ambahoni Liyavolo uamutualele mu nganda yakulela, uamuhakele helu lia kashongua ka Njivo ya Njambi. <verse eid="MAT 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6"/>Kaha uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Nga u Muna Njambi,” “liumbile ha mavu. Muomu vanacisoneka nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">“‘Akashika tungelo vendi hali yove,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">kaha vakakukavuila na mavoko avo, linga viliato viove keti vikansunsuke ku mavue.’”<verse eid="MAT 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7"/>Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Vanacisoneka naua nguavo, ‘Keti ueseke Muene Njambi yove.’”<verse eid="MAT 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8"/>Kaha naua Liyavolo uamutualele ku munkinda ualaha cikuma, uamumuesele vumuene vuoshe vua hano ha mavu na vumpau vuavuo. <verse eid="MAT 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9"/>Kaha uahandekele kuli Yesu nguendi, “Vioshe evi njikakuhanavio, nga ukatsikama ha mavu na kunjilemesa.”<verse eid="MAT 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10"/>Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Huma kuli yange Satana! Omuo vanacisoneka nguavo, ‘Ukalemesa Muene Njambi yove na kumupangela ikeye lika!’” <verse eid="MAT 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11"/>Ambahoni Liyavolo uamusezele, kaha tungelo vezile nakumukuasa.<verse eid="MAT 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Aputuka Vipangi viendi mu Ngalileya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mako1:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luka4:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12"/>Omo Yesu uevuile nguendi Iuano vanamukutu, kaha uaile ku Ngalileya. <verse eid="MAT 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13"/>Kaha hakuhuma mu Nazaleta uaile nakukakala mu Kapenauma kuyehi na mema a kalunga a Ngalileya, mu nginga ya Zembuloni na Nafetali, <verse eid="MAT 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14"/>linga cije cahandekele kananguizi ua Njambi Isaya cilishulisise nguendi:<verse eid="MAT 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15"/>“Cihela ca Zembuloni na cihela ca Nafetali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">vije viakala mu ngila yakuya ku mema a kalunga, kulutue lua Yundau,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">Ngalileya, lifuti lia vaje keti Vayunda.<verse eid="MAT 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16"/>Vantu vaje vakala mu milima</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">vanamono ceke cakama.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">Kaha na vaje vakala mu cihela na mu cimbembe ca kutsa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">ceke cinavatuila.”<verse eid="MAT 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17"/>Kuhuma ha ntsimbu ije Yesu uaputukile kuambulula nguendi, “Tengulukeni ku vipi vieni, omuo vumuene vua muilu vuli muyehi.”<verse eid="MAT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Asana vandongisi vendi vakulivanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mako1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luka5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18"/>Omo Yesu uakele nakuenda kucikulo ca cisali ca Ngalileya, uamuene vamunaina vavali, Simoni uje ivatumbula Petulu namunaina Anduleo, vatele manda avo mu cisali, omuo vapuile vakakuta vantsi. <verse eid="MAT 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19"/>Kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Njikaveni, kaha njikamipuisa vakakuta vantu.” <verse eid="MAT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20"/>Kaha hajevene vasezele manda avo nakumukava.<verse eid="MAT 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21"/>Omo uakele nakutualelelaho kuya kaha naua uamuene muntu mukuavo na munaina, Tiango muna Zembendeo na munaina Iuano mu vuato hamo na ishavo Zembendeo vakele nakutungulula manda avo, kaha uavasanene. <verse eid="MAT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22"/>Kaha hajevene vasezele vuato na ishavo, kaha vamukavele.<verse eid="MAT 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Alongesa na Kuambulula na Kukanguisa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luka6:17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23"/>Yesu uahitanganene mu Ngalileya muoshe, nakulongesa muvi njivo viavo via malombelo, na kuambulula muzimbu uacili ua vumuene nakukanguisa mishongo yoshe ya vantu yakuliseza seza na vakakuvavala. <verse eid="MAT 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24"/>Kutsimana cendi cevuikile naku Siliya kuoshe, kaha vamunehelele vaka kuvavala voshe, na vaka mishongo yakuli seza seza na kuvua kuvavala, na vaka mahamba, na vaka kushinia, na vaka tulepa, kaha voshe uavakanguisile. <verse eid="MAT 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25"/>Kaha vivunga viakama via vantu kuhuminina mu Ngalileya, namu Ndekapolisi <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(Ndekapolisi ilumbununa vimbonge likumi) </char></note> na ku Yelusalema, na ku Yundeya, na musinia lia ndonga ya Yundau, viamukavele.<verse eid="MAT 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu Alongesa ha Munkinda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1"/>Omo Yesu hakumona vivunga via vantu, kaha ualondele cindende ha munkinda, kaha omo uatumamene ha mavu vandongisi vendi vezile kuli ikeye, <verse eid="MAT 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2"/>kaha uaputukile kuvalongesa nakuhandeka nguendi,<verse eid="MAT 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvuahelela ca Vusunga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luka6:20-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3"/>“Vakukuisula vaje vanapu vihutu mu Cimbembesi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:3">muomu vumuene vua muilu vunapu vuavo.”<verse eid="MAT 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4"/>“Vakukuisula vaje valinakulila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:4">muomu vaka vazembeleka!”<verse eid="MAT 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5"/>“Vakukuisula vaje valikehesa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:5">muomu vakasuana mavu!”<verse eid="MAT 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6"/>“Vakukuisula vaje vevua njala na mpuila muomu ya vusunga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:6">muafua vakakuta!”<verse eid="MAT 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7"/>“Vakukuisula vaje vali na cikeketima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:7">muomu navo vakavevuila cikeketima!”<verse eid="MAT 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8"/>“Vakukuisula vaje na lele mu mitima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:8">muomu vakamona Njambi!”<verse eid="MAT 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9"/>“Vakukuisula vaje vakakulinga ciyulo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:9">muomu vakavasana vana va Njambi!”<verse eid="MAT 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10"/>“Vakukuisula vaje vavalinakupakesa muomu ya vusunga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:10">muafua vumuene vua muilu vunapu vuavo!”<verse eid="MAT 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11"/>“Munapu vakukuisula omo vantu vamishaula nakumipakesa nakuhandeka viuma vioshe via vipi via makuli hali yeni muomu yange.” <verse eid="MAT 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12"/>Joleleni nakuvuahelela muomu vuana vueni vukapua vuakama cikuma muilu, muafua omu mukemo vantu vayandesele tunanguizi va Njambi vaje vakeleko tele kanda yeni.<verse eid="MAT 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muongua na Ceke</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mako9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luka14:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13"/>“Yeni munapu muongua uaha mavu, vuno honi nga muongua unashamuka, kaha vatihoni kutovala cauo cikahiluka? Ku ukapu naseho naua ku cuma coshe kuvanga lika vaumbile kuti kaha na vantu vakauliatangela.” <verse eid="MAT 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14"/>“Yeni mu ceke ca vaka mavu. Nganda yakutungila ha munkinda kuyasa kulishueka.” <verse eid="MAT 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15"/>Nankuma naumo uahi asa kushuameka ndeya naku ihaka muintsi lia muhela, vuno honi aihaka ha citumbiko, kaha ituila ceke kuli voshe vaje vali mu njivo. <verse eid="MAT 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16"/>Mucifua cimo vene eceleni ceke ceni citue ku vantu, linga vamone vipangi vieni viacili, kaha vakahana vumpau kuli Ishueni uje ali muilu.<verse eid="MAT 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vilongesa via ha Lishiko lia Mosesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17"/>Keti musinganieke ngueni njineja nakumanusula Lishiko lia Mosesa, cipue vilongesa via tunanguizi va Njambi, kunjezile nakuvimanusula vuno honi nakuvishulisisa. <verse eid="MAT 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18"/>Muavusunga njimileka nguange kuvanga lilu na mavu vinahiti, nacimo cahi cikahita keti cipue cisona, cipue citoma kuhuma ku Lishiko, kuvanga noho viuma vioshe vanavimanusula. <verse eid="MAT 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19"/>Nankuma uoshe uje kononoka cipue koma kakandende kaku mashiko aua kaha acilongesa na vakuavo naua linga vacilinge kaha vakamutumbula uamundende mu vumuene vua muilu, vuno honi uoshe uje aniunga na kulongesa mashiko aua vakamutumbula uakama mu vumuene vua muilu. <verse eid="MAT 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20"/>Nankuma njimileka nguange, nga vusunga vueni kuvupulakana vusunga vua valongisi va mezi a lishiko lia Mosesa na Vafaliseo, kaha kumuka kovela mu vumuene vua muilu.<verse eid="MAT 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vilongesa via ha Kuniengua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21"/>“Muevuile muje muvalekele vantu va kunsenkulu nguavo, ‘Keti mukatsihe, kaha uoshe uje atsiha mukuavo vaka musompesa.’” <verse eid="MAT 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22"/>Vuno honi njimileka nguange uoshe uje anienguela munaina vanapande kumusompa, kaha uoshe uje atuka munaina vaka musompa ku nzango, kaha na uoshe uje ahandeka mukuavo nguendi yove cilema, vakamutuala mu ngehena ya tuhia. <verse eid="MAT 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23"/>Nankuma nga utonda kulambula vuana vuove ha mutula, kaha nga uanuka mulonga uje u uapihisilile mukueni, <verse eid="MAT 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24"/>seza vuana vuove ha mutula kaha yatahi ukalisambuese nendi, kaha kuhuma oho hiluka ukalambuile vuana vuove. <verse eid="MAT 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25"/>“Lisambuese vuasi vuasi nauje yunapihisila oku muli nakuya hamo ku nzango, kuteua yunapihisila akakutuala kuli lihako, kaha lihako akakuhana kuli lisualale, kaha lisualale akakuhaka mu kamenga.” <verse eid="MAT 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26"/>Muavusunga njikuleka nguange, kukahumumo kuvanga noho ukamanusula kufueta kambongo ka mamanusuilo ku mulonga uove.<verse eid="MAT 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vilongesa via ha Vupangala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27"/>“Muevuile muje vacihandekele nguavo, ‘Keti mulinge vupangala.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28"/>Vuno honi njimileka nguange, uoshe uje atala mpuevo ntoma na lishungu lia lipi na lingi laja nendi vupangala mu mutima uendi. <verse eid="MAT 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29"/>Nga lisho liove liaku cilio likusevuisa kulinga vupi, licokovolemo uliumbile kuti! Muomu cacili kuli yove cilio cove cimo ca muvila cinonge kupulakana kumbila muvila uove uoshe mu ngehena. <verse eid="MAT 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30"/>Kaha nga livoko liove lia cilio likusevuisa kulinga vupi, livatule, kaha liumbile kuti! Muomu cacili kuli yove cilio cove cimo ca muvila cinonge kupulakana kumbila muvila uove uoshe mu ngehena.<verse eid="MAT 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vilongesa via ha Kutsiha Vulo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">Mateu19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mako10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31"/>“Kaha naua vacihandekele nguavo, ‘Uoshe uje akondola mpuevo yendi, napande kumuhana mukanda uakutsiha vulo.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32"/>Vuno honi yange njimileka nguange, uoshe uje akondola mpuevo yendi, kuakuhona mulonga ua vupangala, amupuisa ngue nalingi vupangala, kaha na uje uoshe akamuambata akapua lika lipangala.<verse eid="MAT 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vilongesa via ha Kulisinga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33"/>“Naua muevuile muje valekele vakukuluila kunsenkulu nguavo, ‘Keti upokole cisingo cove, vuno honi linga vije viualisingile ku mesho a Muene.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34"/>Vuno honi njihandeka kuli yeni nguange keti mukalisingeho, cipue na lilu, omuo liapua litanda lia Njambi, <verse eid="MAT 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35"/>cipue na mavu, omuo apua ha cituamo ca vialiatelo vuendi, cipue na Yelusalema, omuo yapua nganda ya Muene uakama. <verse eid="MAT 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36"/>Kaha naua keti ulisinge na mutue uove, omuo kuuasa kutokesa cinkambu cimo cipue kucizivalesa. <verse eid="MAT 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37"/>Kuhandeka ceni kupue ‘Eyo’ cipue ‘houe’ omuo coshe cakupulakana eci cihuminina kuli citozi.<verse eid="MAT 5:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vilongesa via ha Kuhiluisila vupi ku vupi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Luka6:29-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38"/>“Muevuile muje vahandekele nguavo, ‘Lisho ku lisho, kaha lizo ku lizo.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39"/>Vuno honi njihandeka kuli yeni nguange keti muhiluisile vupi ku muntu uje akupihisila. Vuno honi nga muntu akupupa ku litama liove lia cilio, mutenguluisile naua ku litama likuavo. <verse eid="MAT 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40"/>Kaha nga muntu atonda kukusompesa ngeci akunieke cikovelo cove, muhane naua na kazaku kove. <verse eid="MAT 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41"/>Kaha nga muntu akusindiya ngeci uende nendi vungenzi vua ntunda imo, enda nendi vungenzi vua vintunda vivali. <verse eid="MAT 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42"/>Uoshe uje akulomba muhane, uoshe uje akulomba mukuli keti umumine.<verse eid="MAT 5:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cizango ku Vitozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43"/>“Munevu muje vahandekele nguavo, ‘Zanga mukueni, kaha zinda citozi cove.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44"/>Vuno honi njimileka nguange, zangeni vitozi veni, kaha lombeleleni vaje valinakumipakesa, <verse eid="MAT 5:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45"/>linga mupue vana va Ishueni uje ali muilu. Omuo ikeye akatuisa litangua liendi kuli vaka vupi na kuli vaka vacili, kaha akanokesa kalunga kuli vaka vusunga na kuli vaka kuhona vusunga. <verse eid="MAT 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46"/>Muomu nga muzanga lika vaje vamizanga, kaha vuana muka mukauana? Nkuma omu keti mukemo muvakalingila vaka kutambula lisimu ndi? <verse eid="MAT 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47"/>Kaha nga mulihinduisa lika na vamuanoko, kaha mualisezela haka na vakueni? Nkuma omu keti mukemo muvakalingila na vaje keti Vayunda ndi? <verse eid="MAT 5:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48"/>Nankuma yeni munapande kupua vaka kusungama, ngue muje Ishueni ua muilu uapua uakusungama.”<verse eid="MAT 5:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6"/>
  <para style="s">Vilongesa via ha kukuasa vaka kujeneka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1"/>“Zangameni linga keti mulinge vucili vueni ku mesho a vantu, ngeci vamimone, nga mucilinga eci kaha kuvakamihana vuana kuli Ishueni ua muilu.<verse eid="MAT 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2"/>“Kaha nga uhana uje nahonoua, keti usike tolombita, ngue muje muvakalingila vaka civembulu mu vinjivo via malombelo na mu vitapalo, linga vavashangazale ku vantu. Muavusunga njimileka nguange, vanatambula laja vuana vuavo. <verse eid="MAT 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3"/>Vuno honi omo ukuasa vaje vanahonua, keti utavese livoko liove lia cimoshue lizivuke vije livoko liove liacilio vililinakulinga, <verse eid="MAT 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4"/>linga kukuasa ceni kuli vaje vanahonua cipue ca vushueke, kaha Ishueni uje amona vije vili mu vushueke akamihana vuana.<verse eid="MAT 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vilongesa via ha Lilombelo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luka11:2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5"/>“Kaha omo mulombela, keti mulombele ngue vaka civembulu, muomu vakevo vazanga kuimana nakulombela mu vinjivo via malombelo na mu vitapalo, linga vantu vavamone. Muavusunga njimileka nguange, vanatambula laja vuana vuavo. <verse eid="MAT 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6"/>Vuno honi omo ulombela, ya mu mulili uove, shoka ku cikolo kaha lombela kuli Isho uje ali mu vushueke. Kaha Isho uje amona via mu vushueke akakuhana vuana.<verse eid="MAT 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7"/>“Kaha omo mulombela, keti muhandeke cikuma ngue muje muvakalingila vaje keti Vayunda, muomu vakasinganieka nguavo vakavevua omuo ya mezi avo akuhona seho. <verse eid="MAT 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8"/>Keti mupue ngue vakevo, muomu Ishueni azivuka laja vije vimutonda kanda mumulombe. <verse eid="MAT 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9"/>Lombeleni ngueni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">“‘Tatetu uli muilu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:9">Valemese lizina liove,<verse eid="MAT 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10"/>Vumuene vuove vuije,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:10">Cizango cove vacilinge hano ha mavu, ngue muje vacilinga muilu.<verse eid="MAT 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11"/>Tuhane lelo kulia cetu caha litangua na litangua,<verse eid="MAT 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12"/>Tukonekele ku milonga yetu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:12">ngue muje yetu tukakonekela vaka kutuvulumuina.<verse eid="MAT 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13"/>Keti ututuamenene ku vieseko viakama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:13">vuno honi tuohiele ku citozi!’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu Vimbimbiliya vikuavo vanahakako na mezi aua nguavo, Omuo vumuene vunapu vuove, na nzili na vumpau, ku miaka yoshe. Eua.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14"/>“Omuo nga mukonekela vantu vaje vanamipihisila, kaha neni naua vakamikonekela kuli Ishueni ua muilu. <verse eid="MAT 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15"/>Vuno honi nga kumukonekela vantu vaje vamipihisila, neni naua Ishueni kakamikonekela ku milonga yeni.<verse eid="MAT 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vilongesa via ha kuliumina kulia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16"/>“Kaha omo muliumina kulia, keti mulimuese ngue muazeye, ngue muje muvakalingila vaka civembulu muje muvaka pihisa kuvihanga viavo, linga ku liumina kulia cavo vacizivuke ku vantu. Muavusunga njimileka nguange vanatambula laja vuana vuavo mukushula. <verse eid="MAT 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17"/>Vuno honi omo muliumina kulia, likuiteni mazi ku mitue yeni kaha taneni ku mesho eni, <verse eid="MAT 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18"/>linga kuliumina kulia ceni keti vacizivuke ku vantu vuno honi vacizivuke kuli Ishueni uje ali muvushueke, kaha Ishueni uje amona muvushueke akamihana vuana.<verse eid="MAT 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vufuko vua muilu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luka12:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19"/>“Keti mulitulikile vufuko vua hano ha mavu, vuje tuntembulu na nkalaue vakavupihisa, naua vuje vezi vatuva nakuiva. <verse eid="MAT 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20"/>Vuno honi litulikileni vufuko vua muilu, vuje tuntembulu na nkalaue kuvasa kuvupihisa, cipue vezi kuvasa kuvutuva na kuvuiva. <verse eid="MAT 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21"/>Omuo kuje kuli vufuko vuove, kukeko naua kukakala mutima uove.<verse eid="MAT 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ceke ca Muvila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luka11:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22"/>“Mesho akeuo ndeya ya muvila. Nankuma nga mesho ove amona muacili, na muvila uove uoshe ushula na ceke. <verse eid="MAT 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23"/>Vuno honi nga mesho ove akutsitsivala, muvila uove uoshe ukashula na milima. Nga ceke cije cili muli yove cinapu milima, kaha milima ikapua yaingi cikuma.<verse eid="MAT 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Njambi na Vufuko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luka16:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">12:22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24"/>“Naumo uahi asa kupangela vimiene vavali, akazindaho umo nakuzangaho mukuavo, akalihana kuli umo nakusembulula mukuavo. Kuuasa kupangela Njambi na vimbongo.<verse eid="MAT 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25"/>“Nankuma, njimileka nguange, keti mulinienge ha vuyoye vueni, vika mukalia cipue ngueni vika mukanua, cipue ngueni vika tukazala ha mivila yetu. Nkuma miono yeni keti ya seho kupulakana viakulia, cipue mivila yeni kupulakana vuzalo ndi? <verse eid="MAT 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26"/>Taleni tuzila va muilu, kuvekukuna cipue kuteja cipue kutulikila mu vishete, vuno honi Ishueni ua muilu alinakuvalisa. Nkuma keti yeni muli na seho yakama kupulakana tuzila ndi? <verse eid="MAT 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27"/>Kaha iya hhakati keni muomu yakulinienga asa kuvuezelelako hola imo ku muono uendi?<verse eid="MAT 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28"/>“Nkuma vika mulinienga ha vuzalo? Taleni vinsani via mu lihia muvikakolo, vikevio ku viekupanga cipue kulitongela vuzalo. <verse eid="MAT 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29"/>Vuno honi njimileka nguange, cipue Solomoni mu vumpau vuendi vuoshe, kazaleleho vuzalo vuacili ngue vua vinsani evi. <verse eid="MAT 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30"/>Kaha nga Njambi azika muila ua mu lihia uje ukalako lelo lika, imene vaumbila mu tuhia, nkuma kasa kumizika muacili ndi? Yeni vantu va lutsilielo lua lundende!<verse eid="MAT 6:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31"/>“Nankuma keti mulinienge ngueni, ‘Tukalia vika?’ Cipue ‘Tukanua vika?’ Cipue ‘Tukazala vika?’ <verse eid="MAT 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32"/>Omuo viuma vioshe evi vakavitondo vaje keti Vayunda. Vuno honi yeni Ishueni ua muilu azivuka nguendi muvitonda vioshe. <verse eid="MAT 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33"/>Vuno honi tondeni tahi vumuene vuendi na vusunga vuendi, kaha viuma vioshe evi akamihanavio. <verse eid="MAT 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34"/>Nankuma keti mulinienge via imene, omuo imene likalinienga likelio vavenia. Muomu litangua na litangua lili na tuyando tualio tuakupuamo.”<verse eid="MAT 6:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7"/>
  <para style="s">Kusompa Vakueni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37-38">Luka6:37-38-41</ref>;<ref loc="LUK 6:42">42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1"/>“Keti musompe vakueni, linga neni keti vamisompe. <verse eid="MAT 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2"/>Muomu kusompa cije musompa naco vakueni, cikeco civakamisompa naco, kaha seteko ije museteka nayo vakueni, ikeyo ivaka miseteka nayo. <verse eid="MAT 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3"/>Vika umuena cishoni cili ha lisho lia muanoko, vuno honi ku umono mukambo uje uli mu lisho liove? <verse eid="MAT 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4"/>Cipue vika uhandeka kuli muanoko nguove, ‘Teua njikuhumise cishoni cili mu lisho liove,’ vuno honi yove ulina mukambo mu lisho liove? <verse eid="MAT 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5"/>Yove muka civembulu! Hakulivanga humisa tahi mukambo uje uli mu lisho liove, ambahoni umone muacili hakuhumisa cishoni cije cili mu lisho lia muanoko.<verse eid="MAT 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6"/>“Keti muhane vije via kulela ku tutali, muomu vaka mitengulukila nakumiluisa. Keti mumbile vusanga vueni kulutue lia vangulu, muomu vaka vuliatangela na viliato viavo.<verse eid="MAT 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulomba, na Kutonda na Kutota</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luka11:9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7"/>“Lombeni, kaha muka tambula, tondeni, kaha mukauana, toteni ha cikolo, kaha vaka mishokoluela. <verse eid="MAT 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8"/>Muomu uoshe uje alomba atambula, kaha uoshe uje atonda auana, kaha uoshe uje atota vaka mushokoluela cikolo. <verse eid="MAT 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9"/>Nkuma iya hhakati keni nga munendi amulomba mbolo, kaha ikeye amuhana livue? <verse eid="MAT 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10"/>Cipue nga amulomba intsi, kaha ikeye amuhana linoka? <verse eid="MAT 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11"/>Kaha nga yeni vaka vupi, muzivuka kuhana mavuana acili kuli vana veni, kaha cikafua vati honi kuli Ishueni uje ali muilu uje akahana viuma viacili kuli vaje vamulomba!<verse eid="MAT 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12"/>“Kaha vioshe vije mutonda ngueni vakueni vamilingilevio, neni naua valingilenivio, omuo eli likelio Lishiko lia Mosesa na vilongesa via tunanguizi va Njambi.<verse eid="MAT 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cikolo ca Cindende</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luka13:24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13"/>“Koveleni mu cikolo ca cindende, omuo cikolo cakama na ngila yaco yapua yayasi ije ituala kukunonga, kaha na vaje vakovelamo vapua vavengi. <verse eid="MAT 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14"/>Vuno honi cikolo ca cindende na ngila yaco yapua ya ikalu, ije ituala ku muono, kaha na vaje vaiuana vapua vavandende.<verse eid="MAT 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muti na Vushuka vuauo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Luka6:43-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15"/>“Zangameni na tunanguizi va makuli, vaje veja kuli yeni mu vuzalo ngue vampanga, vuno honi mukati kavo vanapu tungunga vamu musenge. <verse eid="MAT 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16"/>Muka vazivukila ku vushuka vuavo. Nkuma vushuka vua viniu vaka vutomona ku muti ua vimbimbo, cipue vushuka vua mukuyu ku shaku ije ili na mambimbo ndi? <verse eid="MAT 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17"/>Mucifua cimo vene muti uoshe uacili ukemi vushuka vuacili, vuno honi muti ua upi ukemi vushuka vua vupi. <verse eid="MAT 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18"/>Muti uacili kuuasa kuima vushuka vua vupi, kaha naua muti ua upi kuuasa kuima vushuka vuacili. <verse eid="MAT 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19"/>Muti uoshe uje kuuimi vushuka vuacili vaka uteta naku umbila mu tuhia. <verse eid="MAT 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20"/>Nankuma muka vazivukila ku vushuka vuavo.<verse eid="MAT 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kunjamizivukile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luka13:25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21"/>“Keti muntu uoshe uje ahandeka kuli yange nguendi, ‘Muene, Muene,’ akakovela mu vumuene vua muilu, vuno honi kuvanga lika uje alinga cizango ca Tate uje hali muilu. <verse eid="MAT 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22"/>Ha litangua lije vavengi vakahandeka kuli yange nguavo, ‘Muene, Muene! Nkuma kutuahandekele vunanguizi mu lizina liove, nakuhumisa mahamba mu lizina liove, kaha tualingile viuma viavingi viakukomouesa mu lizina liove?’ <verse eid="MAT 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23"/>Ambahoni njikahandeka kuli vakevo nguange, ‘Kunjamitantekeyele, humeni kuli yange, yeni vaka kulinga via vipi!’<verse eid="MAT 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vaka Kutunga njivo Vavali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luka6:47-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24"/>“Kaha muntu uoshe uje evua aua mezi ange naku akavangeya napu ngue uje yala uakuzangama uje uatungile njivo yendi ha livu. <verse eid="MAT 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25"/>Kaha kalunga uanokele, na livazi liezile, kaha mpunzi yezile nakuningangesa ije njivo. Vuno honi kuyauile, muomu luvula luayo valutungilile ha livue.<verse eid="MAT 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26"/>“Vuno honi uoshe uje evua aua mezi ange, kaha ka akavangeya, napu ngue uje yala ua cilema uje uatungilile njivo yendi ha museke seke, <verse eid="MAT 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27"/>Kaha kalunga uanokele, na livazi liezile, kaha mpunzi yapekumukile nakuningangesa ije njivo, kaha yauile, kaha kuua cayo capuile cacipi cikuma!”<verse eid="MAT 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nzili Yakama ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28"/>Kaha omo Yesu uamanusuile kuhandeka viuma evi, vivunga via vantu vialikomokelele ha kulongesa cendi. <verse eid="MAT 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29"/>Muomu uavalongesele ngue uje alina nzili yakama keti ngue valongisi vavo va mezi mashiko.<verse eid="MAT 7:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu Akanguisa Yala Uambumba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mako1:40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luka5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1"/>Omo Yesu uasikumukile kuhuma ha munkinda, vivunga viakama viamukavele, <verse eid="MAT 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2"/>kaha taleni, muka mbumba uezile kuli ikeye nakumutsikamena nakuhandeka nguendi, “Muene nga utonda uasa kunjilelesa.”<verse eid="MAT 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3"/>Kaha Yesu uoluele livoko liendi nakumukuata nakuhandeka nguendi, “Njitonda, lela.” Kaha hajevene uje yala uakangukile ku mbumba yendi. <verse eid="MAT 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Keti ukalekeko cipue umo, vuno honi ya ukalimuese kuli kasasendote, kaha ukahane vuana vuje vuashikile Mosesa, linga cipue vukaleho ku vantu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Akanguisa Ngamba ya Mukuluntu ua Masualale va Loma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luka7:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5"/>Omo Yesu uakovelele mu Kapenauma, mukuluntu ua masualale va Loma uezile kuli ikeye mukumulomba vukuasi <verse eid="MAT 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6"/>kaha uahandekele nguendi “Muene, ngamba yange nakosa mu njivo ali nakuvavala kalepa, kaha alinakuvua cikuma kuvavala.”<verse eid="MAT 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Njija nakumukanguisa.”<verse eid="MAT 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8"/>Vuno honi uje mukuluntu ua masualale uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Muene, kucanjipandele yove kukovela mu njivo yange, vuno honi handeka lika lizi, kaha ngamba yange akakanguka. <verse eid="MAT 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9"/>Muomu nange naua nji yala uje ali muintsi lia nzili yakama, kaha na masualale naua vali muintsi liange, kaha njihandeka kuli umo nguange, ‘Ya,’ kaha aya, kaha kuli mukuavo naua nguange ‘Ija,’ kaha eja, kuli ndungo yange nguange, ‘Linga eci,’ kaha acilinga.”<verse eid="MAT 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10"/>Omo Yesu uevuile vije viahandekele, ualikomokelele cikuma, kaha uahandekele kuli vaje vakele naku mukava nguendi, “Muavusunga njimileka nguange, cipue mu Isaleli kunjauanene lutsilielo luangacije. <verse eid="MAT 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11"/>Njimileka nguange vavengi vakeja, vakahuma mu ngangela na mu kangombe kayambi, kaha vakatumama ku ciuano hamo na Avilahama, na Isake, na Yakomba, mu vumuene vua muilu, <verse eid="MAT 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12"/>vuno honi vana va vumuene vakavombila mu milima hambanza, kuje kukakala kulila na kulishumanga ku mazo avo.” <verse eid="MAT 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli uje mukuluntu ua masualale nguendi, “Ya, cilingiue ngoco kuli yove ngue muje munatsiliela.” Kaha ngamba yendi uakangukile ha ntsimbu ije vene.<verse eid="MAT 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Akanguisa Vantu Vavengi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mako1:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luka4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14"/>Kaha omo Yesu uakovelele mu njivo ya Petulu, uauanene vainamueno ya Petulu vanakosa vakele nakuvavala lisika sika. <verse eid="MAT 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15"/>Kaha uamukuatele ku livoko liendi, kaha lisika sika liamuhumine, kaha uahindukile nakuputuka kumupangela.<verse eid="MAT 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16"/>Kaha kucinguezi cije vene vamunehelele vantu vavengi vaje vakele na mahamba, kaha uahumisile vimbembesi na lizi, kaha uakanguisile vakakuvavala voshe. <verse eid="MAT 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17"/>Eci capuile linga vilishulisise vije viahandekele kananguizi ua Njambi Isaya nguendi, “Uambatele makalu etu, kaha uambatele mishongo yetu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Makalu akala hakukava Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luka9:57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18"/>Omo Yesu uamuene civunga cakama cinamuzengeleka, uashikile vandongisi vendi linga vaye musinia lia cisali. <verse eid="MAT 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19"/>Kaha mulongisi ua mashiko uezile kuli ikeye nakuhandeka nguendi, “Mulongisi, njikukavangeya kuoshe ku ukaya.”<verse eid="MAT 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20"/>Kaha Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Vambanje valina mena, kaha naua na tuzila va muilu valina mashua, vuno honi Muna Muntu kesi na cihela cakuhuimina.”<verse eid="MAT 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21"/>Kaha naua umo ua vandongisi vendi uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Muene, tahi njiye njikatsinde tate.”<verse eid="MAT 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22"/>Vuno honi Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Njikave, kaha seza vatsi vatsinde vatsi vakuavo.”<verse eid="MAT 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Aholuesa Mankimba Akama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mako4:35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23"/>Kaha omo Yesu uakovelele mu vuato, vandongisi vendi vamukavele. <verse eid="MAT 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24"/>Kaha taleni, kuakatukile mankimba akama cikuma ha cisali, kaha vuato vuakele nakuninganga na mankimba, vuno honi Yesu te nakosa. <verse eid="MAT 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25"/>Kaha vaile nakumuhindula nakuhandeka nguavo, “Tuovole Muene, tuli nakunonga.”<verse eid="MAT 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26"/>Kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Vika muteua, yeni vamala va lutsilielo lualundende?” Ambahoni uakatukile nakutenukila mpunzi na mankimba, kaha aholokele kuluu.<verse eid="MAT 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27"/>Kaha vandongisi vendi valikomokelele cikuma nakuhandeka nguavo, “Muntu uacifua muka ou, uje cipue mpunzi na mankimba vimuononoka!”<verse eid="MAT 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Akanguisa Vamala Vavali vaka Mahamba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mako5:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28"/>Omo Yesu uahetele musinia lia cisali ku cihela ca Ngandalena, ualiuanene na vamala vavali vaje vakele na mahamba tele vahuminina ha vihilo. Kaha omuo ya vutenu vuavo naumo uahi uasele kuhita ngila ije. <verse eid="MAT 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29"/>Kaha vatambekele nguavo, “Utonda kulinga vika netu yove Muna Njambi? Uneja nakutuhana kashitiku oku kanda ntsimbu yetu iheteho ndi?”<verse eid="MAT 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30"/>Kuyehi navo kuakele vutanga vua vangulu vavengi vaje vakele nakulia. <verse eid="MAT 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31"/>Kaha mahamba amulombele nguauo, “Nga utuhumisa, tutavese linga tukakovele mu vutanga vua vangulu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Yeni.” Kaha aje mahamba ahumine nakukakovela mu vutanga vua vangulu. Hajevene vuje vutanga vua vangulu vuoshe vuasikumukile nakushatukila mu cisali. Kaha vuakanongelelemo mu mema.<verse eid="MAT 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33"/>Vaje vantu vaje vakele nakuniunga vangulu vashatukilile mu nganda nakukambulula vije vioshe vamuene navije vialingiuile kuli vaje vamala vaka mahamba. <verse eid="MAT 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34"/>Kaha taleni, vantu voshe vahumine mu nganda vezile nakuliuana na Yesu, kaha omo vamumuene, vamulombele ngeci ahume mu cihela cavo.<verse eid="MAT 8:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu Akanguisa Yala Uakalepa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mako2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1"/>Omo Yesu uakovelele mu vuato, uajavukikile musinia, kaha uayile kuimbo liendi. <verse eid="MAT 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2"/>Kaha hajevene vamunehelelele muka kalepa uakosele ha muhela uendi. Kaha omo Yesu uamuene lutsilielo luavo, uahandekele kuli uje muka kalepa nguendi, “Simpa, munange, vupi vuove vana vusambuesa.”<verse eid="MAT 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3"/>Kaha vamo valongisi va Lishiko valihandekesele umo na mukuavo nguavo, “Ou yala alinakushaula Njambi!”<verse eid="MAT 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4"/>Vuno honi Yesu hakutantekeya viyongola viavo uahandekele nguendi, “Vika muli nakuyonguela viuma via vipi mu mitima yeni? <verse eid="MAT 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5"/>Nkuma cacasi cika kuhandeka nguange, vupi vuove vanavusambuesa, cipue kuhandeka nguange katuka uende? <verse eid="MAT 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6"/>Ngeci mutantekeye ngueni Muna Muntu hali na nzili yakama cikuma hano ha mavu yakusambuesa vupi.” Kaha uahandekele kuli uje muka kalepa nguendi, “Katuka, ambata muhela uove, kaha ya kuimbo!”<verse eid="MAT 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7"/>Kaha uakatukile, nakuya kuimbo. <verse eid="MAT 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8"/>Omo civunga vacimuene, vakele na liova, kaha vashangazalele Njambi, uje uahanene nzili yakama cikuma ku vantu.<verse eid="MAT 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Asana Mateu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mako2:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9"/>Omo Yesu uahumine kuje ku cihela, uamuene yala ivatumbula nguavo Mateu uatumamene mu njivo ya kutambuila lisimo. Kaha uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Njikave.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:9">Kaha uakatukile nakumukava.<verse eid="MAT 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10"/>Omo uatumamene ku mesa mu njivo, kaha vavengi vaka kutambula lisimo na vaka vupi vezile nakutumama hamo na Yesu na vandongisi vendi. <verse eid="MAT 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11"/>Kaha omo Vafaliseo vacimuene, vahandekele kuli vandongisi vendi nguavo, “Vika mulongisi ueni alinakulia na vaka kutambula lisimo na vaka vupi?”<verse eid="MAT 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12"/>Vuno honi omo uavevuile, uahandekele nguendi, “Vakangule kuvekusetela cimbanda, vuno honi kuvanga lika vaka kuvavala. <verse eid="MAT 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13"/>Yemuye mukalilongese vika eci cilumbunuka, ‘Njishunguiya cikeketima, keti cikombelo.’ Muomu kunjezile mukusana vaka vusunga, vuno honi vaka vupi.”<verse eid="MAT 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cihula ca ha kuliumina Kulia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mako2:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14"/>Kaha vandongisi va Iuano muka kumbuitika vezile kuli ikeye nakuhandeka nguavo, “Vika yetu na Vafaliseo tukaliumina kulia, vuno honi vandongisi vove kuvekuliumina kulia?”<verse eid="MAT 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Nkuma vangenzi vaje vali ku ciuano ca vulo vanapande kulila oku liavenia vulo acili navo ndi? Matangua akeja omo uje liavenia vulo vakamuambata hali vakevo ambahoni vakaliumine kulia.<verse eid="MAT 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16"/>“Naumo uahi asa kutongela citope ca ntanga yaiha ha kazaku kalaja, omuo cije citope caciha cikatavula kaje kazaku kaha mukasala mbengua yakama kupulakana mu muje yakele. <verse eid="MAT 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17"/>Naumo uahi asa kuhaka viniu via viha mu vinjenge via vilambu via laja, nga mulinga ngoco kaha vije vinjeke via vilambu vikatavuka, kaha vije viniu vikahitila muangoco na vije vilambu kaha vikapihia, vuno honi viniu via viha vaka vihaka mu vinjeke via vilambu via viha kaha mukulinga ngoco vioshe vivali vikakala muacili.”<verse eid="MAT 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muna Njailosi ua Mumbanda na Mpuevo uje uakuatele ku Cikovelo ca Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mako5:21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18"/>Te Yesu acilinakuhandeka navo, taleni muka kuyula ua Vayunda uezile kuli ikeye nakumutsikamena, uahandekele nguendi, “Munange ua mumbanda natsi hano vene, vuno honi ija nakumusaleka livoko liove, kaha akayoya.”<verse eid="MAT 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19"/>Kaha Yesu uakatukile nakumukava hamo na vandongisi vendi.<verse eid="MAT 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20"/>Kaha taleni, mpuevo uje uayandele ku mushongo ua kuhita maninga ha miaka yakupua likumi na ivali uezile munima yendi kaha uamukuatele ku mukunduilo ua kazaku kendi, <verse eid="MAT 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21"/>omuo uahandekele kuli ikeye vavenia nguendi, “Nga njikuata lika ku kazaku kendi kaha njikanguka.”<verse eid="MAT 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22"/>Omo Yesu uatengulukile uamumuene kaha uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Simpa, munange ua mpuevo, lutsilielo luove luakukanguisa.” Kaha hajevene uje mpuevo uakangukile.<verse eid="MAT 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23"/>Kaha omo Yesu uakovelele mu njivo ya uje mukuluntu ua masualale, uamuene vaje vakakuimba miaso yaha viakutsa na civunga cakele nakulila,<verse eid="MAT 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24"/>Kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Tuhukeni! Omuo ou kanike uampuevo katsile vuno honi nakosa lika.” Kaha vamujolele. <verse eid="MAT 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25"/>Vuno honi omo civunga catuhukile hambanza, uakovelele mukati kaha uakuatele uje kanike ku livoko nakumuhindula, kaha uje kanike uahindukile. <verse eid="MAT 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26"/>Kaha muzimbu ou ualishanduokelele mu mbonge yoshe ije.<verse eid="MAT 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Akanguisa Tupuputua Vavali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27"/>Kaha omo Yesu uahumine kuje, tupuputua vavali vamukavele, vatambekele nguavo, “Tuivuileko cikeketima Muna Ndaviti,”<verse eid="MAT 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28"/>Omo uakovelele mu njivo, vaje tupuputua vavali vezile kuli ikeye, kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Mutsiliela ngueni njasa kucilinga eci ndi?” Kaha vamukumbuluile nguavo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:28">“Eyo Muene.”<verse eid="MAT 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29"/>Ambahoni uakuatele ha mesho avo nakuhandeka nguendi, “Kuya ku lutsilielo lueni cilingiue ngocovene kuli yeni.” <verse eid="MAT 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30"/>Kaha mesho avo emukile, kaha Yesu uavashikile nguendi, “Keti mukalekeko muntu cipue umo.”<verse eid="MAT 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31"/>Vuno honi vaile nakushanduola lutsimo luendi mu mbonge muoshe muje.<verse eid="MAT 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Akanguisa Kaveveve</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32"/>Omo vaje vamala vakele nakuya, kaha kuakele vamo vantu vanehelelele Yesu yala ua kaveveve uje uakele na lihamba. <verse eid="MAT 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33"/>Kaha omo lije lihamba valihumisile, uje yala ua kaveveve uaputukile kuhandeka, kaha vivunga via valikomokelele cikuma nakuhandeka nguavio, “Nacimo cahi cakufua ngue eci cituamona muno mu Isaleli.”<verse eid="MAT 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34"/>Vuno honi Vafaliseo vahandekele nguavo, “Akahumisa mahamba na nzili ya muene ua mahamba.”<verse eid="MAT 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Ovuila Vantu Cikeketima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35"/>Kaha Yesu uendanganene mu vimbonge vioshe na mu membo oshe, uakele nakulongesa mu vinjivo viavo via malombelo nakuambulula muzimbu uacili ua vumuene, uakanguisile mishongo yoshe na mavezi oshe. <verse eid="MAT 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36"/>Omo uamuene vivunga via vantu kaha uavivuililile ngozi, omuo vakele nakulinienga nakuhona viakulinga ngue vampanga vaje vakuhona kaniungi. <verse eid="MAT 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37"/>Kaha uahandekele kuli vandongisi vendi nguendi, “Viakuteja vinapu viavingi vuno honi vaka kupanga vavandende. <verse eid="MAT 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38"/>Nankuma lombeleni kuli Muene ua vaka kuteja linga atume vaka kupanga kuviakuteja viendi.”<verse eid="MAT 9:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10"/>
  <para style="s">Tunganda Likumi na Vavali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mako3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1"/>Kaha Yesu uasanene vandongisi vendi likumi na vavali, kaha uavahanene nzili yakama ha vimbembesi viakujuala, nakuvihumisa, nakukanguisa mishongo yoshe na vaka kuvavala. <verse eid="MAT 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2"/>Mazina a tunganda likumi na vavali aua, uakulivanga Simoni uje ivatumbula nguavo Petulu, na munaina Anduleo, na Tiango muna Zembendeo, na munaina Iuano. <verse eid="MAT 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3"/>Filipu na Mbatolomeo, Tomasi na Mateu muka kutambula lisimu, na Tiango muna Alufeya, na Tandeo, <verse eid="MAT 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4"/>Simoni uaku Kanana, na Yunda Sakaliote uje uendele Yesu vungungu.<verse eid="MAT 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atuma Tunganda likumi na vavali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mako6:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5"/>Kaha Yesu uatumine likumi na vavali, uavashikile nguendi, “Keti muye kuli vaje keti Vayunda, kaha keti mukovele mu mbonge ya Samaliya. <verse eid="MAT 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6"/>Vuno honi yeni ku vampanga vaje vazimbala va mu njivo ya Isaleli. <verse eid="MAT 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7"/>Kaha oku muli nakuya ambululeni ngueni, ‘Vumuene vua muilu vuli muyehi.’ <verse eid="MAT 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8"/>Kanguiseni vaka kuvavala, hinduleni vaka kutsa, kanguiseni vaka mbumba, muhumise mahamba. Muatambuile kuakuhona kufueta, kaha haneni kuakuhona kufuetesa. <verse eid="MAT 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9"/>Keti muambate Ngolinde cipue Siliva cipue vunengu mu vinkombe vieni, <verse eid="MAT 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10"/>keti muambate lipakumuna ha vungezi vueni cipue vikovelo vivali cipue vinkaku, cipue mbueti, omo muka kupanga napande kutambula kulia.<verse eid="MAT 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11"/>“Kaha nganda cipue limbo lioshe mukovela, tondeni muntu iya uje napande ku mitambula muacili, kaha tumameni nendi noho mukahumamo. <verse eid="MAT 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12"/>Omo mukovela mu njivo, menekeni vaje muuanamo. <verse eid="MAT 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13"/>Kaha nga muje mu njivo vanamitambula vuino, ciyulo ceni cikale navo, vuno honi nga kuvamitambuile vuino, kaha ciyulo ceni cimihilukile. <verse eid="MAT 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14"/>Kaha nga kuli umo uje kamitambula cipue kuvuilila ku mezi eni, kaha totomoneni likungu ku viliato vieni, omo muhuma muje mu njivo cipue muje mu nganda. <verse eid="MAT 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15"/>Muavusunga njimileka nguange, ha litangua lia kusompa Njambi akahana kashitiku cikuma ku cihela cije kupulakana Sondoma na Ngomola.<verse eid="MAT 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mapakeso aje hali nakuija</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Mako13:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luka21:12-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16"/>“Taleni, njimituma ngue vampanga hakati ka tungunga, kaha zangameni ngue linoka kaha ononokeni ngue mavembe. <verse eid="MAT 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17"/>Zangameni ku vantu, omuo vakamituala ku vinzango, na kumipupanga mu vinjivo viavo via malombelo. <verse eid="MAT 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18"/>Kaha vakamituala ku vanguvulu na kuli vimiene omuo yange, linga cikapue vukaleho kuli vakevo na kuli vaje keti Vayunda. <verse eid="MAT 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19"/>Omo vamituala, keti mulishoshomuene mumuka handekela cipue vimukahandeka, ha hola ije. <verse eid="MAT 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20"/>Omuo keti yeni mukahandeka, vuno honi Cimbembesi ca Ishueni cikahandeka muli yeni.<verse eid="MAT 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21"/>“Muanaye akatuala munaina mukutsa, kaha ishe na munendi, kaha vana vakaluisa visemi vavo na kuvatsiha. <verse eid="MAT 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22"/>Kaha vakamizinda voshe omuo ya lizina liange. Vuno honi uje akakateya na kumamanusuilo akovoka. <verse eid="MAT 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23"/>Omo vamiyandesa mu mbonge imo, teueleni mukuavo, muavusunga njimileka nguange kumukendangana mu vimbonge vioshe ya Isaleli ntsimbu kanda muna muntu eja.<verse eid="MAT 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24"/>“Ndongisi kasa kupulakana mulongisi uendi, cipue ngamba kupulakana muene yendi. <verse eid="MAT 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25"/>Capande ngeci ndongisi kupua ngue mulongisi uendi, na ngamba kupua ngue muene yendi. Nga vanatumbula muene ua njivo nguavo Mbelezembulu, kaha cikapua vati ku vaka njivo yendi.<verse eid="MAT 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Uje itunapande kuteua</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Luka12:2-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26"/>“Kaha keti mukale na liova navo, omuo kukuesi civanafuiki cikahona kucifukula, cipue cakushueka cikahona kucitantekeya. <verse eid="MAT 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27"/>Vinjimileka mu milima mu vihandeke mu ceke, kaha vije vimuvua vayeveta vihandekeleni helu lia njivo. <verse eid="MAT 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28"/>Kaha keti muteue vaje vatsiha muvila vuno honi kuvasa kutsiha muono, vuno honi teueni uje asa kunongesa muono na muvila mu ngehena. <verse eid="MAT 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29"/>Nkuma keti tumpiasa vavali vakavalandesa ha muuaya uaya umo ndi? Vuno honi naumo uavo uahi akau ha mavu kuakuhona cizango ca Ishueni. <verse eid="MAT 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30"/>Vuno honi yeni cipue vinkambu via ku mutue ueni vanavitanda. <verse eid="MAT 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31"/>Keti muteue, nankuma yeni muli naseho yakama kupulakana tumpiasa vavengi.<verse eid="MAT 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kutsiliela Yesu cipue Kumuviana ku mesho a Vantu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:8-9">Luka12:8-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32"/>“Uoshe uje akanjihandeka hakati ka vantu, nange naua njikamuhandeka kuli Tate uje hali muilu, <verse eid="MAT 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33"/>vuno honi uoshe uje akanjiviana ku mesho a vantu, nange naua njikamuviana ku mesho a Tate uje hali muilu.<verse eid="MAT 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Keti Ciyulo vuno honi Nzita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luka12:51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34"/>“Keti musinganieke ngueni njinanehe ciyulo ha mavu, kunjezile nakuneha ciyulo, vuno honi mukuale. <verse eid="MAT 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35"/>Njineja nakulinga muana aluise ishe, kaha muana uampuevo aluisa vaina, vaina mueno aluise vanayemueno, <verse eid="MAT 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36"/>Kaha vitozi va muntu vakapua vavushoko vendi.<verse eid="MAT 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37"/>“Uoshe uje azanga ishe cipue ina cikuma kupulakana yange kaha kanjipandele, kaha uoshe uje azanga munendi ua yala cipue uampuevo cikuma kupulakana yange kaha kanjipandele, <verse eid="MAT 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38"/>kaha uoshe uje kambata cilindakano cendi nakuhona kunjikava kaha kanjipandele. <verse eid="MAT 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39"/>Kaha uoshe uje atonda muono uendi akauzimbalesa, kaha na uoshe uje a zimbalesa muono uendi omuo yange akau uana.<verse eid="MAT 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Citsatselo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:41">Mako9:41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40"/>“Uoshe uje amitambula natambula yange, kaha uoshe uje anjitambula natambula uje uanjitumine. <verse eid="MAT 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41"/>Kaha uoshe uje akatambula kananguizi omuo ikeye kananguizi akatambula vuana vua kananguizi, kaha uoshe uje akatambula yala ua vusunga omuo ikeye napu yala ua vusunga akatambula vuana vua yala ua vusunga. <verse eid="MAT 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42"/>Kaha uoshe uje ahana kuli umo uava vanike vavandende cipue nganja ya mema akutontola omuo napu ndongisi, muavusunga njihandeka kuli yeni nguange kakazimbalesaho vuana vuendi.”<verse eid="MAT 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11"/>
  <para style="s">Iuano Muka Kumbuitika Atuma Vandongisi vendi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luka7:18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1"/>Omo Yesu uamanusuile kushika vandongisi vendi likumi na vavali, uahumine kuje kaha uaile nakulongesa nakuambulula mu vinganda viavo.<verse eid="MAT 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2"/>Honi omo Iuano te hali mu kamenga uevuile vije vialingile Kilistu, kaha uatumine vandongisi vendi na mezi aua nguendi <verse eid="MAT 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3"/>yemuye mukahandeke kuli ikeye nguendi, “Yove uje hali nakuija indi tuvandamene mukuavo naua?”<verse eid="MAT 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4"/>Kaha Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Yemuye mukaleke Iuano vije munevu navije munamono, <verse eid="MAT 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5"/>tupuputua vamona na vilema venda, vaka mbumba vanajele na tuveveve vevua, vatsi vasanguka, kaha na vihutu vali nakuvambuluila muzimbu uacili. <verse eid="MAT 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6"/>Nakuisuliua uje katsutsuka omuo yange.”<verse eid="MAT 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7"/>Omo vakele nakuya, Yesu uaputukile kuhandeka ku civunga via Iuano nguendi, “Vika muaile mukumona mu mpambo? Muaile mukumona lihongo litepuzoka na mpunzi ndi? <verse eid="MAT 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8"/>Indi vika honi muaililile kuje? Muaile mukumona muntu nazala vuzalo vuasenga ndi? Taleni, vaje vazala vuzalo vuasenga vakala mu mapela a muene. <verse eid="MAT 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9"/>Vika muaililile kuje? Muaile mukumona kananguizi ndi? Eyo, njimileka nguange muakamuene viavingi kupulakana kananguizi. <verse eid="MAT 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10"/>Ou ikeye vene uje ivasonekele nguavo, ‘Tala njikatuma kanganda kange kulutue luove, uje akavuahesa ngila yove. <verse eid="MAT 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11"/>Muavusunga njimileka nguange, hhakati ka vaje vanasemuka ku mpuevo naumo uahi uakama nahumuho kupulakana Iuano muka kumbuitika, vuno honi uoshe uje alikehesa mu vumuene vua muilu napu uakama kupulakana ikeye. <verse eid="MAT 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12"/>Kuhuma ku matangua a Iuano muka kumbuitika kuheta kulelo lino, vumuene vua muilu vunayanda cikuma kaha vantu vakukaluua mitima vanavuambata nampindangano. <verse eid="MAT 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13"/>Omuo voshe tunanguizi va Njambi na valongisi va mashiko vahandekele vunanguizi noho Iuano, <verse eid="MAT 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14"/>kaha nga mutonda kucitava, Iuano ikeye Eliya uje akeja. <verse eid="MAT 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15"/>Uoshe uje hali na matuitui evue.<verse eid="MAT 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16"/>“Vuno honi vika njasa kusetekesa na vantu valelo? Njivasetekesa ngue vanike vaje vanatumama ku cihela ca kulandesela oku valisana muvakehela nguavo, <verse eid="MAT 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17"/>‘Tuamiohieselele miaso, vuno honi kumuakinine, tuamimbilile miaso ya ha kutsa vuno honi kumualilile.’ <verse eid="MAT 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18"/>Omuo Iuano uezile kuakuhona kulia cipue kunua, kaha vahandekele nguavo, ‘Ali na lihamba!’ <verse eid="MAT 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19"/>Kaha omo Muna Muntu uezile oku alia na kunua, kaha vahandeka nguavo, ‘Mutaleni uamutupu na cipenda, kavusamba ua vaka kutambula lisimu na vaka vupi!’ Vuno honi mana a Njambi vanaashulisisa na vilinga viendi.”<verse eid="MAT 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vinganda via Kuhona Kutsiliela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luka10:13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20"/>Kaha Yesu uaputukile kutenuka mu vinganda muje mualingile cikuma vikomoueso viendi, omuo kuvatengulukile. <verse eid="MAT 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21"/>“Cisingo kuli yove Kolazini! Cisingo kuli yove Mbetesainda! Omuo nga vije vikomoueso vialingiuile muli yeni, ngue vialingiuililile mu Tile na Sindone ngue vatengulukile laja mukuzala vinjeke naku likuita muto. <verse eid="MAT 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22"/>Vuno honi njimileka nguange, ha litangua lia kusompa Njambi akevuila cikeketima Tile na Sindone kupulakana yeni. <verse eid="MAT 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23"/>Kaha yove Kapenauma, nkuma uatondele kulijundula yove vavenia muilu ndi? Houe, vakakuneha ha mavu mu ngehena. Omuo nga vikomoueso vije vialingiuile kuli yove ngue vialingiuililile mu Sondoma, ngue nganda ije hanga kuicili na lelo lino. <verse eid="MAT 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24"/>Vuno honi njimileka nguange, ha litangua lia kusompa Njambi akevuila cikeketima lifuti lia Sondoma kupulakana yove.”<verse eid="MAT 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ijeni kuli Yange Muuane kuhuima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luka10:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25"/>Kaha ha ntsimbu ije Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Njitsantsela kuli yove Tate, Muene ua muilu na mavu, omuo unashueke evi viuma kuli vaka mana na vaka kulilongesa, kaha unavisholola ku vanike vavandende. <verse eid="MAT 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26"/>Eyo Tate, omuo mukemo muuatondele linga cilingiue.<verse eid="MAT 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27"/>“Viuma vioshe Tate nanjihanavio, kaha naumo uahi atantekeya Muana kuvanga lika Ishe, kaha naua naumo uahi atantekeya Ishe kuvanga lika Muana na kuli vaje Muana ahangula linga avashololueye.<verse eid="MAT 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28"/>“Ijeni kuli yange yeni voshe vaje vanahono nakuambata viteli viakulema, kaha njikamihana kuhuima. <verse eid="MAT 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29"/>Lituikeni mutiyo uange, kaha lilongeseni kuli yange omuo yange njapua uakulikehesa nakulihana, kaha mukauana kuhuima mu miono yeni. <verse eid="MAT 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30"/>Omuo mutiyo uange uapua ua uasi, kaha na citeli cange capua ca cehu.”<verse eid="MAT 11:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12"/>
  <para style="s">Cihula ca ha Litangua lia Sapalalo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mako2:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1"/>Ha ntsimbu ije Yesu uahitile mu mehia a tiliku ha litangua lia Sapalalo. Vandongisi vendi vatsile njala, kaha vaputukile kutomona mitue ya tiliku nakulia. <verse eid="MAT 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2"/>Vuno honi omo Vafaliseo vacimuene vahandekele kuli Yesu nguavo, “Tala vandongisi vove valinakulinga vije lishiko kulitavesa kulinga ha litangua lia Sapalalo.”<verse eid="MAT 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3"/>Kaha Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Nkuma kumuatandele vije Ndaviti ualingile na vaje vakele navo omo vatsile njala, <verse eid="MAT 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4"/>muje muakovelele mu njivo ya Njambi nakulia mbolo ije ivalambuile kuli Njambi, cije kucapuile lishiko kuli ikeye ku ilia cipue vaje vakele navo, vuno honi kuvanga lika tusasendote ndi? <verse eid="MAT 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5"/>Cipue nkuma kumuatandele mu lishiko vati muje ha litangua lia Sapalalo tusasendote mu Njivo ya Njambi muvapokuele mashiko a ha litangua lia Sapalalo, vuno honi kuvakele na mulonga ndi? <verse eid="MAT 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6"/>Njimileka nguange, cuma cakama kupulakana njivo ya Njambi cino cili kuno. <verse eid="MAT 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7"/>Kaha nga muatantekeya vika evi vilumbununa, ‘Njatonda cikeketima, keti nkombelo,’ ngue kumuahisile vaje kuvesi na mulonga. <verse eid="MAT 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8"/>Omuo Muna Muntu ikeye Muene ua litangua lia Sapalalo.”<verse eid="MAT 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Akanguisa Yala ua Kusekua Livoko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mako3:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9"/>Yesu uahumine ku cihela cije kaha uaile nakukakovela mu njivo ya malombelo. <verse eid="MAT 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10"/>Kaha hajevene kuakele yala uakusekua livoko, kaha vehuile Yesu nguavo, “Nkuma lishiko litavesa kukanguisa ha litangua lia Sapalalo ndi?” Vatondele linga vamuvangeyeleho.<verse eid="MAT 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Nga umo haliyeni hali na mpanga kaha auila mu cina ha litangua lia sapalalo, nkuma kumuasa kumuhumisamo ndi? <verse eid="MAT 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12"/>Nkuma muntu kapuile uaseho cikuma kupulakana mpanga! Nankuma, cinapande kuya ku lishiko kulinga cacili ha litangua lia Sapalalo.” <verse eid="MAT 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13"/>Ambahoni uahandekele kuli uje yala nguendi, “Olola livoko liove.” Kaha uje yala uoluele livoko liendi, kaha liolokele kupua hamo nalikuavo.<verse eid="MAT 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14"/>Vuno honi Vafaliseo vatuhukilemo kaha vakatumbile vutumbe muje vati vasa kutsihila Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ngamba Uakuhangula kuli Njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15"/>Vuno honi Yesu uatantekeyele vutumbe vuavo, kaha uahumineko. Kaha vavengi vamukavele, kaha voshe uavakanguisile. <verse eid="MAT 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16"/>Kaha uavashikile nguendi keti vamutsimanese. <verse eid="MAT 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17"/>Eci capuile linga vilishulisise vije viahandekele kananguizi ua Njambi Isaya nguendi,<verse eid="MAT 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18"/>“Taleni ngamba yange injinahangula,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">uje injazanga kaha muli ikeye muono uange uvuahelela.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">Njikahaka Cimbembesi cange hali ikeye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">Kaha akahandeka vusunga kuli vaje keti Vayunda.<verse eid="MAT 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19"/>Kakakalaho na vimpata cipue kulila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:19">kaha na umo uahi akevua lizi liendi mu vitapalo.<verse eid="MAT 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20"/>Kakapokolaho lihongo liakuhenga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">Kakazimiho tuhia tuje tucili nakutuhuisa vuisi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">Kuvanga noho nanehe vusunga ku kuhiana.”<verse eid="MAT 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21"/>Kaha mu lizina liendi mukemo vakatsiliela vaje keti Vayunda.<verse eid="MAT 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Mbelezembulu Muene ua Vimbembesi via Vipi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Mako3:20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka11:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22"/>Ambahoni vantu vamo vanehelele Yesu yala uje ua kapuputua nakuhona kuhandeka uje uakele na lihamba kaha uamukanguisile, kaha uje yala ua kaveveve uaputukile kuhandeka nakumona. <verse eid="MAT 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23"/>Kaha vantu voshe valikomokelele cikuma nakuhandeka nguavo, “Nkuma ou keti ikeye muna Ndaviti ndi?”<verse eid="MAT 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24"/>Vuno honi omo Vafaliseo vaviuvuile vahandekele nguavo, “Kuvanga lika na nzili ya Mbelezembulu muene ua mahamba, ikeyo ou yala yalinakuhumisa nayo mahamba.”<verse eid="MAT 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25"/>Yesu uatantekeyele visinganieka viavo kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Vumuene vuoshe vuje vukalitepe hhakati nakuliluisa vukalipihisa, naimo yahi nganda cipue njivo vije vililuisa vikevio vavenia vikemana. <verse eid="MAT 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26"/>Kaha nga satana ahumisa mukuavo satana, kaha nalitepe hhakati ikeye vavenia, kaha vatihoni vumuene vuendi vukakola? <verse eid="MAT 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27"/>Kaha nga njikahumisa mahamba na nzili ya Mbelezembulu, nkuma na nzili yeya vana veni vaka ahumisa? Nankuma vakevo vakamisompa. <verse eid="MAT 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28"/>Vuno honi nga njikalikuasesa Cimbembesi ua Njambi mukuhumisa mahamba, kaha vumuene vua Njambi vuneja hali yeni.<verse eid="MAT 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29"/>“Cipue vatihoni muntu asa kukovela mu njivo ya yala uanzili nakuambata viuma viendi, nkuma keti tahi akuta uje yala uanzili ndi? Ambahoni apukule njivo yendi.<verse eid="MAT 12:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30"/>“Uje kesi nange anjiluisa, uje kalipandakana nange ashandola. <verse eid="MAT 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31"/>Nankuma njimileka nguange, vupi vuoshe nakushaula coshe ca vantu vakavikonekela, vuno honi kushaula Cimbembesi kuvaka cikonekela. <verse eid="MAT 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32"/>Kaha uoshe uje ahandeka lizi lia kuluisa Muna Muntu vakamukonekela, Vuno honi uoshe uje ahandeka viakuluisa Cimbembesi Uakulela kuvaka mukonekela cipue mu miaka ino cipue mu miaka ije ilinakuija.<verse eid="MAT 12:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muti na Vushuka vuao</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luka6:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33"/>“Kukala na vushuka vuacili kuvanga muti uao upua ua cili, cipue kukala na muti ua upi na vushuka vuao vupua vua upi, omuo muti vakautantekeya kuvushuka vuauo. <verse eid="MAT 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34"/>Yeni vana vamanoka, muasa kuhandeka vati viacili omo yeni muapua mu vaka vupi? Omuo vije viashula ku mutima vikevio kanua kakahandeka. <verse eid="MAT 12:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35"/>Yala uacili akahumisa vuima viacili vije viakatulika mu citulikilo cendi ca cili, kaha yala ua mupi akahumisa viuma via vipi mu citulikilo cendi ca cipi.<verse eid="MAT 12:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36"/>“Njimileka nguange, ha litangua lia kusompa vantu vaka vasompa kuya ku mezi avo aje avakahandeka akuhona seho, <verse eid="MAT 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37"/>omuo kuya ku mezi ove mukemo muvaka kusompa kaha kuya ku mezi ove akeo avakakuhisa nao.”<verse eid="MAT 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cihula ca Cimueso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Mako8:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luka11:29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38"/>Ambahoni vamo valongisi va mezi na Vafaliseo vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, “Mulongisi tutonda yove linga utulingileko cimueso.”<verse eid="MAT 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39"/>Vuno honi uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Vantu vavupi na vupangala vantsimbu ino vakevo vatonda cimueso, vuno honi nacimo cahi cimueso civakavahana kuvanga lika cimueso ca kananguizi ua Njambi Yona. <verse eid="MAT 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40"/>Omuo Yona uakele muzimo lia intsi ha matangua atatu na matsiki atatu, mucifua cimo vene na Muna Muntu akakala mu vukalo vua vatsi ha matangua atatu na matsiki atatu. <verse eid="MAT 12:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41"/>Vantu vaku Ninive vakemana ha litangua lia kusompa na vantu vantsimbu ino kaha vaka vahisa, omuo vatengulukile ha kuambulula ca Yona, kaha taleni cuma cakama cikuma kupulakana Yona cino cili kuno. <verse eid="MAT 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42"/>Muene ua mpuevo uaku Shemba akemana ha litangua lia kusompa na vantu vantsimbu ino nakuvahisa, omuo uahumine kuntsongo ya cifuti kuija nakuvuilila mana a Solomoni, kaha taleni umo uakama kupulakana Solomoni uno hali kuno.<verse eid="MAT 12:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhiluka kua Cimbembesi Cacipi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luka11:24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43"/>“Omo cimbembesi cacipi cihuma muli muntu, cikahiti mu vindinda kutonda kuakuhuimina, vuno honi kucekuuana cipue hamo. <verse eid="MAT 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44"/>Ambahoni cihandeka nguaco ‘Njihilukila ku njivo yange kuje njahuminine.’ Kaha omo cihiluka ciuana ije njivo mupulungua, muakukomba nakuivuahesa muje muinapande kukelamo. <verse eid="MAT 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45"/>Ambahoni ciya nakuambata vikuavo vimbembsi vitanu na vivali vije via vipi cikuma kupulakana cikeco, kaha vakovelamo nakukakalamo, kaha cifua ca uje yala ca mamanusuilo cikapua cacipi kupulakana caha kulivanga. Omu mukemo vene mu vakafua na vantu vantsimbu ino.”<verse eid="MAT 12:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vaina ya Yesu na Vamunaina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mako3:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46"/>Tele Yesu acili nakuhandeka ku vantu, taleni vaina na vamunaina vemanene hambanza, vatondele linga vahandeka nendi. <verse eid="MAT 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47"/>Kaha umo ua vantu vaje kuje uamulekele nguendi, “Tala, vanoko na vamuanoko vanemana hambanza vatonda kuhandeka nove.”<verse eid="MAT 12:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48"/>Vuno honi Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Iya vanana, kaha iya naua vamuanetu?” <verse eid="MAT 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49"/>Kaha uoluele livoko liendi kuli vandongisi vendi nakuhandeka nguendi, “Ava vakevo vanana na vamuanetu! <verse eid="MAT 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50"/>Omuo uoshe uje alinga cizango ca Tate ua muilu ikeye napu muanetu ua yala na uampuevo na nana.”<verse eid="MAT 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13"/>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca Muka Kukuva</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mako4:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luka8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1"/>Ha Litangua lije vene, Yesu uahumine mu njivo kaha uaile nakukatumama ku mukulo ua cisali. <verse eid="MAT 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2"/>Kaha vivunga viakama viezile kuli ikeye nakumuzengeleka, nankuma uakovelele mu vuato nakukatumama, kaha civunga coshe cemanene ha ntunda. <verse eid="MAT 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3"/>Kaha uavalekele viuma viavingi mukulikuasesa visimo nguendi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:3">“Muka kukuva uaile nakukuva. <verse eid="MAT 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4"/>Kaha omo uakele nakukuva vimbuto vimo viauililile ku mukulo ua ngila, kaha tuzila vezile nakuvilia. <verse eid="MAT 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5"/>Kaha vimbuto vikuavo viauililile ha mavue aje kuhakele livu lialingi, kaha hajevene viasokele, omuo kuhakele livu lia lingi. <verse eid="MAT 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6"/>Vuno honi omo litangua liatuhukile kaha vije vimbuto viajujuamene, kaha omuo mizi yavio kuyakovelele cikuma mu livu, kaha vije vimbuto viomine. <verse eid="MAT 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7"/>Vimbuto vikuavo viauililile hhakati ka mingonga, kaha ije mingonga yakolele nakuvituva. <verse eid="MAT 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8"/>Vimbuto vikuavo viauililile ha mavu acili kaha viemine muacili, vimo vimbuto vihita, vimo viemine vimbuto makumi atanu na limo, kaha vikuavo naua viemine vimbuto makumi atatu kupulakana vije vivakunine. <verse eid="MAT 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9"/>Uoshe uje hali na matuitui ovue.”<verse eid="MAT 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vutumbe vua Visimo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mako4:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luka8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10"/>Ambahoni vandongisi vezile kuli Yesu nakuhandeka nguavo, “Vika honi ukahandekela navo mu visimo?”<verse eid="MAT 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11"/>Kaha uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Yeni vanamihana kutantekeya vushueke vua vumuene vua muilu, vuno honi kuli vakevo kuvavahanenevuo. <verse eid="MAT 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12"/>Omuo uoshe uje alinavio vakamuvuezelako vikuavo naua, kaha akakala na viavingi, vuno honi uje kesi cipue nacimo, cipue cije cali naco vakamuniekaco. <verse eid="MAT 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13"/>Eci cikeco canehesa linga njihandeke navo mu visimo omuo vakevo vamona, vuno honi kuvamonesesa, kaha vovua, vuno honi kuvevuisisa. <verse eid="MAT 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14"/>Cilivene kuli vakevo vinalishulisisa vije viahandekele kananguizi ua Njambi Isaya nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">“‘Cilivene mukevua vuno honi kumukevuisisa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:14">kaha cilivene mukamona vuno honi kumukamonesesa.<verse eid="MAT 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15"/>Omuo mitima yava vantu inahono mana, kaha na matuitui avo anaziki, kaha na mesho avo vana azimi, keti ngoconi mesho avo akamona kaha na matuitui avo akevua, kaha na mitima yavo ikevuisisa, nakutengulukila kuli yange linga njivakanguise.’<verse eid="MAT 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16"/>“Vuno honi anakuisuliua mesho eni omuo amona, na matuitui eni, omuo ovua. <verse eid="MAT 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17"/>Muavusunga njihandeka kuli yeni nguange, tunanguizi va Njambi va Njambi vavengi na vantu va vusunga, vatondele kumona cikuma evi vimuli nakumona, vuno honi kuvavimuene, nakuivua vije vimulinakuivua, vuno honi kuvaviuvuile.<verse eid="MAT 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Alumbununa Cisimo ca Muka Kukuva</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mako4:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18"/>“Ambahoni ivuilileni cisimo ca uje muka kukuva. <verse eid="MAT 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19"/>Omuo uoshe uje ovua lizi lia vumuene kaha kaliuvuisisa, kaha uje muka vupi eja nakuambata vije vivanakuvu mu mutima uendi, eyi ikeyo mbuto ije ivakuvile ku mukulo uangila. <verse eid="MAT 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20"/>Kaha mbuto ije ivakuvile ha mavue, ou ikeye uje ovua lizi kaha hajevene alitambula nanzolela, <verse eid="MAT 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21"/>vuno honi kuliesi na mizi muli ikeye, kaha likala lika muka ntsimbu kandende. Kaha omo tuyando cipue mapakeso vija omuo ya lizi, kaha hajevene kalikavangeya. <verse eid="MAT 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22"/>Kaha vimbuto vije vivakuvile ha mingonga, ou ikeye uje ovua lizi, vuno honi omo ha kuzanga via ha mavu nakuzanga vufuko vua mavu kaha vikatuva lije lizi, kaha kulikemi vushuka. <verse eid="MAT 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23"/>Kaha ije mbuto ivakuvile ha mavu acili, ou ikeye uje ovua lizi nakulivuisisa, ikeye cilivene akema vushuka vavuingi vuakupua vimo vimbuto vihita, vimo, vikuavo viemine makumi atanu na limo, kaha vikuavo naua viemine makumi atatu kupulakana vije vivakuvile.”<verse eid="MAT 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca Shaku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24"/>Kaha Yesu uavatelele cisimo cikuavo naua nguendi, “Vumuene vua muilu tuhasa kuvuesekesa ngue yala uje uakuvile mbuto yacili mu lihia liendi, <verse eid="MAT 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25"/>vuno honi tele vantu vanakosa, citozi cendi uezile nakukuva shaku muje mu lihia lia tiliku, kaha uaile. <verse eid="MAT 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26"/>Omo ije tiliku yakolele nakuhaka vinona ambahoni naikeyo ije shaku yasholokele. <verse eid="MAT 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27"/>Kaha vaje vangamba vendi vezile kuli ikeye nakumuleka nguavo, ‘Muene nkuma kuuakunine lika mbuto yacili mu lihia liove ndi? Kaha cineja vati honi linga mukale naua na shaku?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28"/>Kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, ‘Kuli citozi uje nalingi eci.’ Kaha vaje vangamba vendi vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, ‘Nkuma utonda linga tuye tukaitukulemo ndi?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29"/>Vuno honi uavakumbuluile nguendi, ‘Kuahi!’ Omuo muje mu mukaitukulamo ije shaku hamo mukatukuila kumo na tiliku. <verse eid="MAT 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30"/>Vieceleni vioshe linga vikole kuvanga noho ha ntsimbu yakuteja, kaha ha ntsimbu yakuteja njikaleka vaka kuteja nguange, ‘Tukulenimo tahi shaku muikute mikuta, kaha itsimikeni, vuno honi kungululeni tiliku nakuihaka mu cishete cange.’”<verse eid="MAT 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca Mbuto ya Musalata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mako4:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luka13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31"/>Kaha Yesu uavatelele cisimo cikuavo naua nguendi, “Vumuene vua muilu vunapu ngue nona ya mbuto ya musalata ije muntu uambatele nakukuna mu lihia liendi. <verse eid="MAT 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32"/>Yapua yaindende cikuma ku vimbuto vioshe, vuno honi omo ikola ikapu ciputa cakama na kukola kupua muti, nankuma tuzila va muilu vakeja nakutungila mashua ha mitango yauo.”<verse eid="MAT 13:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca Cimbaluila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luka13:20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33"/>Kaha Yesu uavatelele naua cisimo cikuavo nguendi, “Vumuene vua muilu vuapua ngue cimbaluila cije mpuevo uambatele nakucishingasanena ha lilonga haje hakele vinganja vitatu via vunga vua tiliku kuvanga noho vioshe viafutunukile.”<verse eid="MAT 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vika Yesu Akalikuasesela Visimo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Mako4:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34"/>Vioshe evi Yesu uavihandekele ku vivunga mu visimo, cilivene nacimo cahi cahandekele kuli vakevo kuakuhona kulikuasesa cisimo. <verse eid="MAT 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35"/>Eci capuile kushulisisa vije viahandekele kananguizi ua Njambi nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">“Njikafukula kanua kange mu visimo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:35">Njikahande vioshe vije vialishueka hume ha luvula lua mavu.”<verse eid="MAT 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Alumbununa Cisimo ca Shaku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36"/>Ambahoni Yesu uasezele civunga nakuya mu njivo kaha vandongisi vendi vezile kuli ikeye nakuhandeka nguavo, “Tulumbunuine cisimo ca shaku ya mu lihia.”<verse eid="MAT 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37"/>Kaha uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Uoshe uje akuna mbuto yacili napu Muna Muntu. <verse eid="MAT 13:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38"/>Lihia likelio mavu, kaha mbuto ije yacili ilumbununa vana va vumuene, kaha naije shaku inapu vana va muka vupi, <verse eid="MAT 13:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39"/>kaha uje citozi uje uaikuninemo ikeye napu Satana. Kaha kuteja cikeco kuhua ca mavu, kaha vaka kuteja vakevo tungelo. <verse eid="MAT 13:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40"/>Ngue mujevene muvaka kungungulula shaku nakuitsimika na tuhia, mukemovene mu cikafua naku mamanusuililo a mavu. <verse eid="MAT 13:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41"/>Muna Muntu akatuma tungelo vendi, kaha vaka kunguluila hamo vije vikanehesa vupi navaje vakalingi vupi mu vumuene vuendi, <verse eid="MAT 13:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42"/>nakuvombila mu litende lia tuhia, kuje vantu vaka lila nakulishumanga ku mazo avo. <verse eid="MAT 13:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43"/>Ambahoni vaka vusunga vakaviakuma ngue litangua mu vumuene vua Ishavo, uoshe uje hali na matuitui ovue.<verse eid="MAT 13:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca Vufuko Vuakushueka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44"/>“Vumuene vua muilu vunapu ngue vufuko vuakushueka mu lihia, vuje omo muntu avuuana kaha avushueka naua ambahoni hakuvuahelela cendi aya nakukalandesa vioshe vije alinavio kaha alanda lije lihia.<verse eid="MAT 13:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca Vusanga vua Seho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45"/>“Naua vumuene vua muilu vunapu ngue muntu uje muka kulandesa uje atonda vusanga vuacili, <verse eid="MAT 13:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46"/>uje omo auana vusanga vumo vua seho yakama, kaha aya nakukalandesa vioshe vije alinavio kaha akavulanda.<verse eid="MAT 13:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca Vuanda vua Kuta Vatsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47"/>“Naua vumuene vua muilu vunapu ngue vuanda vua kuta vatsi vuje vuvanate mu cisali kaha vutsiha muyati uoshe ua vatsi, <verse eid="MAT 13:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48"/>omo vuashulile vamala vavukokelele ha ntunda kaha vatumamene nakuhangulamo vatsi vacili nakuvahaka mu mitonga yavo vuno honi vombilile vaje vakupihia. <verse eid="MAT 13:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49"/>Nankuma omu mukemo mucikafua naku mamanusuilo a mavu. Tungelo vakeja nakutepesa vaka vupi ku vaka vusunga, <verse eid="MAT 13:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50"/>nakuvombila mu litende lia tuhia, kuje vantu vakalila nakulishumanga ku mazo avo.<verse eid="MAT 13:50"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vusunga vua Vuha novu vua Laja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51"/>“Yesu uavehuile nguendi, nkuma munoviuvuisisa viuma vioshe evi ndi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:51">Kaha vamukumbuluile nguavo, “Eyo.”<verse eid="MAT 13:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52"/>Kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Nankuma uoshe mulongisi ua mashiko uje ivalongesele via vumuene vua muilu napu ngue uje vavenia njivo, uje ahumisa vufuko vuendi vua laja novu vua vuha mu citulikilo cendi.”<verse eid="MAT 13:52"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Vamuviana ku Nazaleta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mako6:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53"/>Kaha omo Yesu uamanusuile kuta vije visimo, uahumineko kuje, <verse eid="MAT 13:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54"/>nakuya ku cifuti cendi nakukavalongesa mu njivo yavo ya malombelo, kaha vaje voshe vamuvuile vali komokelele cikuma nakuhandeka nguavo, “Nkuma kuli ou yala kuanauana mana aua na vikomoueso evi? <verse eid="MAT 13:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55"/>Nkuma ou keti ikeye muna uje muka kushonga ndi? Nkuma vaina keti Maliya? Nkuma vamunaina keti Tiango, na Yosefa, na Simoni na Yunda ndi? <verse eid="MAT 13:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56"/>Nkuma vashongo vendi voshe va vampuevo keti ava tuli hamo navo ndi? Nkuma kuli honi ou yala nauana vioshe evi?” <verse eid="MAT 13:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57"/>Kaha vamuvianene.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:57">Vuno honi Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Kananguizi ua Njambi kuvekumusingimika mu cifuti cendi cipue muimbo liendi kuvanga lika kueka.” <verse eid="MAT 13:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58"/>Kaha kalingilileko vikomoueso kuje omuo ya kuhona kutsiliela cavo.<verse eid="MAT 13:58"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14"/>
  <para style="s">Kutsa ca Iuano Muka Kumbuitika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mako6:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1"/>Ha ntsimbu ije muene Helonde omo uevuile lutsimo lua Yesu, <verse eid="MAT 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2"/>kaha uahandekele kuli vangamba vendi nguendi, “Ou ikeye Iuano muka kumbuitika, vanamusangula ku vatsi, mukemo evi vinzili vili nakupanga muli ikeye.”<verse eid="MAT 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3"/>Omuo Helonde uakuatele Iuano nakumukuta nakumuhaka mu kamenga, omuo ya mulonga ua Helondiya mpuevo ya munaina Filipu, <verse eid="MAT 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4"/>omuo Iuano uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Kuya ku lishiko yove kuuapandele kumuambata.” <verse eid="MAT 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5"/>Cipue vene uatondele kumutsiha, vuno honi kamutsihile uateuele vantu, omuo vamuivuile nguavo uapuile kananguizi ua Njambi.<verse eid="MAT 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6"/>Omo litangua lia kuanuka kusemuka ca Helonde liahetele, muna Helondiya uampuevo uakinine hhakati ka civunga ca vantu kaha uavuahelesele Helonde, <verse eid="MAT 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7"/>kaha uamukulahesele nakulisinga kumuhana vioshe viatondele kulomba.<verse eid="MAT 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8"/>Omuo vaina vamusindiiye, kaha ualombele nguendi, “Njihane mutue ua Iuano muka kumbuitika ha lilonga.”<verse eid="MAT 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9"/>Vuno honi muene uovuile vusiua, vuno honi omuo hakulisinga cendi na hali vangezi vendi, kaha uashikile linga vamuhaneuo, <verse eid="MAT 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10"/>uatumine kukateta mutue ua Iuano mu kamenga. <verse eid="MAT 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11"/>Kaha mutue uendi vaunehele ha lilonga nakuuhana kuli muana mpuevo, kaha uauhanene vaina. <verse eid="MAT 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12"/>Kaha vandongisi va Iuano vezile nakuambata muvila uendi nakuutsinda, kaha vaile nakulekesa Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Alisa Vamala Vakupua Makulukazi Atanu (5, 0 0 0)</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mako6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Iuano6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13"/>Honi omo Yesu uovuile eci, uahumine kuje mu vuato kaha uaile kumutambela ua likaliendi. Vuno honi omo vivunga vievuile eci, viamukavele ha mavu kuhuma ku vimbonge. <verse eid="MAT 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14"/>Omuo Yesu uaile ha ntunda uamuene civunga cakama, kaha uavovuililile ngozi, kaha uavakanguisile ku mishongo yavo.<verse eid="MAT 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15"/>Omo capuile cinguezi, vandongisi va Yesu vezile kuli ikeye nakuhandeka nguavo, “Cino cinapu cihela ca kuholoka, kaha litangua honi liatoko, kaha leka vivunga linga vaye ku membo linga vakalilandele viakulia vakevo vavenia.”<verse eid="MAT 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Kuvapandele kuya, vahaneni vimo valie.”<verse eid="MAT 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17"/>Kaha vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, “Tuli lika na vimbolo vitanu na vatsi vavali.”<verse eid="MAT 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Vineheni kuno kuli yange.” <verse eid="MAT 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19"/>Kaha uashikile vivunga linga vatumame ha muila, kaha uambatele vimbolo vitanu na vatsi vavali kaha uatalele kuilu, kaha uavikuisuile, nakutavuozola vimbolo nakuvihana kuli vandongisi vendi, kaha vandongisi vendi vavihanene ku vivunga. <verse eid="MAT 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20"/>Kaha voshe valile nakukuta. Kaha vakunguilile mitonga ya vimbazuvuila ya kushula ya kupua likumi na ivali. <verse eid="MAT 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21"/>Kaha vaje valile vapuile ngue makulukazi atanu a vamala, kuhumisako vampuevo na vanike.<verse eid="MAT 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu enda ha Mema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mako6:45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Iuano6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22"/>Ambahoni Yesu ualekele vandongisi vendi linga vakovele mu vuato vaye kulutue luendi musinia tele ikeye acili na kuleka vivunga linga vaye. <verse eid="MAT 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23"/>Kaha hanima ya kuleka vivunga linga vaye, uaille helu lia munkinda lika liendi mukulombela. Uakele kuje likaliendi noho cinguezi, <verse eid="MAT 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24"/>vuno honi ha ntsimbu ije vuato vuakele hhakati ka cisali kaha vuakele nakulininganga na mankimba omuo mpunzi yakele nakuvuluisa.<verse eid="MAT 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25"/>Kaha ku vandemba Yesu uezile kuli vakevo, oku alinakuenda helu lia cisali. <verse eid="MAT 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26"/>Vuno honi omo vandongisi vendi vamumuene hali nakuenda ha cisali, vovuile liova cikuma kaha vahandekele nguavo, “Ndumba ya muntu!” Kaha vatambekele naliova.<verse eid="MAT 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27"/>Kaha hajevene Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Simpeni keti muteue yange vene.”<verse eid="MAT 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28"/>Kaha Petulu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Muene, nga yove, njileke njije kuli yove nange njende ha mema.”<verse eid="MAT 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Ija.” Kaha Petulu uahumine mu vuato nakuenda ha mema kuya kuli Yesu, <verse eid="MAT 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30"/>vuno honi omo uamuene mpunzi uateuele, kaha uaputukile kuvombela kaha uatambekele nguendi, “Muene njovole.”<verse eid="MAT 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31"/>Hajevene Yesu uoluele livoko liendi, nakumukuata kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Muntu ua lutsilielo lualundende, vika ku utsiliela?” <verse eid="MAT 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32"/>Kaha omo vakovelele mu vuato mpunzi yahuile. <verse eid="MAT 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33"/>Kaha vaje vakele mu vuato vamulemesele nguavo, “Muavusunga u Muna Njambi.”<verse eid="MAT 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Akanguisa Vaka Kuvavala mu Ngenesaleta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Mako6:53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34"/>Kaha omo Yesu na vandongisi vendi vajavukilile musinia, vezile ku cihela ca Ngenesaleta. <verse eid="MAT 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35"/>Kaha omo vantu vakumutambela uje vamutantekeyele, vatumine voshe vaku cihela cije nakumunehela vaka kuvavala voshe, <verse eid="MAT 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36"/>Vamulombele linga vakuate cipue ku mukunduilo ua kazaku kendi, kaha voshe vaje vakuateleko vakangukile.<verse eid="MAT 14:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15"/>
  <para style="s">Vilongesa via Vakuluntu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Mako7:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1"/>Ambahoni Vafaliseo vamo na valongisi va lishiko vezile kuli Yesu kuhuminina ku Yelusalema kaha vahandekele nguavo, <verse eid="MAT 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2"/>“Vikahoni vandongisi vove kuvekuononoka cisemua ca vakuluntu? Omuo kuvekutana ku mavoko avo omo valia.”<verse eid="MAT 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3"/>Kaha Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Nkuma neni kumuekuononoka lishiko lia Njambi omuo ya cisemua ceni ndi? <verse eid="MAT 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4"/>Omuo Njambi uashikile nguendi, ‘Singimika isho na noko,’ kaha ‘uoshe uje ashaula ishe cipue ina, cilivene atse.’ <verse eid="MAT 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5"/>Vuno honi yeni mukahandeka ngueni nga uoshe uje aleka ishe cipue ina nguendi, ‘Vije vimunapandele kuhana kuli yange vanavihana Njambi,’ <verse eid="MAT 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6"/>kaha muntu ou kononokele ishe. Nankuma, omuo ya cisemua ceni, munaseze lizi lia Njambi. <verse eid="MAT 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7"/>Yeni vaka civembulu! Nkuma Isaya uahandekele via vusunga hali yeni, omuo uahandekele vunanguizi nguendi,<verse eid="MAT 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8"/>“‘Ava vantu vanjisingimika na tunua tuavo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:8">vuno honi mitima yavo ili kulahako nange.<verse eid="MAT 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9"/>Vakanjilemesa lika muangoco,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:9">vakalongesa mashiko a vantu lika!’”<verse eid="MAT 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Viuma vije vilingisa Muntu kupua Uakuhona kulela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Mako7:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10"/>Kaha Yesu uasanene vantu linga veje kuli ikeye kaha uavalekele nguendi, “Ivueni kaha ivuisiseni. <verse eid="MAT 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11"/>Keti coshe cije cikakovela mu kanua ka muntu cikalingisa muntu linga keti apue uakulela, vuno honi vije vikahumu mu kanua ka muntu vikevio vikalingisa muntu linga apue uakuhona kulela.”<verse eid="MAT 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12"/>Ambahoni vandongisi vezile kuli Yesu nakuhandeka nguavo, “Nkuma uatantekeya nguove Vafaliseo vapihilile ku mitima omo vevuile mezi aua ndi?” <verse eid="MAT 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13"/>Kaha Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Muti uoshe uje Tate ua muilu kakunine vakau tukula. <verse eid="MAT 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14"/>Veceleni lika, vanapu vantuamena va tupuputua, kaha nga kapuputua atuamenena kapuputua mukuavo, voshe vakauila mu cina.”<verse eid="MAT 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15"/>Vuno honi Petulu uahandekele kuli Yesu nguendi, “Tulumbunuine eci cisimo.”<verse eid="MAT 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16"/>Kaha uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Nkuma nove naua hanga kanda ucinongonone eci ndi? <verse eid="MAT 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17"/>Nkuma ku umono nguove coshe cije cikovela mu kanua cikahiti muzimo nakuhitilila ndi? <verse eid="MAT 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18"/>Vuno honi vije vioshe vikahumu mu kanua vikahumu ku mutima, kaha evi vikevio vikalingisa muntu kupua uakuhona kulela. <verse eid="MAT 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19"/>Omuo ku mutima kukeko kukahuminina visinganieka via vipi via kutsiha, vupangala, vukoyi, kuiva, vukaleho vua makuli, na vungumba. <verse eid="MAT 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20"/>Evi vikevio vikalingisa muntu linga apue uakuhona kulela, vuno honi kulia cakuhona kutana ku mavoko kucekulingisa muntu linga apue uakuhona kulela.”<verse eid="MAT 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lutsilielo lua Mpuevo uaku Kanana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Mako7:24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21"/>Kaha Yesu uahumine kuje nakuya ku cihela ca Tile na ku Sindone. <verse eid="MAT 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22"/>Kaha taleni, mpuevo ua ku Kanana uje uahuminine ku cihela kuje vene ualilile nguendi, “Njivuileko cikeketima Muene, Muna Ndaviti, munange uampuevo ali na lihamba lia lipi cikuma.”<verse eid="MAT 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23"/>Vuno honi Yesu kamukumbuluile cipue lizi limo, kaha vandongisi vendi vezile nakumulambelela nguavo, “Mulekese linga aye omuo hali nakutupangela kalua.”<verse eid="MAT 15:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24"/>Kaha Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Vanjitumine lika ku vampanga vakuzimbala vaku Isaleli.”<verse eid="MAT 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25"/>Vuno honi uje mpuevo uezile nakutsikama kuli ikeye nguendi, “Muene njikuase.”<verse eid="MAT 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26"/>Kaha Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Keti cacili kumbila mbolo ya vanike ku tutali.”<verse eid="MAT 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27"/>Kaha uje mpuevo uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Eyo Muene, vuno honi cipue vene tutali vakali vishaniu vije vikau ku mesa ya muene uavo.” <verse eid="MAT 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28"/>Kaha Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Nanaa ove mpuevo lutsilielo liove luakama cikuma. Cilingiue kuya muje mu utondela.” Kaha hajevene munendi uampuevo uakangukile.<verse eid="MAT 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Akangula Vantu vavengi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29"/>Kaha Yesu uahumine kuje kaha uahitile kuyehi na cisali ca Ngalileya. Kaha uaile kumukulo ua munkinda nakukatuma. <verse eid="MAT 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30"/>Kaha civunga cakama cezile kuli ikeye, vamunehelele vilema, visualonda, tupuputua na tuveveve, na vakuavo veka naua, kaha vavanehele ku viliato viendi, kaha uavakanguisile. <verse eid="MAT 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31"/>Nankuma cije civunga calikomokelele cikuma, omo vamuene vaje tuveveve vahandeka, na visualonda vanapu vamutuntu, na vilema venda, na tupuputua vamona, kaha vahanene vumpau kuli Njambi ua Isaleli.<verse eid="MAT 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Alisa Vantu Makulukazi Auana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Mako8:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32"/>Ambahoni Yesu uasanene vandongisi vendi nakuvaleka nguendi, “Njilinakuivuila ngozi eci civunga, omuo vanakala nange ha matangua atatu, kaha kuvalileho cipue cimo, kaha kunjitondo linga njiveceli vaye na njala, hamo valezumukila mu ngila.”<verse eid="MAT 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33"/>Kaha vandongisi vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, “Kuli honi tuasa kuuana mbolo muno mu ndinda ya kulisa civunga cakama eci?”<verse eid="MAT 15:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Muli na mikasha ingahi?” Vamukumbuluile nguavo, “Itanu na ivali, na vatsi vavandende.”<verse eid="MAT 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35"/>Kaha Yesu uashikile cije civunga linga vatumame ha mavu, <verse eid="MAT 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36"/>kaha uambatele ije mikasha itanu na ivali na vatsi, kaha hanima yakuhana citsantsela, uavipazuile nakuvihana kuli vandongisi, kaha vandongisi vavihanene kuli vije vivunga. <verse eid="MAT 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37"/>Kaha voshe valile nakukuta. Kaha vandongisi vakunguilile mitonga ya kushula ya kupua itanu na ivali ya vije vimbazuvuila viasaleleho. <verse eid="MAT 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38"/>Kaha vaje valile vapuile makulukazi auana a vamala (4, 0 0 0), kuakuhona vampuevo na vanike.<verse eid="MAT 15:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39"/>Kaha uecelele cije civunga linga vaye, kaha uakovelele mu vuato nakuya ku cihela ca Mangandane.<verse eid="MAT 15:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16"/>
  <para style="s">Vafaliseo Valomba Cikomoueso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Mako8:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luka12:54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1"/>Kaha Vafaliseo na Vasanduki vezile kuli Yesu nakumueseka, vamuihuile linga avamuese cimueso cakuhuminina kuilu. <verse eid="MAT 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2"/>Kaha uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Omo nga cinguezi, mukahandeka ngueni, ‘Kukaca vuino, omuo lilu livenga.’ <verse eid="MAT 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3"/>Kaha kucimene muhandeka ngueni, ‘Lelo kukakala mashuela, omuo lilu livenga na kuteuesa.’ Muatantekeya kulumbununa cifua ca lilu, vuno honi kumuhasa kulumbununa vimueso via vi ntsimbu. <verse eid="MAT 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4"/>Vantu vantsimbu ino va vupi na vupangala vatonda cimueso, vuno honi kukuesi cimueso civakavahana kuvanga lika cimueso ca Yona.” kaha uavasezele nakuya.<verse eid="MAT 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cimbaluila ca Vafaliseo na Vasanduki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Mako8:14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5"/>Omo vandongisi vahetele musinia, vasuvile kuambata mbolo. <verse eid="MAT 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Linuingeni kaha zangameni ku cimbaluila ca Vafaliseo na Vasanduki.”<verse eid="MAT 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7"/>Kaha vakele nakuhandeka hhakati kavo vavenia nguavo, “Kutuezile na mbolo.”<verse eid="MAT 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8"/>Kaha Yesu, hakutantekeya eci, uahandekele nguendi, “Yeni valutsilielo lualundende, vika muli nakuhandeka hhakati keni vavenia ngueni kumuesi na mbolo? <verse eid="MAT 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9"/>Nkuma kanda muvuisise ndi? Nkuma kumuanuka mikasha itanu ya vimbolo, ya vantu makulukazi atanu, kaha mitonga ingahi muakunguluile? <verse eid="MAT 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10"/>Cipue mikasha itanu na ivali ya vimbolo ya vantu makulukazi auana, nkuma mitonga ingahi muakunguluile? <verse eid="MAT 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11"/>Nkuma vika kumuvuisisa ngueni kunjahandekele neni via mbolo? Zangameni ku cimbaluila ca Vafaliseo na Vasanduki.”<verse eid="MAT 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12"/>Kaha vevuisisile nguavo nkuma kavalekele kuzangama ku cimbaluila cakupangesa mbolo, vuno honi ha vilongesa via Vafaliseo na Vasanduki.<verse eid="MAT 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Petulu Atava ngeci Yesu Ikeye Kilistu Uakuvuavesa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mako8:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13"/>Omo Yesu uahetele ku mbonge ya Sesaliya Filipu, kaha uehuile vandongisi vendi nguendi, “Vantu vahandeka nguavo Muna Muntu ikeye iya?”<verse eid="MAT 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14"/>Vamukumbuluile nguavo, “Vamo nguavo Iuano muka kumbuitika, vamo nguavo Eliya, vamo nguavo Njelemiya cipue umo ua tunanguizi va Njambi.”<verse eid="MAT 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Vuno honi yeni ngueni Yange iya?”<verse eid="MAT 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16"/>Simoni Petulu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Yove Kilistu, Muna Njambi uakuyoya.”<verse eid="MAT 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17"/>Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Uakuisuliua Simoni muna Yona! Omuo keti vuntu vuasholuele evi kuli yove, vuno honi Tate uje hali muilu. <verse eid="MAT 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18"/>Kaha njikuleka nguange yove Petulu, ha livue eli njikatunga cikungulukilo cange, kaha nzili ya kutsa ku ikacihiana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu Cingelengu vanaisoneka nguavo Hendisi, kulumbununa Cikolo ca vaka kutsa.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19"/>Njikakuhana masapi a vumuene vua muilu, kaha coshe cije civakavindika hano hamavu na muilu vakacivindika, kaha coshe cije civakatavesa hano ha mavu na muilu vakacitavesa.”<verse eid="MAT 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20"/>Ambahoni uashikile vandongisi vendi linga keti valekeko muntu umo nguavo ikeye Kilistu.<verse eid="MAT 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Ahandeka ha Tuyando tuendi na Kutsa cendi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:31">Mako8:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:1">9:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luka9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21"/>Kuhuma ha ntsimbu ije Yesu uaputukile kulumbunuina vandongisi vendi nguendi, njapande kuya ku Yelusalema naku kayanda viuma viavingi kuli vakuluntu na kuli vakuluntu vatusasendote na kuli valongisi va mashiko, kaha vakanjitsiha, vuno honi hanima ya matangua atatu njikasanguka.<verse eid="MAT 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22"/>Kaha Petulu uamuambatele nakumutuala kualikaliavo na kuputuka kumutenukila nguendi, “Njambi vindika, Muene! Eci kucikalingiua kuli yove!”<verse eid="MAT 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23"/>Vuno honi Yesu uatengulukile nakuhandeka kuli Petulu nguendi, “Huma kuli yange yove Satana! Yove unapu citsutsukiso kuli yange, omuo kuukundama kuli Njambi, vuno honi ku vantu.”<verse eid="MAT 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24"/>Ambahoni Yesu ualekele vandongisi vendi nguendi, “Nga uoshe uje atonda kunjikava, napande kuliviana ikeye vavenia nakuambata cilindakano cendi na kunjikava. <verse eid="MAT 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25"/>Omuo uoshe uje atonda kuniunga muono uendi akauzimbalesa, vuno honi uoshe uje azimbalesa muono vuendi omo yange akauuana. <verse eid="MAT 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26"/>Kaha cikakuasa vika kuli muntu, nga alikunguilila viuma via ha mavu vioshe nakuzimbalesa muono uendi? Kaha vika muntu viakahana linga ahingisemo muono uendi? <verse eid="MAT 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27"/>Omuo Muna Muntu akeja na tungelo vendi mu vumpau vua Ishe, kaha akafueta muntu na muntu uoshe kuya ku vilinga viendi. <verse eid="MAT 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28"/>Muavusunga njimileka nguange kuli vamo hano vaje ku vakatsi kuvanga noho vanamono Muna muntu neja mu vumuene vuendi.”<verse eid="MAT 16:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu Alimpuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Mako9:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1"/>Hanima ya matangua atanu na limo Yesu uambatele Petulu na Tiango na munaina Iuano, kaha vahile hamo ku munkinda ualaha kua likaliavo lika. <verse eid="MAT 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2"/>Kaha Yesu ualihimpuile ha mesho avo, kaha na cihanga cendi caviakumine ngue litangua kaha na vuzalo vuendi vuatokele too ngue ceke. <verse eid="MAT 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3"/>Kaha taleni, ambahoni kuasholokele Mosesa na Eliya vaje vakele na kuhandeka nendi. <verse eid="MAT 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4"/>Kaha Petulu uahandekele kuli Yesu nguendi, “Muene, cacili yetu kukala kuno, nga utonda njikatunga vimbalaka vitatu kuno, imo yove kaha ikuavo ya Mosesa na ikuavo ya Eliya.”<verse eid="MAT 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5"/>Tele acili nakuhandeka, kaha hajevene lishelua liakuviakuma liavafuikile, kaha muje mulishelua muahumine lizi ngualio, “Ou ikeye munange injazanga, uje muli ikeye njivuahelela, muivuilileni.”<verse eid="MAT 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6"/>Omo vandongisi vevuile evi, vavulumanene ha mavu, kaha vovuile liova cikuma. <verse eid="MAT 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7"/>Vuno honi Yesu uezile nakuvakuata kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Katukeni keti muteue.” <verse eid="MAT 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8"/>Kaha omo vemukile mesho avo, kuvamuene ueka vuno honi Yesu lika.<verse eid="MAT 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9"/>Kaha omo vasikumukile kuhuma ha munkinda, Yesu uavashikile nguendi, “Keti valekeko muntu hali uoshe cije cimona, kuvanga noho Muna Muntu vanamusangula ku vatsi.”<verse eid="MAT 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10"/>Vandongisi vamuhuile nguavo, “Nkuma vika valongisi va lishiko vahandeka nguavo Eliya eje tahi ikeye?”<verse eid="MAT 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11"/>Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Eliya eja nakuhiluisila naua viuma vioshe, <verse eid="MAT 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12"/>vuno honi njimileka nguange Eliya neja laja, kaha kuvamutantekeyele, vuno honi vamulingile muoshe muje muvatondelelemo, omu mukemo vene na Muna Muntu vakamuyandesela.”<verse eid="MAT 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13"/>Ambahoni vandongisi vevuisisile nguavo alinakuhandeka kuli vakevo via Iuano muka kumbuitika.<verse eid="MAT 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Akanguisa Kanike ka Yala uje uakele na Lihamba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Mako9:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43a">Luka9:37-43a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14"/>Kaha omo vezile ku civunga, yala umo uezile kuli Yesu nakutsikama nakuhandeka nguendi, <verse eid="MAT 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15"/>“Muene ivuila cikeketima munange, omuo hali na mushongo uakushinia kaha ukamuyandesa cikuma, omuo ha vintsimbu viavingi akauila mu tuhia na mu mema. <verse eid="MAT 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16"/>Kaha njamunehele kuli vandongisi vove, vuno honi kuvasele kumukanguisa.”<verse eid="MAT 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17"/>Kaha Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Yeni vantu va ntsimbu ino vakuhona lutsilielo na vupi, njikakala neni lungahi? Njikamileka lungahi? Muneheni kuno kuli yange.” <verse eid="MAT 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18"/>Kaha Yesu uatenukilile lije lihamba, kaha lije lihamba liahumine muli ikeye, kaha hajevene uje kanike uakangukile.<verse eid="MAT 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19"/>Ambahoni vandongisi vezile kuli Yesu muvushueke nakuhandeka nguavo, “Vika honi yetu kutuasele kulihumisa?”<verse eid="MAT 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20"/>Kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Omuo ya lutsilielo lueni lualundende. Muavusunga njimileka nguange nga muli na lutsilielo ngue nona ya mbuto ya musalata, ngue muasa kuhandeka ku munkinda ou ngueni, ‘Huma kuno ya kuje kaha ukaya, kaha na cimo cahi cimukahonoua.’” <verse eid="MAT 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21"/>Vuno honi lihamba liangacije kuliekuhuma ngoco kuvanga na lilombelo na kuliumina kulia.<verse eid="MAT 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Ahandeka naua ha Kutsa cendi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mako9:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Luka9:43b-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22"/>Omo valikunguluile hamo mu Ngalileya, Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Muna Muntu vanapande kumuhana ku mavoko a vantu, <verse eid="MAT 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23"/>vaka mutsihia, kaha vakamusangula munima ya matangua atatu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:23">Kaha vandongisi vevuile vusiua cikuma.<verse eid="MAT 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kufueta Lisimu lia mu Njivo ya Njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24"/>Omo Yesu na vandongisi vendi vezile ku Kapenauma, kaha vaka kutambula lisimu lia mu njivo ya Njambi vaile kuli Petulu nakuhandeka nguavo, “Nkuma mulongisi ueni kekufueta lisimo ndi?”<verse eid="MAT 17:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25"/>Kaha Petulu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Eyo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:25">Kaha omo Petulu uakovelele mu njivo, Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye hakulivanga nguendi, “Simoni vika usinganieka? Nkuma honi kuli veya vimiene va hano ha mavu vakatambula lisimu? Kuli vana vavo indi kuveka?”<verse eid="MAT 17:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26"/>Kaha omo Petulu uakumbuluile nguendi, “Kuveka,” kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Nankuma vana vanapatuka. <verse eid="MAT 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27"/>Nankuma keti tuvapihisile, ya lika ku cisali ukalovele, kaha ukambate intsi uje uamaputukilo kaha omo ukafukula mukanua kendi ukauanamo mbongo ya muuaya uaya, kaha yakayambate nakuvahanayo, linga ikapue lisimu liange nove.”<verse eid="MAT 17:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18"/>
  <para style="s">Iya Uakama Cikuma?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mako9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1"/>Ha ntsimbu ije vandongisi vezile kuli Yesu nakuhandeka nguavo, “Iya uakama cikuma mu vumuene vua muilu?”<verse eid="MAT 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2"/>Kaha Yesu uasanene kanike nakumuhaka hhakati kavo, <verse eid="MAT 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3"/>kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Muavusunga njihandeka kuli yeni nguange, kuvanga mutenguluke kupua ngue ava vanike, keti ngoconi kumukakovela mu vumuene vua muilu. <verse eid="MAT 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4"/>Uoshe uje alikehesa ikeye vavenia ngue ou kanike, ikeye napu uakama mu vumuene vua muilu. <verse eid="MAT 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5"/>Uoshe uje atambula kanike ou mu lizina liange na tambula yange.<verse eid="MAT 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vieseko vije vituala ku Vupi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Mako9:42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luka17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6"/>“Vuno honi uoshe uje alingisa ava vanike vavandende vaje vatsiliela muli yange kulinga vupi, cacili kuli ikeye kumukutilila livue liakulolela vunga mu ntsingo yendi kaha nakumukokela ha seta ya cisali. <verse eid="MAT 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7"/>Cisingo ha mavu omuo ya vieseko vije vituala ku vupi! Omuo cilivene vieseko evi vija, vuno honi cisingo kuli muntu uje vieseko evi vizila!<verse eid="MAT 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8"/>“Kaha nga livoko liove cipue mukono uove vikulingisa linga ulinge vupi, vitete nakuviumbila kuti, cacili kuli yove kukovela mu muono oku ucisualonda cipue cilema kupulakana na mavoko avali cipue mikono ivali nakukumbila mu tuhia tua miaka yoshe ya yaye. <verse eid="MAT 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9"/>Kaha nga lisho liove likulingisa linga ulinge vupi, kaha licokovolemo nakuliumbila kuti, cacili kuli yove kukovela mu muono na lisho limo kupulakana na mesho avali aje akanehesa linga vakakumbile mu ngehena ya tuhia.<verse eid="MAT 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca Mpanga Uakuzimbala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luka15:3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10"/>“Taleni keti musembulule ava vanike vavandende, omuo njimileka nguange muilu muli tungelo vaje ntsimbu yoshe vakamono cihanga ca Tate uje hali muilu. <verse eid="MAT 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11"/>Omuo Muna Muntu uezile nakuovola vaje vanazimbala.<verse eid="MAT 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12"/>“Vika musinganieka? Nga yala hali na vampanga cihita, kaha umo uavo nazimbala, nkuma kaseze vaje makumi atanu na auana na vatanu na vauana (99) ha munkinda nakuya mukutonda uje nazimbala ndi? <verse eid="MAT 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13"/>Kaha nga amuuana, muavusunga njimileka nguange akavuahelele cikuma omuo yendi kupulakana vaje makumi atanu na auana na vatanu na vauana (99) vaje kuvazimbalele. <verse eid="MAT 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14"/>Mucifua cimo vene Tate ua muilu katondo ngeci umo uava vanike vavandende vanonge.<verse eid="MAT 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muntu nga Nakupihisila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15"/>“Nga mukueni na kupihisila, ya uye ukamuleke vije via nakupihisila, muvuvali vueni lika. Nga akuivuilila kaha uamuovola. <verse eid="MAT 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16"/>Vuno honi nga ka kuivuilila, kaha ambatako umo cipue vavali linga mezi oshe akapue navukaleho vua vantu vavali cipue vatatu. <verse eid="MAT 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17"/>Nga aviana kuvevuilila, kaha lekesako cikungulukilo, kaha nga naua aviana kuivuilila cipue ku cikungulukilo, mupuise ngue vaje keti Vayunda na vaka kutambula lisimu.<verse eid="MAT 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvindika na Kutavesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18"/>“Muavusunga njimileka nguange, coshe cije civakavindika hano hamavu na muilu naua vakacivindika, kaha coshe cije civakatavesa hano hamavu na muilu naua vakacitavesa.<verse eid="MAT 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19"/>“Kaha naua njimileka nguange, nga muvuvali vueni mulitavasana hano ha mavu ha cuma mukalomba, vakamilingilaco kuli Tate ua muilu. <verse eid="MAT 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20"/>Omuo kuje kunakungulukila vavali cipue vatatu mu lizina liange, kuje vene nange naua njili hhakati kavo.”<verse eid="MAT 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca Ngamba Uakuhona Kukonekela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21"/>Ambahoni Petulu uezile kuli Yesu nakuhandeka nguendi, “Muene, nkuma lungahi njasa kukonekela muanetu nga na njipihisila? Nkuma lualuingi vintsimbu vitanu na vivali ndi?”<verse eid="MAT 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22"/>Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Njikulekesa nguange keti luakupua vintsimbu vitanu na vivali, vuno honi luakupua makumi atanu na avali na vintsimbu vitanu na vivali.” <verse eid="MAT 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23"/>Nankuma vumuene vua muilu tuvuesekesa na muene uje uatondele kufueta vangamba vendi. <verse eid="MAT 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24"/>Omo uaputukile linga avafuete, kaha vamunehelele yala uje uakele na mukuli kuli ikeye ua vimbazuvuila via ngolinde viakupua makulukazi likumi (10 0 0). <verse eid="MAT 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25"/>Kaha omo uje yala uahonouele kumufueta, uje muene uendi uashikile linga vamulandese hamo na mpueyendi, na vana vendi na vioshe vije viakele navio linga afuete. <verse eid="MAT 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26"/>“Kaha uje ngamba uatsikamene ha mavuli endi ku mesho endi nakumulomba nguendi, ‘Muene acinjivandameneko tahi, kaha njikakufueta vioshe!’” <verse eid="MAT 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27"/>Kaha uje muene uevuililile ngozi uje ngamba kaha uamuecelele nakumukonekela mukuli uendi.<verse eid="MAT 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28"/>“Vuno honi uje vene ngamba omo uaile ualiuanene na umo uavakuavo vangamba uje uakele na mukuli uendi uakupua cihita ca vimbongo via muuayauaya. Kaha uamukuatele ha milivu nakuhandeka nguendi, ‘Njifuete mukuli uange.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29"/>Kaha uje mukuavo ngamba uauililile ha mavu nakumulambelela nguendi, ‘Acinjivandameneko tahi, kaha njikakufueta.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30"/>Vuno honi uavianene kaha uamutualele mu kamenga noho hakafuetela uje mukuli uendi. <verse eid="MAT 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31"/>Omo vakuavo vangamba vamuene vije vialingiuile, kuvevuile muacili, kaha vaile nakuambulula kuli muene uavo vije vioshe vialingiuile. <verse eid="MAT 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32"/>Ambahoni uje muene uendi uamusanene nakuhandeka kuli ikeye nguendi, ‘Yove ngamba uamupi! Njakukonekelele uje mukuli uoshe omuo uanjilambelelele. <verse eid="MAT 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33"/>Kaha vika honi yove kuuamuvuilileko cikeketima mukueni ngamba, ngue muje munjakuivuililile cikeketima yange?’ <verse eid="MAT 18:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34"/>Kaha na vutenu uje muene yendi uamutualele ku vaka kamenga linga vamuzangamese kuvanga noho akafueta mukuli uoshe uje uakele nauo.”<verse eid="MAT 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35"/>“Omu mukemo vene na Tate ua muilu akalinga yeni voshe, nga kumukakonekela vamuanoko kuhuminina ku mitima yeni.”<verse eid="MAT 18:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu Alongesa Hakutsiha vulo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Mako10:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1"/>Omo Yesu uamanusuile kuhandeka evi, uahumine mu Ngalileya uaile ku cihela ca Yundeya musinia lia ndonga ya Yundau. <verse eid="MAT 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2"/>Kaha civunga cakama ca mukavele, kaha ua vakanguisile kuje. <verse eid="MAT 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3"/>Vafaliseo vamo vezile kuli ikeye nakumueseka, mukumuihula nguavo, “Nkuma capua lishiko yala kukondola mpuevo yendi ha mulonga uli uoshe indi?” <verse eid="MAT 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4"/>Nankuma Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Kumuatandele nguavo uje uavatangele ku maputukilo ua vatangele yala na mpuevo.” <verse eid="MAT 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5"/>Uahandekele nguendi, “Omuo hacifua eci yala akaseza vaishe na vaina na kulipandakana hamo na mpuevo yendi, kaha vavali va kapua muvila umo lika.” <verse eid="MAT 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6"/>Kaha kuvapu vavali vuno honi vapua muvila umo lika. Kaha cije Njambi napandakana hamo keti vakacihangunune. <verse eid="MAT 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7"/>Kaha Vafaliseo vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, “Nkuma vikahoni Mosesa uashikile umo yala kuhana mukanda uakukondola kuli mpueyendi nakumusheka?” <verse eid="MAT 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Omuo yakukaluua ca mitima yeni Mosesa uamitavesele linga mukondole vampuevo veni, vuno honi kumaputukilo kucapuile ngoco. <verse eid="MAT 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9"/>Kaha njihandeka kuli yeni nguange, uoshe akondola mpuevo yendi, kuakuhona kulinga vupangala, nakuambata mpuevo ueka, kaha alinga vupangala.” <verse eid="MAT 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10"/>Vandongisi vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, “Nga mukemo ngoco hali yala na mpuevo yendi, nkuma cacili kuhona kuambata.” <verse eid="MAT 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11"/>Vuno honi uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Keti muntu uoshe atambula evi vihandeka, kuvanga lika kuli vaje vavanavihana. <verse eid="MAT 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12"/>Omuo kuli vamo vaje kuvasa kuambata omuo vasemukile muje vene, kaha kuvali vamo vaje kuvasa kuambata omuo vantu vanavalingimo, kaha naua kuvali vamo vaje kuvambata omuo vanalingi vakevo vavenia ngoco vene omuo ya vumuene vua muilu. Kaha uoshe uje atambula evi, avitambule.”<verse eid="MAT 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Akuisula Vanike Vavandende</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mako10:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13"/>Ambahoni vanehele vanike vavandende kuli Yesu linga avasaleke mavoko endi nakuvalombelela. Vuno honi vandongisi vatenukilile vaje vantu vavanehele. <verse eid="MAT 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14"/>Vuno honi Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Eceleni vanike vavandende veje kuli yange, keti muvavindike, omuo vumuene vua muilu vunapu vuavo.” <verse eid="MAT 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15"/>Kaha uavasalekele mavoko endi kaha uaile.<verse eid="MAT 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mukuenje Uakupita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mako10:17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16"/>Kaha taleni, umo muntu uezile kuli Yesu nakumuihula nguendi, “Mulongisi, cuma muka cacili njapande kulinga, linga njikakale na muono uayaye?” <verse eid="MAT 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17"/>Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Vika unjihuila vije via cili?” Kuli lika umo ikeye uacili. Vuno honi nga utonda kukovela mu vuyoye, niunga mashiko. <verse eid="MAT 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18"/>Uje muntu uamuihuile nguendi, “Vika?” Kaha Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Keti ukatsihe, keti ukalinge vupangala, keti ukeve, keti ukahane vukaleho vua makuli, <verse eid="MAT 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19"/>singimika isho na noko, kaha zanga mukueni ngue muje muualizangela yove vavenia.” <verse eid="MAT 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20"/>Kaha uje mukuenje uamuhuile nguendi, “Vioshe evi njaviniungu.” Vika naua vikuavo vinjasa kulinga? <verse eid="MAT 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Nga utonda kupua uakusungama, ya linga ukalandese viuli navio kaha uvihane ku vihutu, kaha ukakala na vufuko muilu, kaha ija, njikave.” <verse eid="MAT 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22"/>Omo uje mukuenje uevuile evi uaile navusiua, omuo uakele na vufuko vua vuingi cikuma. <verse eid="MAT 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vandongisi vendi nguendi, “Muavusunga njihandeka kuli yeni nguange, cikapua ca cikalu kuli muka kufuka kukovela mu Vumuene vua muilu. <verse eid="MAT 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24"/>Njimileka naua nguange, ca casi kamelu kuhita mu lisho lia nguya, kupulakana muka kufuka kukovela mu vumuene vua Njambi.” <verse eid="MAT 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25"/>Omo vandongisi vovuile eci, valikomokelele cikuma, nakuhandeka nguavo, “Kaha iya honi akovoka?” <verse eid="MAT 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26"/>Vuno honi Yesu uavatalele nakuhandeka kuli vakevo nguendi, “Eci cacikalu ku vantu vuno honi kuli Njambi vioshe viapua viaviasi.”<verse eid="MAT 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27"/>Kaha Petulu uahandekele nguendi, “Tuaseze vioshe nakukukava. Vika honi tukakala navio?”<verse eid="MAT 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28"/>Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Muavusunga njimileka nguange, mu mavu a maha, omo Muna Muntu akatumama ha litanda liendi lia vumpau, yeni vaje muanjikavele mukatumama ha matanda makumi na avali, mukusompa miyati likumi na ivali ya Isaleli. <verse eid="MAT 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29"/>Uoshe uje naseza vinjivo viendi, cipue vamunaina vavamala, cipue vamunaina vavampuevo, cipue vaishe, cipue vaina, cipue vana vendi cipue vihela, omuo ya lizina liange, akatambula cihita ku vioshe nakusuana muono ua yaye. <verse eid="MAT 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30"/>Vuno honi vavengi vaje vakulivanga vakapua vakumanusuila, kaha vakumanusuila vakapua vakulivanga.”<verse eid="MAT 19:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20"/>
  <para style="s">Vaka Kupanga mu Lihia lia Viniu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1"/>“Omuo vumuene vua muilu vunapu ngue vavenia njivo uje cimene mene uaile nakulania vaka kupanga mu lihia liendi lia viniu. <verse eid="MAT 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2"/>Hanima yakulitavasana na vaka kupanga ha fueto ya ha litangua, kaha uavatumine mu lihia liendi lia viniu. <verse eid="MAT 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3"/>Kaha ha ntsimbu ya muciuana ku cimene omo uaileko uamuene vamo vanemana ngoco ku cihela cakulandesela, <verse eid="MAT 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4"/>kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, ‘Neni naua yemuye mukapange mu lihia lia viniu, kaha njikamifueta fueto ije inapandemo. Kaha vaile.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5"/>Kaha uaileko naua ku ntsimbu ya likumi na vivali ya mutania na ntsimbu ya likumi na vitanu na vivali ku mutania uacinguezi, kaha uatumineko vakuavo naua. <verse eid="MAT 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6"/>Kaha ku ntsimbu ya mu citanu ya cinguezi uaile naua ku cihela ca kulandesela kaha uakauanene naua veka vanemana ngoco, kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, ‘Nkuma vika honi munemanena lika kuno ngoco ha litangua lioshe liamutuntu?’ <verse eid="MAT 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7"/>Kaha vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, ‘Omuo naumo uahi natulania.’ Kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, ‘Yemuye mu lihia neni.’<verse eid="MAT 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8"/>“Kaha omo cinguezi cahetele, uje vavenia lihia uahandekele kuli muka kutuamenena vaka kupanga nguendi, ‘Sana vaka kupanga linga uvafuete fueto yavo, putukila na vaje vakukotokela kaha manusuila na vaje vakulivanga.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9"/>Kaha omo vaje vavalaniene ha ntsimbu ya mucitanu ya mutania ua cinguezi vezile, umo na umo uavo uatambuile fueto ya ha litangua limo. <verse eid="MAT 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10"/>Honi omo vaje valivangele vezile, vasinganiekele nguavo hamo vakatambula viavingi, vuno honi umo na umo uavo navo uatambuile fueto ya ha litangua limo. <verse eid="MAT 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11"/>Kaha omo vatambuile vaputukile kulinienieta kuli uje vavenia lihia <verse eid="MAT 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12"/>nguavo, ‘Ava vakukotokela vanapanga lika hola imo, kaha unavapuisa hamo netu vaje vanapanga litangua lioshe mukatania.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13"/>Vuno honi vavenia lihia uakumbuluile umo uavo nguendi, ‘Kavusamba, kunjakulingile mua mupi, nkuma kutualitavasanene kupangela fueto ya ha litangua limo ndi?’ <verse eid="MAT 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14"/>Ambata vije vinakupande kaha ya, njinahangula kuhana vaje vakukotokela eci ngue muje munjinahanena yove. <verse eid="MAT 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15"/>Nkuma kunjasa kulinga muje munjitondela na vimbongo viange ndi? Cipue nkuma yove uli nacipululu omuo ya ngozi yange ndi?” <verse eid="MAT 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16"/>Kaha omu mukemo vene mucikafua, vaka kukotokela vakapua vaka kulivanga, kaha vaka kulivanga vakapua vaka kukotokela.<verse eid="MAT 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Ahandeka lua Mucitatu ha Kutsa Cendi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mako10:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17"/>Omo Yesu tele alinakuya ku Yelusalema, uaile hamo na vandongisi vendi likumi na vavali kuavo lika, kaha mu ngila uahandekele kuli vakevo muvushueke nguendi, <verse eid="MAT 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18"/>“Taleni, tulinakuya ku Yelusalema, kaha Muna Muntu vakamuhana kuli vakuluntu va tusasendote nakuli valongisi va mashiko kaha vakamuhisa nakumutuala ku kutsa, <verse eid="MAT 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19"/>kaha vakamuhana kuli vaje keti Vayunda linga vaka mushendumune nakumupupanga nakumushukika ha cilindakano, kaha vakamusangula hanima ya matangua atatu.”<verse eid="MAT 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Catonda Cisemi Uampuevo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Mako10:35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20"/>Ambahoni naye ya vana va Zembendeo uezile kuli Yesu hamo na vana vendi, uatsikamene ku mesho endi kaha uamulombele cuma cimo.<verse eid="MAT 20:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Vika utonda?” uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Shika linga ava vana vange vavali linga vatumame umo ku livoko liove liacilio mukuavo kulia cimoshue mu vumuene vuove.”<verse eid="MAT 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22"/>Vuno honi Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Ku utantekeya vika vije ulinakulomba. Nkuma muasa kunua nganja ije injikanuina ndi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:22">Vamukumbuluile nguavo “Tuasa.”<verse eid="MAT 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23"/>Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Mukanuina mu nganja yange, vuno honi kutumama ku livoko liange liacilio na lia cimoshueni, keti yange njili nanzili yakucitavesa, vuno honi cinapu cavaje Tate navuahesele laja.”<verse eid="MAT 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24"/>Kaha omo vaje likumi vacuvuile, vanienguelele vaje vamunaina vavali. <verse eid="MAT 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25"/>Vuno honi Yesu uavasanene nakuhandeka nguendi, “Muatantekeya ngueni vaka kuyula va vaje keti Vayunda vali nanzili hali vakevo, kaha na vantuama vavo vali na nzili yakama hali vakevo. <verse eid="MAT 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26"/>Kucikafu muje hali yeni. Vuno honi uoshe uje akapua uakama hali yeni akapua ngamba yeni, <verse eid="MAT 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27"/>Kaha uoshe akapua uakulivanga hali yeni akapua ngamba yeni, <verse eid="MAT 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28"/>cipue Muna Muntu kezile mukumuovola vuno honi mukuovola, nakuhana muono uendi ngue fueto mukuovola vavengi.”<verse eid="MAT 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Akanguisa Vamala Vavali Vatupuputua</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mako10:46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29"/>Kaha omo Yesu na vandongisi vendi vahumine ku Yeliko, civunga cakama camukavele. <verse eid="MAT 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30"/>Kaha taleni, vamala vatupuputua vavali vatumamene ku mukulo ua tapalo, kaha omo vevuile nguavo Yesu alinakuhita, vatambekele nguavo, “Tuvuileko cikeketima Muna Ndaviti.”<verse eid="MAT 20:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31"/>Kaha cije civunga cavatenukilile nguavo vaholoke kuluu, vuno honi vatambakanene cikuma honi nguavo, “Muene, tuvuileko cikeketima, Muna Ndaviti!”<verse eid="MAT 20:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32"/>Kaha Yesu uemanene nakuvasana nguendi, “Vika mutonda linga njimilingile?”<verse eid="MAT 20:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33"/>Vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, “Muene tutonda kumona.” <verse eid="MAT 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34"/>Kaha Yesu hakuvevuila cikeketima uakuatele ha mesho avo, kaha hajevene vaputukile kumona kaha vamukavele.<verse eid="MAT 20:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu Akovela na Kasingimiko mu Yelusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mako11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:8-40">Luka19:8-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Iuano12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1"/>Kaha omo Yesu na vandongisi vendi vahetele kuyehi na Yelusalema, vaile ku Mbetafanje ku munkinda ua Oliveta, ambahoni Yesu uatumine vandongisi vavali, <verse eid="MAT 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2"/>nakuhandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Yeni ku limbo lije lia litala neni, kaha hajevene mukauana cimulu vanamukutu na munendi, kaha vazituleni munjinehelevo. <verse eid="MAT 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3"/>Nga muntu umo akahandeka cimo kuli yeni, mukahandeke ngueni, ‘Muene hali nakuvatonda, kaha akavahiluisa mu vuasi vuasi.’”<verse eid="MAT 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4"/>Evi vialingiuile linga vilishulisise vije viahandekele kananguizi ua Njambi nguendi,<verse eid="MAT 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5"/>“Leka muana ua mpuevo ua Siyoni nguove,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">Tala, muene yove hali nakuija kuli yove</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">Uje uakulikehesa kaha nalondo ha cimulu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">na hali muna cimulu.”<verse eid="MAT 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6"/>Kaha vandongisi vaile nakukalinga muje muavashikilililemo Yesu, <verse eid="MAT 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7"/>ambahoni vanehele uje cimulu na munendi, kaha vajalele tuzaku tuavo ha miongo ya vimulu, kaha Yesu uatumameneho. <verse eid="MAT 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8"/>Vuingi vua vivunga vajalele tuzaku tuavo mu ngila, kaha vakuavo naua vatetele mitango ya miti vajalele mu ngila. <verse eid="MAT 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9"/>Kaha cije civunga caile halutue liendi na vaje vamukavangeyele vatambekele cikuma nguavo, “Hosana kuli Muna Ndaviti! Njambi amukuisule ou eja mu lizina lia Muene! Lemeseni Njambi!”<verse eid="MAT 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10"/>Kaha omo uakovelele mu Yelusalema, nganda yoshe ya lijajelelele vahandekele nguavo, “Iya ou?”<verse eid="MAT 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11"/>Kaha vivunga via vantu vahandekele nguavo, “Ou ikeye kananguizi ua Njambi Yesu uaku Nazaleta yamu Ngalileya.”<verse eid="MAT 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Aya ku Njivo ya Njambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mako11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Iuano2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12"/>Kaha Yesu uakovelele mu mbalanda ya njivo ya Njambi nakusheka voshe vaje vakele nakulandesa na vaje vakele nakulanda mu njivo ya Njambi, kaha uafulumikile vimesa via vaje vakele nakulandulula vimbongo na vitumamo via vaje vakele nakulandesa mavembe. <verse eid="MAT 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13"/>Kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Vacisoneka nguavo, njivo yange vakaitumbula njivo ya malombelo, vuno honi yeni muaipuisa cihela ca vezi.”<verse eid="MAT 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14"/>Kaha tupuputua na vilema vezile kuli ikeye mu njivo ya Njambi, kaha uavakanguisile. <verse eid="MAT 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15"/>Vuno honi omo vakuluntu vatusasendote na valongisi va mezi omo vamuene viuma viacili vije vialingile, na vanike vavandende vatambekele mu njivo ya Njambi nguavo, “Hosana Muna Ndaviti,” Nankuma vanienguele cikuma, <verse eid="MAT 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16"/>kaha vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, “Uli nakuvua evi vivalinakuhandeka ava ndi?” Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:16">“Eyo, nkuma kumuatandele nguavo, ‘Mu tunua tua vanike na vaje vali nakujamua mukemo mukahumu kulemesa ca vusunga ndi’?”<verse eid="MAT 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17"/>Kaha Yesu uavasezele, uahumine mu nganda nakuya ku Mbeteniya kukeko kuakakosele.<verse eid="MAT 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Asinga Muti ua Mukuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Mako11:12-14</ref>;<ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18"/>Cimenemene omo Yesu uakele nakuhiluka ku nganda ya Yelusalema, uevuile njala. <verse eid="MAT 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19"/>Kaha omo uamuene muti ua mukuyu ku mukulo ua ngila, uaileko kaha uauaneneko nacimo cahi kuvanga maputa lika. Kaha uahandekele kuli ukeuo nguendi, “Keti ukeme vushuka naua!” Kaha hajevene uje muti ua mukuyu uomine.<verse eid="MAT 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20"/>Omo vandongisi vacimuene valikomokelele cikuma, kaha vahandekele nguavo, “Nkuma vati honi ahavene ou muti ua mukuyu unomu?”<verse eid="MAT 21:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21"/>Kaha Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Muavusunga njimileka nguange, nga muli na lutsilielo nakuhona kulikanouela, kumukalingi lika evi vinalingiua ku muti ua mukuyu, vuno honi cipue nga mukahandeka kuli ou munkinda ngueni, ‘Katuka linga ukaliumbile mu mema a kalunga, kaha cikalingiua.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22"/>Nga muli na lutsilielo, vioshe vimukalomba muli lombelo mukavitambula.”<verse eid="MAT 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cihula ca ha Nzili Yakama ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mako11:27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23"/>Kaha omo Yesu uakovelele mu mbalanda ya njivo ya Njambi, tele acili nakulongesa, vakuluntu va tusasendote na vakuluntu vezile kuli ikeye nakuhandeka nguavo, “Nzili muka yakama ulinakulinga nayo viuma evi, iya uakuhanene eyi nzili yakama?”<verse eid="MAT 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24"/>Kaha Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Nange naua njimihula cihula kaha nga munjikumbulula, kaha nange naua njikamileka nzili yakama injikalingi nayo evi vuima. <verse eid="MAT 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25"/>Nkuma kumbuitika ca Iuano cahumine kuli? Cahumine kuilu indi cahumine ku vantu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:25">Kaha valikananganene umo na mukuavo nguavo, “Nga tuhandeka nguetu cahumine muilu, kaha akahandeka kuli yetu nguendi, ‘Nkuma vika honi kumua mutsilielelele?’ <verse eid="MAT 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26"/>Vuno honi nga tuhandeka nguetu, ‘Cahumine ku vantu,’ kaha tuteua civunga ca vantu, omo voshe vatsilielele nguavo Iuano uapuile kananguizi ua Njambi.” <verse eid="MAT 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27"/>Kaha vakumbuluile Yesu nguavo, “Kututantekeya,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:27">Kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, Kaha nange naua kunjimilekesa kuje kunjikahumisa eyi nzili yakama injili nakulinga nayo viuma evi.<verse eid="MAT 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca Vana va Vamala Vavali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28"/>“Nkuma yeni vika muhandekaho? Kuakele yala uje uakele na vana vavali va vamala, kaha uaile kuli uakulivanga nakuhandeka kuli ikeye nguendi, ‘Lelo ya ukapange mu lihia lia mikolovozi.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29"/>Kaha uamukumbuluile nguendi, ‘Kunjiiko’ vuno honi muka ntsimbu lika uatengulukile nakuya. <verse eid="MAT 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30"/>Kaha uaile kuli uamucivali nakukahandeka viakulifua, kaha uamukumbuluile nguendi ‘Njiya muene,’ vuno honi kaile. <verse eid="MAT 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31"/>Nkuma hali ava vavali iya ualingile cizango ca ishe?” Vamukumbuluile nguavo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">“Uakulivanga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, muavusunga njihandeka kuli yeni nguange, vaka kutambula lisimu na vikoyi vakovela mu vumuene vua Njambi yeni kanda. <verse eid="MAT 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32"/>Omo Iuano uezile kuli yeni mu ngila ya vusunga, kaha kumuamutsilielele, vuno honi vaka kutambula lisimu na vikoyi vamutsilielele, vuno honi cipue vene muacimuene, vuno honi kumuatengulukile nakumutsiliela.<verse eid="MAT 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca Vaka Kupanga mu Citungu ca Mikolovozi ya Vushuka vua Viniu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mako12:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele naua nguendi, “Ivuilileni cisimo cikuavo, Kuakele liavenia njivo uje uakunine lihia lia mikolovozi, kaha uazenguisileko cipatanga, kaha uahindile cina ca kukamuinamo viniu, kaha uatungile kaposhi nakusezelako vaka kupanga, kaha uaile ku cifuti ceka. <verse eid="MAT 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34"/>Omo ntsimbu ya kuteja vushuka yakele muyehi, uatumine vangamba vendi kuli vaka kupanga, linga vakambate vushuka vuendi, <verse eid="MAT 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35"/>kaha vaje vaka kupanga vakuatele vangamba vendi kaha vapupileho umo, nakutsihaho umo, kaha nakuashaho umo mavue. <verse eid="MAT 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36"/>Kaha naua uatumine vangamba veka, kupulakana va kulivanga, kaha navakevo vene vavalingile cifua cimo. <verse eid="MAT 21:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37"/>Kuhuma haje uatumine munendi kuli vakevo nguendi, ‘Vakamusingimika munange.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38"/>Vuno honi vaje vaka kupanga omo vamuene uje muana, valihandekese umo na mukuavo nguavo, ‘Ou ikeye muna uje vavenia lihia, tuyeni tumutsihe kaha tukasuana lihia liendi.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39"/>Kaha vamukuatele nakumumbila hambanza ya lihia lia mikolovozi, nakumutsiha.<verse eid="MAT 21:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40"/>“Nankuma omo liavenia lihia lia mikolovozi ua viniu akeja, nkuma akalinga vika kuli vaje vaka kupanga?”<verse eid="MAT 21:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41"/>Vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, “Akatsiha vaje vantu va vapi kaha vakatsa mua mupi, kaha akahana lije lihia lia mikolovozi ua viniu kuvaka kupanga veka vaje vakamuhana vushuka mu ntsimbu yavo.”<verse eid="MAT 21:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42"/>Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Nkuma kumuatandele mu visoneka nguavio,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">“‘Livue lije vene vaka kutunga vavianene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">likelio linapu nsina ya mu mbango.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">Eci cikeco calingile Muene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">kaha cinapu cakukomouesa kuli yetu.’”<verse eid="MAT 21:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43"/>Nankuma njimileka nguange, “Vumuene vua Njambi vaka miniekavuo nakuvuhana ku vantu vaje vema vushuka vuauo.” <verse eid="MAT 21:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44"/>Kaha muntu uoshe uje auila ha livue eli likamutetanga vipindi pindi, vuno honi nga uoshe uje likauila, likamutsena.<verse eid="MAT 21:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45"/>Omo vakuluntu vatusasendote na Vafaliseo vovuile visimo viendi, vatantekeyele nguavo hali nakuhandeka vakevo. <verse eid="MAT 21:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46"/>Vuno honi omo vesekele kumukuta, vateuele civunga ca vantu, omuo vatantekeyele nguavo ikeye kananguizi ua Njambi.<verse eid="MAT 21:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22"/>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca ciuano ca Vulo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luka14:15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1"/>Kaha naua Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo mu visimo nguendi, <verse eid="MAT 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2"/>“Vumuene vua muilu vunapu kusetekesa ngue muene uje ualingile ciuano ca vulo vua munendi ua yala, <verse eid="MAT 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3"/>kaha uatumine vangamba vendi mukusana vaje valaniene ku ciuano ca vulu, vuno honi kuvezileko. <verse eid="MAT 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4"/>Kaha uatumine vangamba vakuavo naua nguendi, ‘Lekeni vaje vavanalania, Taleni njavuahesa laja viakulia viange, vangombe vange na vimuna vange vakuhindala vanavatsihi, kaha viuma vioshe vinavuaha laja, ijeni ku ciuano ca vulo!’ <verse eid="MAT 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5"/>Vuno honi kuvahakeleleko mana, vaile kuavo, umo ku lihia liendi, mukuavo kumingoso yendi, <verse eid="MAT 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6"/>vakuavo vakuatele vaje vangamba vendi nakuvayandesa mua mupi, kaha va vatsihile. <verse eid="MAT 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7"/>Kaha muene uanienguele cikuma, kaha uatumine masualale vendi nakukavanongesa vaje vatsihile vangamba vendi nakukatsimika vinganda viavo. <verse eid="MAT 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8"/>Kaha uahandekele kuli vangamba vendi nguendi, ‘Ciuano ca vulo cavuaha laja, vuno honi vaje valaniene kuvezile. <verse eid="MAT 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9"/>Nankuma yemuye mu vimbango via vitapalo, kaha mukalanie voshe vaje vamukauana veje ku ciuano ca vulo’ <verse eid="MAT 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10"/>Kaha vaje vangamba vaile mu vitapalo nakukungulula voshe vaje vavauanene, voshe vacili na vaje va vapi, kaha ije njivo ya ciuano ca vulo yashulile na vangezi.<verse eid="MAT 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11"/>“Vuno honi omo muene uezile nakukovela mukumona vaje vangezi, uamuene ngeci yala umo kazalele vuzalo via ha vulo, <verse eid="MAT 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12"/>kaha uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, ‘Kavusamba uakovela vati muno kuakuhona kuzala vuzalo vua ha vulo?’ Kaha uahonouele viakuhandeka. <verse eid="MAT 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13"/>Ambahoni muene uahandekele kuli vaje vaka kukuasa vangezi nguendi, ‘Mukuteni ku mavoko na ku mikono, mutualeni hambanza mu milima, kuje vantu vaka lila na kulishumanga ku mazo avo.’”<verse eid="MAT 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14"/>“Omuo vavengi vanavalania, vuno honi vavandende lika vavanahangula.”<verse eid="MAT 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cihula ca Kufueta Lisimu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mako12:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15"/>Ambahoni Vafaliseo vaile nakutumba vutumbe ngeci vakamueseke navihandeka viendi. <verse eid="MAT 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16"/>Kaha vatumine vandongisi vavo kuli ikeye hamo na Helonde nguavo, “Mulongisi tutantekeya nguetu u yala uavusunga kaha ukalongesa vingila via Njambi mu vusunga, cakuhona kuteua muntu hali uoshe, omuo kuuekutala muntu muafuilamo. <verse eid="MAT 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17"/>Tuleke vika usinganieka? Nkuma cinapu lishiko kufueta lisimu kuli Sezale, indi kuahi?”<verse eid="MAT 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18"/>Vuno honi Yesu uatantekeyele laja vupi vuavo kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Yeni vaka civembulu, vika honi munjesekela? <verse eid="MAT 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19"/>Njimueseni vimbongo via lisimu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:19">Kaha vamunehelele mbongo ya muuaya uaya. <verse eid="MAT 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:20">“Cihanga ceya eci?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:20">“Kaha lizina lieya vanasonekaho?” <verse eid="MAT 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21"/>Vahandekele nguavo, “Via Sezale.” Ambahoni uahandekekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Haneni viuma via Sezale kuli Sezale, kaha haneni viuma via Njambi kuli Njambi.”<verse eid="MAT 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22"/>Omo vovuile eci valikomokelele cikuma kaha vamusezele vaile.<verse eid="MAT 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cihula ca ha Kusanguka ku Vatsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mako12:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23"/>Ha litangua lije vene Vasanduki vezile kuli Yesu, vaje vakatsiliela nguavo kuesi kusanguka kuvatsi. Kaha vamuhuile cihula nguavo,<verse eid="MAT 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24"/>Mulongisi, Mosesa uahandekele nguendi, “Nga yala atsa kuakuhona kuseza vana, kaha uje muanaye napande kuambata uje ntuluue, linga asemeneko vana vaje vanapandele kusemenako muanaye. <verse eid="MAT 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25"/>Ambahoni vapuile vatanu na vavali vamuanaye, kaha uakulivanga uambatele, kaha uatsile, kaha kasezele vana kaha uasezele uje mpueyendi kuli muanaye. <verse eid="MAT 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26"/>Cuma cakulifua calingiuile kuli uamucivali na kuli uamucitatu, nakuli uje uamu citanu na vavali. <verse eid="MAT 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27"/>Kumamanuisilo uje mpuevo uatsile. <verse eid="MAT 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28"/>Kaha mukusanguka, nankuma, akapua mpuevo yeya ha vantu ava vatanu na vavali? Omuo voshe vamuambatele.”<verse eid="MAT 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29"/>Vuno honi Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Yeni muapihisa, omuo kumutantekeya visoneka cipue nzili ya Njambi. <verse eid="MAT 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30"/>Omuo mukusanguka ku vatsi kukukakala kuambata cipue kushombuesa, vuno honi vakapua ngue tungelo va muilu. <verse eid="MAT 22:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31"/>Kaha ngue ha kusanguka kuvatsi, nkuma kumuatandele vije viahandekele Njambi kuli yeni nguendi, <verse eid="MAT 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32"/>‘Yange Njambi ua Avilahama, na Njambi ua Isake, na Njambi ya Yakomba.’ Keti Njambi ua vaka kutsa, vuno honi Njambi ua vaka kuyoya.” <verse eid="MAT 22:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33"/>Kaha omo vivunga via vantu vovuile eci, valikomokelele cikuma ha kulongesa cendi.<verse eid="MAT 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lishiko Liakama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-43">Mako12:28-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34"/>Vuno honi omo Vafaliseo vevuile nguavo naholuesa Vasanduki, kaha valikunguluile hamo lika. <verse eid="MAT 22:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35"/>Kaha umo uavo, uje uapuile muka kuimanena mashiko, uamuhuile cihula cakumueseka nguendi, <verse eid="MAT 22:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36"/>“Mulongisi, nkuma lishiko muka liakama ku mashiko oshe?”<verse eid="MAT 22:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37"/>“Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, ‘Ukazanga Muene Njambi yove na mutima uove uoshe, na muono uove uoshe, na mana ove oshe.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38"/>Eli likelio lishiko liakama lia kulivanga. <verse eid="MAT 22:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39"/>Kaha lia mucivali eli, ‘Zanga mukueni ngue muje muualizangela yove vavenia.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40"/>Ha mashiko aua avali hakeho hanemana mashiko oshe na tunanguizi va Njambi.”<verse eid="MAT 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cihula ca hali Kilistu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mako12:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-44">Luka20:1-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41"/>Honi omo Vafaliseo valikunguluile hamo, Yesu uavehuile cihula, <verse eid="MAT 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42"/>uahandekele nguendi, “Vika musinganieka hali Kilistu? Uapua Muna iya?” Vamukumbuluile nguavo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:42">“Muna Ndaviti.”<verse eid="MAT 22:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43"/>Kaha Yesu uavehuile nguendi, “Capuile vati honi, nkuma Ndaviti” vamulongesele kuli Cimbembesi, linga amusane Muene, omo uahandekele nguendi,<verse eid="MAT 22:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44"/>“‘Muene uahandekele kuli Muene yange nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">Tumama ku livoko liange lia cilio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">noho njikahaka vitozi vove muintsi lia viliato viove’?<verse eid="MAT 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45"/>Nga Ndaviti amusana nguendi Muene, nkuma akapua vati naua munendi?”<verse eid="MAT 22:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46"/>Kaha naumo uahi uasele kumutava lizi, nankuma kuhuma ha litangua lije vene naumo uahi uesekele kumuihula cihula naua.<verse eid="MAT 22:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu Anangula hali Valongisi va Lishiko na Vafaliseo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Mako12:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43-46">Luka11:43-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">20:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1"/>Ambahoni Yesu uahandekele ku civunga na kuli vandongisi vendi nguendi, <verse eid="MAT 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2"/>“Valongisi va lishiko na Vafaliseo vatumama ha cituamo ca Mosesa, <verse eid="MAT 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3"/>kaha lingeni nakutala vioshe vije vamileka, vuno honi keti vije vivalinga, omuo vakambulula vije kuvekulinga. <verse eid="MAT 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4"/>Vakakutu viteli via kulema vije viavikalu kuviambata, nakuvituika ha vitsili via vantu, vuno honi vakevo kuvekujundulako cipue na munie uavo ha kuvijundula. <verse eid="MAT 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5"/>Vioshe vije vivakalingi, vakavilingila linga vantu vavamone, omuo vakakutiliya mikanda ya visoneka ha maholo avo na ha mavoko avo, na vulaha vua tundombe tua tuzaku tuavo, <verse eid="MAT 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6"/>kaha vakevo vazanga cihela ca vulemu ku viuano na vitumamo viacili mu vinjivo via malombelo, <verse eid="MAT 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7"/>nakuvameneka nakasingimiko ku vihela via kulandesela, nakuvasana nguavo ‘Mulongisi’ ku vantu. <verse eid="MAT 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8"/>Vuno honi yeni keti vamisane mulongisi, omuo muli lika na mulongisi umo lika, kaha yeni voshe muva vusamba. <verse eid="MAT 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9"/>Kaha keti mukasaneho muntu hali uoshe ‘Tate’ hano ha mavu, omuo muli lika na Ishueni umo, uje hali muilu. <verse eid="MAT 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10"/>Naua keti vakamisane muene, omuo muli lika na muene umo, ikeye Kilistu. <verse eid="MAT 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11"/>Uoshe uje uakama hhakati keni akapua ngamba yeni. <verse eid="MAT 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12"/>Uoshe uje alijundula ikeye vavenia vaka mukehesa, kaha uoshe uje alikehesa ikeye vavenia vaka mujundula.<verse eid="MAT 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Avahisa ha Civembulu cavo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:40">Mako12:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Luka11:39-42</ref>;<ref loc="LUK 11:44">44</ref>;<ref loc="LUK 11:52">52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">20:47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13"/>“Vuno honi tuyando kuli yeni, valongisi va mashiko na Vafaliseo, yeni vaka civembulu! Omuo mukashoko vikolo via vumuene vua muilu ku vantu, omuo neni vavenia kumue kukovelamo, cipue kutavesa vaje vatonda linga vakovele. <verse eid="MAT 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14"/>Cisingo kuli yeni, valongisi va mashiko na Vafaliseo, yeni vaka civembulu! Omuo yeni mukapihisa vinjivo via vantuluue mukulimuesa ha kulombela malombelo alaha. Nankuma mukatambula cihiso cakama.<verse eid="MAT 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15"/>“Cisingo kuli yeni, valongisi va mashiko na Vafaliseo, yeni vaka civembulu! Omuo yeni mukendangana ku mema a kalunga naku ntunda linga mutengululeko muntu umo, kaha omo natenguluka, mukamupuisa luvali kupua muana ua ngehena ngue yeni.<verse eid="MAT 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16"/>“Cisingo kuli yeni vantuama vatupuputua, yeni vaje mukahandeka ngueni, ‘Nga umo alisinga na njivo ya Njambi, kaha cinapu cangoco, vuno honi nga umo alisinga na ngolinde ya njivo ya Njambi, kaha vanamukutu nacisingo cendi.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17"/>Yeni tupuputua va vilema! Nkuma cika cakama, ngolinde indi njivo ya Njambi ije ilingisa ngolinde linga ipue yakulela? <verse eid="MAT 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18"/>Kaha mukahandeka ngueni, ‘Nga umo alisinga na mutula, kaha cinapu cangoco, vuno honi nga umo alisinga na vuana vuje vuli ha mutula, kaha vanamukutu nacisingo cendi.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19"/>Yeni vantu vatupuputua! Nkuma cika cakama, vuana indi mutula uje ulingisa vuana linga vupue vuakulela? <verse eid="MAT 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20"/>Nankuma uoshe uje alisinga na mutula, nalisingi nauo na vioshe vije viliho, <verse eid="MAT 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21"/>kaha uoshe uje alisinga na njivo ya Njambi, nalisingi nayo na uoshe uje uakalamo, <verse eid="MAT 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22"/>kaha uoshe uje alisinga na lilu, nalisingi na litanda lia Njambi na uoshe uje uatumamaho.<verse eid="MAT 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23"/>“Cisingo kuli yeni, valongisi va lishiko na Vafaliseo, yeni vaka civembulu! Omuo yeni mukahana cavulikumi ca viuma vije mukatovesa mu visapa sapa via minte na ndilu na kumine, nakuyengula viuma viaseho via lishiko, via vusunga na cikeketima na lutsilielo, vije vimuapandele kulinga cakuhona kuyengula vikuavo. <verse eid="MAT 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24"/>Yeni vantuama vatupuputua, mukahumisa mbulumbulu mu viakunua vieni nakuminisa kamelu!<verse eid="MAT 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25"/>“Cisingo kuli yeni, valongisi va lishiko na Vafaliseo, yeni vaka civembulu! Omuo yeni mukakushu nganja na lilonga hambanza yavio, vuno honi mukati kavio muashulu nalizangamena nakulizanga yeni vavenia. <verse eid="MAT 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26"/>Yeni Vafaliseo vatupuputua! Cakulivanga tahi kusheni mukati ka nganja na lilonga, kaha na helu liavio hakatoka.<verse eid="MAT 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27"/>“Cisingo kuli yeni valongisi va lishiko na Vafaliseo, yeni vaka civembulu! Omuo yeni munapu ngue vihilo vije vivanakushu kaha vinatoko too, vije hambanza liavio vimoneka muacili, vuno honi mukati kavio munashulu na vitsihia via vantu vakutsa na via mazilo vioshe. <verse eid="MAT 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28"/>Omu mukemo neni vene mumuli nakusholoka, hambanza musholoka ngue vaka vusunga ku vantu, vuno honi mukati keni munashulu na civembulu na vupi.<verse eid="MAT 23:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Avaleka Kashitiku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:47-51">Luka11:47-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29"/>“Cisingo kuli yeni valongisi va lishiko na Vafaliseo, yeni vaka civembulu! Omuo yeni mukatungu vihilo via tunanguizi va Njambi va Njambi nakupesapesa viakumunga via vaka vusunga, <verse eid="MAT 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30"/>nakuhandeka ngueni, ‘Nga tuayoyele mu matangua aje a vatatetu, ngue kutualingile vije vivalingile vakevo viakumuania maninga a tunanguizi va Njambi va Njambi.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31"/>Nankuma mulina vukaleho hali yeni vavenia, ngueni mu vana va vaje vatsihile tunanguizi va Njambi va Njambi. <verse eid="MAT 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32"/>Nkumani shulisiseni seteko ya va ishueni. <verse eid="MAT 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33"/>Yeni manoka, yeni vana va manoka, nkuma mukateua vati cihiso ca ngehena? <verse eid="MAT 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34"/>Nankuma njimitumina tunanguizi va Njambi va Njambi na vaka mana na valongisi va lishiko, vamo vaje vamukatsihia na kushukika ha cilindakano, kaha vamo mukavapupa mu vinjivo vieni via malombelo, nakuvapakesa huma mu mbonge na kuya mbonge ikuavo. <verse eid="MAT 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35"/>Kaha mukatambula kashitiku ka kutsiha vantu voshe vaje vakuhona mulonga, kuhuma ku maninga aua vusunga Avele kuya ku maninga a Zakaliya muna Mbelekiya, uje imuatsihilile mukati ka njivo ya Njambi na mutula. <verse eid="MAT 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36"/>Muavusunga njimileka nguange, cihiso coshe cikeja hali vantu va ntsimbu ino.<verse eid="MAT 23:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cizango ca Yesu hali Yelusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luka13:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37"/>“Yove Yelusalema, Yelusalema, mukakutsiha tunanguizi va Njambi va Njambi nakuasha mavue vaje va vanatumu kuli yove! Nkuma vintsimbu vingahi njakunguluile vana vove hamolika ngue cali muakavutamena vana vendi mu mambava endi, kaha yove kuuatondelemo! <verse eid="MAT 23:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38"/>Tala, njivo yove vanaiseze kaha ili mupulungua. <verse eid="MAT 23:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39"/>Kaha njikuleka nguange, ku ukanjimonoho naua, kuvanga noho ukahandeka nguove ‘Nakuisuliua uje eja mu lizina lia Muene.’”<verse eid="MAT 23:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu Ahandeka hakunonga ca Njivo ya Njambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1">Mako13:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luka21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1"/>Yesu uahumine mu njivo na kuya, kaha vandongisi vendi vezile kuli ikeye nakumumuesa vinjivo via Njambi. <verse eid="MAT 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2"/>Vuno honi uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Munamono viuma vioshe evi, indi kuahi? Muavusunga njihandeka kuli yeni nguange, kukuesi cipue livue limo likasala halikuavo, lije kuvakombila ha mavu.”<verse eid="MAT 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tuyando na Mapakeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mako13:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luka21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3"/>Kaha omo Yesu uatumamene ha munkinda ua Oliveta, vandongisi vendi vezile kuli ikeye muvusueke nakuhandeka nguavo, “Tuleke ntsimbu muka eci cikalingika, kaha cimueso muka cikalingiua hakuija cove na ha ntsimbu ya kuhua ca mavu?” <verse eid="MAT 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4"/>Kaha Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Zangameni linga keti umo akamikuise. <verse eid="MAT 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5"/>Omuo vavengi vakeja mu lizina liange, nguavo, ‘Yange Kilistu!’ kaha vakakuisa vavengi. <verse eid="MAT 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6"/>Kaha mukevua vinzita nakalua ka vinzita, keti mukakomoke, omuo evi viapande kulingiua, vuno honi eci keti cikeco kukotoka ca mavu. <verse eid="MAT 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7"/>Omuo lifuti likatengulukila lifuti likuavo, vumuene vukatengulukila vumuene vukuavo, ku kakala njala ya liangangala na mandunduma ku mitambela ya kuliseza seza. <verse eid="MAT 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8"/>Evi vinapu ngue kuputuka ca mushongo uakusema.<verse eid="MAT 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9"/>“Ambahoni vakamituala mukuyanda, nakumitsiha, kaha vaka mafuti voshe vaka mizinda omuo ya lizina liange. <verse eid="MAT 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10"/>Kaha ambahoni vavengi lutsilielo luavo lukahua, kaha vakalienda vungungu umo na mukuavo na kulizinda umo na mukuavo. <verse eid="MAT 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11"/>Kaha tunanguizi va Njambi va makuli vavengi vakeja na kukuisa vavengi. <verse eid="MAT 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12"/>Omuo kulivuezelela ca vupi cinapu cakama, kaha cizango ca vantu vavengi cikatontola. <verse eid="MAT 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13"/>Vuno honi uoshe uje akakateya nankuma manusuilo a kovoka. <verse eid="MAT 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14"/>Kaha muzimbu uacili ou ua vumuene vaka uambulula ha mavu oshe, kupua ngue vukaleho ku mafuti oshe, ambahoni mamanusuilo akeja.<verse eid="MAT 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cimueso ca Shuama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Mako13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15"/>“Nankuma omo mukamona cimueso ca shuama cije cahandekele kananguizi Ndaniele cinemana mu cihela ca kulela,” (Yove uli na kutanda uvuisisa muvinalumbunukila!) <verse eid="MAT 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16"/>Kaha eceleni vaje vali mu Yundeya vateuele ku minkinda, <verse eid="MAT 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17"/>uoshe uje hali helu lia njivo keti ashuluke ha mavu, linga ambate vije vili mu njivo yendi, <verse eid="MAT 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18"/>kaha uoshe hali mu lihia keti ahiluke kunima nakuambata cikovelo cendi. <verse eid="MAT 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19"/>Caluvinda kuli vaje vali navana na kuli vaje vajamuesa mu matangua aje! <verse eid="MAT 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20"/>Lombeleni linga keti cikalingike mu cisika cipue ha litangua lia sapalalo. <verse eid="MAT 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21"/>Omuo honi ha matangua aje kukakala tuyando, tuje kutuakeleko hume kuputuka ca lifuti kuheta na lelo, kuahi, kaha ku cikakalako naua. <verse eid="MAT 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22"/>Kaha nga aje matangua kauakehesele nga na muntu uahi akovoka, vuno honi omuo ya vantu vendi vaje vahanguile, matangua aje vaka akehesa.<verse eid="MAT 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23"/>“Vuno honi, nga umo ahandeka kuli yeni nguendi, ‘Taleni Kilistu uno!’ cipue ‘Uje ali kuje!’ keti mucitsiliele.” <verse eid="MAT 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24"/>Omuo Vakilistu va makuli na tunanguizi va Njambi va makuli vakasholoka nakulinga vitantekeyeso na vikomouesa, linga vamizimbalese, nga casiua nakuli vaje vavanahangula. <verse eid="MAT 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25"/>Vuno honi njamileke ntsimbu kanda ihete.<verse eid="MAT 24:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26"/>“Cipue nga vahandeka kuli yeni nguavo, ‘Taleni ali mu mpambo,’ keti muyeko, cipue nga vahandeka nguavo, ‘Taleni, ali mu mulili ua mukati!’ keti mucitsiliele. <verse eid="MAT 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27"/>Omuo ngue mulengi ukahuma ku ngangela nakatua ceke kuheta na ku kangombe ka yambi, eci cikapua kuija ca Muna Muntu.<verse eid="MAT 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28"/>“Kuoshe kuje kuli civimbi kukeko kukalikunguluila makuvi.<verse eid="MAT 24:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuija ca Muna Muntu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mako13:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29"/>“Hanima ya tuyando hamatangua aje litangua likalava, kaha ngonde kuikatu ceke, na vintanga ntanga vikaua kuhuma kuilu, kaha nzili ya melu ikaninganga. <verse eid="MAT 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30"/>Ambahoni kukasholoka cimueso ca Muna Muntu muilu, kaha miyati yoshe ya hamavu ikalila, kaha vakamona Muna Muntu eja mu mashuela amuilu na nzili na vumpau vuakama. <verse eid="MAT 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31"/>Kaha akatuma tungelo vendi na mutambi ua lipenga, kaha akakungulula vantu vendi vahanguile kuhuma ku vimpunzi viuana, kuhuma ku mamanusuilo a muilu nakukuavo.”<verse eid="MAT 24:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cilongesa ca Muti ua Mukuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mako13:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:9-33">Luka21:9-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32"/>“Lilongeseni cilongesa ca muti ua mukuyu, omuo mintango yauo ishoshela nakuhaka maputa, kaha muatantekeya ngueni ntondue ili muyehi. <verse eid="MAT 24:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33"/>Kaha omo mumona viuma vioshe evi, kaha mutantekeye ngueni ntsimbu ili muyehi, ku vikolo. <verse eid="MAT 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34"/>Muavusunga njimileka nguange, vantu va ntsimbu ino kuvakatsi kuvanga vuima vioshe evi vinalingiua. <verse eid="MAT 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35"/>Melu na mavu vioshe vikahita, vuno honi mezi ange kuuakahu.”<verse eid="MAT 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Naumo uahi Atantekeya Litangua cipue Hola</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Mako13:32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luka17:26-30</ref>;<ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36"/>“Vuno honi ha litangua lije cipue hola naumo uahi atantekeya, cipue vene tungelo va muilu, cipue Muana, vuno honi kuvanga lika Tate. <verse eid="MAT 24:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37"/>Ngue mucafuile ku matangua a Noua, mukemo vene mucikafua hakuija ca Muna Muntu. <verse eid="MAT 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38"/>Omuo ngue mu matangua aje tele livazi kanda lije vantu valile na kunua, kuambata na kushombuesa, kutuala na ha litangua Noua uakovelele mu vuato, <verse eid="MAT 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39"/>Kaha kuvatantekeyele noho livazi liezile nakuvanongesa voshe, kaha mukemo mu cikafua akuija kua Muna Mutu. <verse eid="MAT 24:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40"/>Kaha vamala vavali vakapua mulihia, kaha umo vakamuambata umo vakamuseza. <verse eid="MAT 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41"/>Kaha vampuevo vavali vakatua mucini cimo, kaha umo va kamuambata, mukuavo vakamuseza. <verse eid="MAT 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42"/>Zangameni omuo kumutantekeya litangua lije Muene yeni akeja. <verse eid="MAT 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43"/>Vuno honi tantekeyeni eci, nga liavenia njivo akatantekeya ntsimbu muka ya vutsiki muizi akeja, kaha nga akavandamena, nakumona nguendi njivo yendi kuvaituvu. <verse eid="MAT 24:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44"/>Nankuma neni naua munapande kulivuahesela, omuo Muna Muntu akeja ha hola ije kumutantekeya.”<verse eid="MAT 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ngamba Uakulongua cipue Uakuhona kulongua</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luka12:41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45"/>“Iya honi ngamba ua kulongua na mana uje muene uendi uamuhakele kuendesa vakuavo vangamba nakuvahana viakulia ha ntsimbu ya kupuamo? <verse eid="MAT 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46"/>Nakuisuliua uje ngamba omo muene uendi omo ahiluka amuuana hali nakulinga mujevene. <verse eid="MAT 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47"/>Muavusunga njimileka nguange, akamupuisa kupua mukuluntu ua vufuko vuendi vioshe. <verse eid="MAT 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48"/>Vuno honi nga uje ngamba uendi uamupi ahandeka kuli ikeye vavenia nguendi, ‘Muene uange neshuala kuhiluka,’ <verse eid="MAT 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49"/>kaha aputuka kupupa vangamba vakuavo, na kulia na kunua na vaka kupenda, <verse eid="MAT 24:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50"/>muene ua uje ngamba akeja ha litangua olio ka muvandamenene na hola ije katantekeya, <verse eid="MAT 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51"/>kaha akamuhana kashitiko na kumuhaka hamo nava kacivembulu, vantu vaje vakalila na kulishumanga ku mazo.”<verse eid="MAT 24:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25"/>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca Vambanda Likumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1"/>“Ha ntsimbu ije vumuene vua muilu vaka vuesekesa ngue vambanda likumi vaje vambatele vindeya viavo nakuya linga vakaliuane na liavenia vulo. <verse eid="MAT 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2"/>Vuno honi ava vatanu vapuile viheve, kaha vatanu vapuile vamana. <verse eid="MAT 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3"/>Omo vaje vambanda vakuheva vambatele vindeya viavo, kuvambatele na mazi eka naua, <verse eid="MAT 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4"/>vuno honi vaje vamana vambatele mazi mu vintsazi na mu vindeya viavo. <verse eid="MAT 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5"/>Kaha omo uje liavenia vulo uakotokelele kuija, kaha voshe vaje vambanda vanengukile na kuya mutulo.”<verse eid="MAT 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6"/>“Vuno honi mukati ka vutsiki vevuile mutambi nguavo, ‘Taleni liavenia vulo uje hali nakuija! Tuhukeni linga muliuane nendi.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7"/>Kaha voshe vaje vambanda vahindukile nakushukumisa vindeya viavo. <verse eid="MAT 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8"/>Kaha vaje vakuheva vahandekele kuli vamana nguavo, ‘Tuhaneniko amo mazi eni, omuo vindeya vietu vitonda kuzima.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9"/>Vuno honi vaje vambanda vamana vakumbuluile nguavo, ‘Kutupuisamo kulipangelauo yetu neni, yemuye kuli vakakulandesa linga mukalilandele yeni vavenia.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10"/>Kaha tele vanayi mukulanda, liavenia vulo uezile, kaha vaje valivuaheselele vaile nendi ku ciuano ca vulo, kaha vashokele ku cikolo.”<verse eid="MAT 25:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11"/>“Hanima honi vaje vambanda vaviheve vezile vahandekele nguavo, ‘Muene, muene, tushokolueleko.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12"/>Vuno honi uavakumbuluile nguendi, ‘Muavusunga njihandeka kuli yeni nguange, kunjimitantekeya.’”<verse eid="MAT 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13"/>Nankuma zangameni, omuo kumutantekeya litangua cipue hola.<verse eid="MAT 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca Vangamba Vatatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luka19:11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14"/>“Kaha naua Yesu uavalekele nguendi, vumuene vua muilu vukafua ngue yala omo aya mu vungenzi kaha asana vangamba vendi, nakuvasezela vupite vuendi. <verse eid="MAT 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15"/>Kuli umo uahanene makulukazi atanu a vimbazuvuila via ngolinde, kuli mukuavo makulukazi avali a vimbazuvuila via ngolinde, kuli mukuavo likulukazi limo lia vimbazuvuila via ngolinde, kuya kuvipangi viavo kaha uaile. <verse eid="MAT 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16"/>Kaha uje uatambuile makulukazi atanu a vimbazuvuila via ngolinde uaile hajevene uakavilanduluile, kaha uakapangeleleho naua makulukazi atanu a vimbazuvuila via ngolinde. <verse eid="MAT 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17"/>Kaha naua na uje mukuavo uatambuile makulukazi avali a vimbazuvuila via ngolinde, uapangeleleho naua makulukazi avali a vimbazuvuila via ngolinde. <verse eid="MAT 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18"/>Vuno honi uje ngamba uatambuile likulukazi limo lia vimbazuvuila via ngolinde uaile, nakukahinda cina nakushitikamo vimbongo via muene uendi.”<verse eid="MAT 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19"/>“Omo kuetile matangua amengi muene ua vaje vangamba uehilukile kaha uatandele navo vije vimbazuvuila via ngolinde. <verse eid="MAT 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20"/>Kaha uje uatambuile makulukazi atanu a vimbazuvuila via ngolinde uezile, kaha uaneheleleho naua makulukazi atanu a vimbazuvuila via ngolinde, nakuhandeka nguendi, ‘Muene uanjihanene makulukazi atanu a vimbazuvuila via ngolinde, kaha naua njapangelaho makulukazi atanu a vimbazuvuila via ngolinde eka naua.’” <verse eid="MAT 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21"/>“Muene uendi uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, ‘Ualingi muacili, ngamba uacili uakukonkama! Unapu uakunkokama a viuma via vindende, njikakupuisa mukuluntu uaviuma viavingi. Kovela mukuvuahelele ca muene yove.’” <verse eid="MAT 25:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22"/>“Kaha na uje uatambuile makulukazi avali a vimbazuvuila via ngolinde uezile kuli ikeye nguendi, ‘Muene uanjihanene makulukazi avali a vimbazuvuila via ngolinde, hano njapangelaho makulukazi avali a vimbazuvuila via ngolinde eka naua.’” <verse eid="MAT 25:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23"/>“Muene uendi uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, ‘Ualingi muacili, ngamba uacili uakunkokama! Unapu uakunkokama a viuma via vindende, njikakupuisa mukuluntu uaviuma viavingi. Kovela mukuvuahelele ca muene yove.’” <verse eid="MAT 25:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24"/>“Kaha na uje uatambuile likulukazi limo, lia ngolinde uezile, uahandekele kuli muene uendi nguendi, ‘Muene njakutantekeya nguange uapua u muntu uamukalu cikuma, ukateja vije kuuakuvile, kaha ukakungulula vije kuuashanduile, <verse eid="MAT 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25"/>kaha njevuile liova, kaha njaile nakushitika ngolinde yove mu livu. Viuma viove evi.’” <verse eid="MAT 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26"/>Vuno honi muene uendi uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Yove ngamba uamupi ua cilenda! Uatantekeyele nguove njikateje kuje kunjakuvile, kaha njikakungulula vije kunjashanduile? <verse eid="MAT 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27"/>Ambahoni uasinganiekele kutulikisa vimbongo viange kuli vakakutulika vimbongo, kaha nga hakuija cange ngue njatambuile vije viapuile viange na kakondueso kayo. <verse eid="MAT 25:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28"/>‘Mutambuleni vimbongo vije vili kuli ikeye, kaha vianeni kuli uje hali na makulukazi avimbongo likumi. <verse eid="MAT 25:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29"/>Omuo uje alinavio vakamuvuezelelako, kaha akakala na viavingi, vuno honi uje kesi navio, cipue vene vije via vindende vialinavio vakamuniekavio. <verse eid="MAT 25:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30"/>Nakushekela ngamba uje kesi nacimo ha mbaza ya milima, kuje vantu vakalila na kulishumanga mazo avo.’<verse eid="MAT 25:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kusompa ca Mamanusuilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31"/>“Omo Muna Muntu akeja mu vumpau vuendi, hamo na tungelo vendi voshe, kaha akatumama halitanda liendi lia vumpau. <verse eid="MAT 25:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32"/>Kuli ikeye miyati yoshe ya vantu ikalikungulula, kaha akavatepesa umo ku mukuavo ngue kaniungi muakatepesa vampanga ku vampembe, <verse eid="MAT 25:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33"/>Kaha akahaka vampanga ku livoko liendi lia cilio, vuno honi vampembe ku livoko liendi lia cimoshue. <verse eid="MAT 25:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34"/>Ambahoni Muene akahandeka kuli vaje vali ku livoko liendi lia cilio nguendi, ‘Ijeni, yeni vanakuisuliua kuli Tate suaneni vumuene vuje vuanamivuaheselele kuhuma ha luvula lua mavu. <verse eid="MAT 25:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35"/>Omuo njakele na njala muanjihanene viakulia, kaha omo njakele na mpuila muanjihanene mema akunua, kaha omo njakele njimungezi muanjitambuile, <verse eid="MAT 25:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36"/>njakele mitotototo muacizikile, njakele nakuvavala kaha muanjimenekelele, njakele mu kamenga kaha muezile mukunjimona.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37"/>Ambahoni vaka vusunga vakamukumbulula nguavo, ‘Muene, kuli tuakumuene uli na njala kaha tuakulisile, cipue unevu mpuila kaha tuakunuisile? <verse eid="MAT 25:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38"/>Kaha kuli tuakumuene umungezi kaha tuakutambuile cipue mutotototo kaha tuakuzikile? <verse eid="MAT 25:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39"/>Kaha kuli tuakumuene uli nakuvavala cipue uli mu kamenga kaha tuezile nakukumona?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40"/>Kaha muene akavakumbulula nguendi, ‘Muavusunga njimileka nguange omo muacilingile ku vamo ava va vusamba vange, mua cilingile kuli yange.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41"/>Ambahoni akahandeka kuli voshe vaje vali ku livoko liendi lia cimoshue nguendi, ‘Humeni kuli yange, yeni vaka kusingiua! Yeni mu tuhia tua miaka yoshe tuje tuvanavuahesela liyavolo na tungelo vendi. <verse eid="MAT 25:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42"/>Omuo njakele na njala kumuanjihanene via kulia, njakele na mpuila kumuanjihanene mema akunua, <verse eid="MAT 25:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43"/>njakele njimungezi kaha kumuanjitambuile, njakele mitotototo kaha kumuanjizikile, njavavalele nakukala mukamenga kaha kumuacimenekelele.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44"/>Ambahoni navakevo vakakumbulula nguavo, ‘Muene kuli tuakumuene uli na njala, cipue uli na mpuila, cipue umungezi, cipue mutotototo, cipue uvavala, cipue mu kamenga, kaha kutuakukuasele?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45"/>Ambahoni akavakumbulula nguendi, ‘Muavusunga njimileka nguange, ngue muje kumuacilingile kuli umo uava vavandende, kumuacilingile kuli yange’ <verse eid="MAT 25:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46"/>Kaha vakaya mukashitiko ka miaka yoshe, vuno honi vaka vusunga vakakovela mu muono ua yaye.”<verse eid="MAT 25:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26"/>
  <para style="s">Vutumbe vua Kutsiha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mako14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Iuano11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1"/>Omo Yesu uamanusuile kuhandeka vuima vioshe evi, uahandekele kuli vandongisi vendi nguendi, <verse eid="MAT 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2"/>“Muatantekeya ngueni omo munima ya matangua avali paseka ili na kuija, kaha Muna Muntu vaka muhana linga vakamushukike hacilindakano.”<verse eid="MAT 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3"/>Ambahoni vakuluntu vatusasendote na vakuluntu va vantu valikunguluile mu lipela lia kasasendote uakama, uje ivatumbuile nguavo Kayafase, <verse eid="MAT 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4"/>kaha vatumbile vutumbe hamo linga vakute Yesu mu vushueke nakumutsiha. <verse eid="MAT 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5"/>Vuno honi vahandekele nguavo, “Keti a ciuano, hamo vantu vakaneha mpindangano.”<verse eid="MAT 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vavuavesa Yesu ku Mbeteniya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mako14:3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Iuano12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6"/>Kaha omo Yesu uakele ku Mbeteniya mu njivo ya Simoni yala uje uakele na mbumba, <verse eid="MAT 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7"/>Omo Yesu te uakele nakulia kumesa, mpuevo umo uezile kuli ikeye na ntsazi ya mazi andando yakama hakunika luengo luacili, kaha uahetilile ha mutue ua Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8"/>Vuno honi omo vandongisi vacimuene vanienguele cikuma nakuhandeka nguavo, “Nkuma vika apihisila mazi? <verse eid="MAT 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9"/>Omuo mazi aua vapandele kuualandesa na ndando yakama, nakuana vimbongo vihutu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10"/>Vuno honi Yesu uatantekeyele vioshe evi, uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Nkuma vika muli nakushupila ou mpuevo? Omuo na lingi cuma ca cili kuli yange. <verse eid="MAT 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11"/>Omuo yeni ntsimbu yoshe muakala na vihutu, vuno honi ntsimbu yoshe yeni kumukakala nange. <verse eid="MAT 26:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12"/>Ha kunjitila aua mazi a muvila uange na cilingi kunjivuahesela kunjitsinda. <verse eid="MAT 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13"/>Muavusunga njimileka nguange, kuoshe kuje ku vakambulula muzimbu uacili ha mavu uoshe, evi vianalingi ou mpuevo vakavihandeka mukumuvulukilaho.”<verse eid="MAT 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yundasa Atava kuenda Yesu Vungungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mako14:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14"/>Kaha umo ua vaje vandongi likumi na vavali uje ivatumbuile nguavo Yundasa Isakaliote, uaile kuli vakuluntu vatusasendote, <verse eid="MAT 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15"/>na kuhandeka nguendi, “Vika mukanjihana nga njiminehelaye?” Kaha vamufuetele makumi atatu a vimbongo via siliva. <verse eid="MAT 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16"/>Kaha kuhuma ha ntsimbu ije uatondesesele ngila ya kuendelamo Yesu vungungu.<verse eid="MAT 26:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Alia na Vandongisi Vendi ku Ciuano ca Paseka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mako14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Luka22:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:23">21:23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Iuano13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17"/>Ha litangua lia kulivanga lia mbolo ya kuhona cimbaluila vandongisi vezile kuli Yesu nakuhandeka nguavo, “Kuli utonda yetu nguove tukuvuahesele linga ukalileko paseka?”<verse eid="MAT 26:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18"/>Uahandekele nguendi, “Yeni mu nganda kuli yala umo, kaha mukahandeke kuli ikeye ngueni, ‘Mulongisi nahandeka nguendi, ntsimbu yange inahete, njikalinga ciuano ca paseka mu njivo yove hamo na vandongisi vange.’”<verse eid="MAT 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19"/>Kaha vaje vandongisi valingile ngue muje Yesu uavalekele, kaha vavuahesele ciuano ca paseka. <verse eid="MAT 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20"/>Omo vetele ku cinguezi, Yesu uatumamene kumesa na vandongisi likumi na vavali, <verse eid="MAT 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21"/>kaha omo vakele na kulia, uahandekele nguendi, “Muavusunga, Njihandeka ku liyeni nguange, umo ueni akanjenda vungungu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22"/>Kaha vakele na vusiua cikuma, kaha vaputukile kuhandeka kuli umo na mukuavo nguavo, “Muene yange ndi?” <verse eid="MAT 26:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23"/>Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Uje akatanta hamo nange mu lilonga, ikeye vene akanjenda vungungu. <verse eid="MAT 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24"/>Omuo Muna Muntu akatsa ngue muje vanacisoneka hali ikeye, vuno honi tuyando hali uje yala enda vungungu Muna Muntu! Ngue capuile cacili kuli uje yala nga kasemukile.”<verse eid="MAT 26:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25"/>Yundasa uje uamuendele vungungu uendekele nguendi, “Muene yange ndi?” Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Omo vene munahandeka.”<verse eid="MAT 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mesa ya Muene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mako14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Kolinte11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26"/>Kaha honi omo vakele nakulia, Yesu ua mbatele mbolo, na ku ikuisula, kaha uaipazuile, naku ihana kuli vandongisi vendi, nguendi “Ambateni mulie ou ukeuo muvila uange.”<verse eid="MAT 26:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27"/>Kaha uambatele nganja, kaha omo uamanuisuile kusantsela uavahanene, nguendi “Nuenimo mu vavoshe, <verse eid="MAT 26:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28"/>omuo aua akeuo maninga ange a litavasano lihaliha, aje anamuaniena hali vavengi mukukonekela vupi. <verse eid="MAT 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29"/>Njimileka nguange, kunjikanuho naua vushuka vua viniu kuvanga noho ha litangua lije omo njikanua neni vushuka vua viniu vuavuha mu vumuene vua Tate,”<verse eid="MAT 26:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30"/>Kaha omo vamanusuile kuimba muaso, vaile ku munkinda ua Oliveta.<verse eid="MAT 26:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Ahandeka nguendi Petulu Akamuviana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mako14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Iuano13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vandongisi vendi nguendi, “Muva voshe mukateua omuo yange vutsiki vuno vene, omuo vacisoneka nguavo, ‘Njikapupa kanuingi, kaha vutanga vua vampanga vukalishandoka!’ <verse eid="MAT 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32"/>Vuno honi hanima ya kunjisangula, njikaya kulutue lueni ku Ngalileya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33"/>Petulu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Cipue vene voshe vakakuteua, yange kunjikakuteue.”<verse eid="MAT 26:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34"/>Yesu uahandekele kuli Petulu nguendi, “Muavusunga njikuleka nguange, vutsiki vuno vene, ntsimbu kanda ndemba atambeke ukanjiviana lutatu nguove kuunjitantekeya.” <verse eid="MAT 26:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35"/>Petulu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Cipue vene nga kutsa nove, kunjikakuviana.” Kaha na vandongisi vakuavo voshe vahandekele ngoco vene.<verse eid="MAT 26:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Alombela mu Ngetesemani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mako14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:39-46">Luka2:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36"/>Ambahoni Yesu uaile navo kumutambela uvatumbuile nguavo Ngetesemani, kaha uahandekele kuli vandongisi vendi nguendi, “Tumameni hano ntsimbu njiciya nakulombela.”<verse eid="MAT 26:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37"/>Kaha uaile na Petulu na vana va Zembendeo vavali, kaha hajevene uaputukile kulivua vusiua na kulinienga. <verse eid="MAT 26:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38"/>Kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Muono uange uli muvusiua noho kukutsa, saleni hano, nakutalelela hamo nange.”<verse eid="MAT 26:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39"/>Kaha uaile halahako cindende, uatsikamene hamavu na kulombela nguendi, “Tate, nga casiua, ecela eyi nganja injipulakane, keti kulingiue cizango cange, vuno honi kulingiue cizango cove.”<verse eid="MAT 26:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40"/>Kaha uehilukile kuli vandongisi vendi uavauanene vanakosa tulo, kaha uahandekele kuli Petulu nguendi, “Nkuma kuuasa kutalelela nange cipue hola imo lika indi? <verse eid="MAT 26:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41"/>Taleleni nakulombela linga keti mukovele mu vieseko, cilivene cimbembesi citonda, vuno honi ntsitu inazeye.”<verse eid="MAT 26:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42"/>Uaile naua lua mucivali na kulombela nguendi, “Tate, nga kucasiua nganja eyi kunjipulaka kuvanga vene njiinuine, kaha ecela cizango cove cilingiue.” <verse eid="MAT 26:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43"/>Kaha naua uahilukile nakuuana vanakosa tulo, omuo mesho avo alemene.<verse eid="MAT 26:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44"/>Nankuma, uavasezele naua, uaile nakulombela luamucitatu, uahandekele mezi acifua cimo. <verse eid="MAT 26:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45"/>Kaha uezile kuli vandongisi vendi nakuhandeka nguendi, “Nkuma hanga muacikosa na kuhuima? Taleni, hola inahete laja, kaha Muna muntu vanamuende vungungu nakumuhana ku mavoko a vaka vupi. <verse eid="MAT 26:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46"/>Hindukeni tuyeni, taleni muka kunjenda vungungu uno hali hano.”<verse eid="MAT 26:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Vamukuata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mako14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Iuano18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47"/>Tele Yesu acili nakuhandeka, Yundasa uezile, uje umo ua vandongisi likumi na vavali, kaha uezile na vivunga viakama vezile na mikuale na vimbueti, kuhuminina kuli vakuluntu va tusasendote na vakuluntu va vantu. <verse eid="MAT 26:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48"/>Kaha honi mukakuenda vungungu uavahanene cimueso uahandekele nguendi, “Uje njikatsemba ikeye yala mukakuata.”<verse eid="MAT 26:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49"/>Kaha hajevene uezile kuli Yesu nakuhandeka nguendi, “Uahinduka vati, mulongisi!” Kaha uamutsembele.<verse eid="MAT 26:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50"/>Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi “Yove kavusamba, linga vuasi vije viunezila.” Mukemo honi vezile nakumukuata nakumuvumbatela cikuma. <verse eid="MAT 26:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51"/>Kaha taleni, umo ua vaje vakele navo Yesu uahumisile mukuale uendi, nakuluisa ngamba ua kasasendote uakama kaha uamutetele lituitui liendi. <verse eid="MAT 26:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52"/>Ambahoni Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Haka mukuale uove mu cindalo cauo, omuo voshe vaje vakambata mukuale vakatsa ku mukuale. <verse eid="MAT 26:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53"/>Nkuma musinganieka ngueni kunjasa kulomba kuli Tate, kaha hajevene akanjitumina masualale va tungelo likumi na vavali ndi? <verse eid="MAT 26:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54"/>Vuno honi kaha vatihoni visoneka vikalishulisisa, ngeci cikafue muje?”<verse eid="MAT 26:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55"/>Ha hola ijevene Yesu uahandekele ku vivunga nguendi, “Nkuma muneja ngue muakuluisa muhuza, na mikuale na vimbueti mukukuata yange ndi? Ha litangua na litangua njatumamene mu njivo ya Njambi nakulongesa kaha kumuanjikutile. <verse eid="MAT 26:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56"/>Vuno honi vioshe evi vinalingiua linga visoneka via tunanguizi va Njambi va Njambi vilishulisise.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:56">Ambahoni vandongisi vendi voshe vamusezele nakuteua.<verse eid="MAT 26:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vasompa Yesu ku Mesho a Mpunga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Mako14:53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luka22:54-55</ref>;<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Iuano18:13-14-19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57"/>Ambahoni vaje vakutile Yesu vamutualele kuli Kayafase kasasendote uakama, kuje kuvaliku nguluilile valongisi va lishiko na vakuluntu. <verse eid="MAT 26:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58"/>Vuno honi Petulu uakele nakumukava halahako, halahako noho vahetele ku cipango ca kasasendote uakama, kaha omo uakovelele mukati uatumamene na vaka kuniunga linga amone vika vikalingiua. <verse eid="MAT 26:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59"/>Kaha honi vakuluntu va tusasendote na mpunga yoshe vahanene vukaleho vua makuli hali Yesu linga vamutsihileho, <verse eid="MAT 26:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60"/>vuno honi kuvauaneneho cipue vumo, cipue vene nguavo kuakele vakaleho vavengi va makuli. Kaha kumamanusuilo vavali vezile kulutue, <verse eid="MAT 26:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61"/>nakuhandeka nguavo, “Ou mukuetu uahandekele nguendi, ‘Njasa kusiula eyi njivo ya Njambi nakuitunga naua mu matangua atatu.’”<verse eid="MAT 26:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62"/>Kaha uje kasasendote uakama uemanene nakuhandeka nguendi, “Nkuma kuuesi nacikumbululo ndi? Vikahoni ava vamala alinaku kuvangeya?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63"/>Vuno honi Yesu uaholokele lika kuluu. Kaha kasasendote uakama uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Njikusinga mu lizina lia Njambi uakuyoya, tuleke nga yove Kilistu, Muna Njambi.”<verse eid="MAT 26:63"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Omu vene munahandeka mukemo. Vuno honi njimileka nguange, kuhuma ha ntsimbu ino mukamona Muna Muntu natumama ku livoko liacilio lia muka Nzili yoshe, kaha akeja mu mashelua a muilu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65"/>Ambahoni uje kasasendote uakama uatavuile cikovelo cendi nakuhandeka nguendi, “Nashaula Njambi. Vika naua tutondela vakaleho veka? Munevu honi kushaula cendi. <verse eid="MAT 26:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66"/>Nkuma musompa ngueni vati?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:66">Vamukumbuluile nguavo, “Napande kutsa.”<verse eid="MAT 26:66"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67"/>Ambahoni vamujekuilile ku cihanga cendi nakumupupa, kaha vamo vamupupile vimbanda <verse eid="MAT 26:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68"/>nakuhandeka nguavo, “Kilistu, handeka vunanguizi kuli yetu! Iya nakupupu?”<verse eid="MAT 26:68"/></para>
  <para style="s">Petulu Aviana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Mako14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Iuano18:15-18</ref>;<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69"/>Honi Petulu uatumamene hambanza lia cipango. Kaha ngamba uampuevo uezile kuli ikeye nakuhandeka nguendi, “Nove vene uakele na Yesu uaku Ngalileya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70"/>Vuno honi uavianene ku mesho avo voshe nguendi, “Kunjitantekeya evi uli nakuhandeka.” <verse eid="MAT 26:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71"/>Kaha omo uaile hambanza lia cikolo, ngamba mukuavo uampuevo uamumuene kaha uahandekele ku vantu vaje vemanene kuje nguendi, “Ou yala uakele hamo na Yesu uaku Nazaleta.”<verse eid="MAT 26:71"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72"/>Kaha naua uavianene nacisingo nguendi, “Kunjimutantekeya ou yala.”<verse eid="MAT 26:72"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73"/>Hanima ya kantsimbu kakandende vaje vantu vemanene kuje vezile nakuhandeka kuli Petulu nguavo, “Cilivene nove naua umo uavo, omuo handekesi yove ikeyo ikujombolola.”<verse eid="MAT 26:73"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74"/>Ambahoni Petulu uaputukile kuhandeka visingo hali ikeye vavenia nakulisinga nguendi, “Kunjimutantekeya ou yala.” Kaha hajevene ndemba uatambekele.<verse eid="MAT 26:74"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75"/>Kaha Petulu uanukile vije viahandekele Yesu nguendi, “Kanda ndemba atambeke ukanjiviana lutatu.” Kaha uaile hambanza nakulila cikuma.<verse eid="MAT 26:75"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu Vamutuala kuli Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mako15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luka23:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:28-32">Iuano8:28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1"/>Omo cimene cahetele vakuluntu vatusasendote voshe na vakuluntu va vantu vatumbile vutumbe vuakuluisa Yesu ngeci vamutsihe. <verse eid="MAT 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2"/>Kaha vamukutile nakumutuala kuli Pilato uje uapuile nguvulu.<verse eid="MAT 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yundasa Alishukika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Vilinga1:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3"/>Omo Yundasa uje uamuendele vungungu uamuene nguendi vanamuhisa, uatengulukile nakuhiluisa vije vimbongo via siliva makumi atatu kuli vakuluntu vatusasendote na vakuluntu, <verse eid="MAT 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4"/>uahandekele nguendi, “Njinalingi vupi hakuenda vungungu maninga akuhona mulonga.” Kaha vamukumbuluile nguavo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:4">“Vikahoni ovio kuli yetu? Ouo mulonga uove.”<verse eid="MAT 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5"/>Kaha Yundasa uombilile vije vimbongo via siliva mu njivo ya Njambi, kaha uaile nakukalishukika.<verse eid="MAT 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6"/>Vuno honi vakuluntu vatusasendote omo vambatele vije vimbongo via siliva, vahandekele nguavo, “Kuya ku lishiko kucapandele kuvihaka mu mbango, omuo vinapu vimbongo via maninga.” <verse eid="MAT 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7"/>Nankuma valitavasanene linga vavilande lihia lia uje muka kushonga vindeho, ngeci lipue lia kutsindila vangezi. <verse eid="MAT 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8"/>Nankuma, nakuheta nalelo lino lije lihia valisana nguavo lihia lia maninga.<verse eid="MAT 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9"/>Ambahoni vialishulisilile vije viahandekele kananguizi ua Njambi Yelemaya nguendi, “Kaha vambatele vimbongo via siliva makumi atatu, a ndando yendi ije ndando ivayonguele vamo vana va Isaleli, <verse eid="MAT 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10"/>kaha vavipangesele kulanda lihia lia muka-kushonga vindeho, ngue muje Muene muavashikilililemo.”<verse eid="MAT 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pilato Ehula Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Mako15:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luka23:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Iuano18:33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11"/>Kaha Yesu uemanene ku mesho a nguvulu ua Valoma, kaha nguvulu uamuhuile nguendi, “Yove Muene ua Vayunda ndi?” Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:11">“Omu munahandeka mukemo vene.” <verse eid="MAT 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12"/>Vuno honi omo vamuvangeyele kuli vakuluntu va tusasendote na vakuluntu, kavakumbuluile.<verse eid="MAT 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13"/>Ambahoni Pilato uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Nkuma kuuesi nakuvua viuma evi vivali nakuhana vukaleho hali yove indi?”<verse eid="MAT 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14"/>Vuno honi kamukumbuluile cipue kamandende, Kaha honi nguvulu ualikomokelele cikuma.<verse eid="MAT 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Vamusompela Kutsa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mako15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39">Iuano18:39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:16">19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15"/>Honi ku ciuano uje nguvulu kuya ku lishiko liavo, uapandele kuhumisila civunga umo ua vinzinda uje ivatondele. <verse eid="MAT 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16"/>Kaha ha ntsimbu ije kuakele cinzinda uje uakuhona kuivua, ivatumbuile nguavo Mbalambasa. <verse eid="MAT 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17"/>Omo valikunguilile hamo Pilato uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Iya mutonda linga njimihumisile Mbalambasa indi Yesu uje ivatumbula nguavo Kilistu indi?” <verse eid="MAT 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18"/>Omuo Pilato uatantekeyele nguendi omo ya cipululu cavo mukemo vamuneheleleye Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19"/>Oku tele Pilato natumama ha citumamo cakusompela, mpuevo yendi uatumine lizi kuli ikeye nguendi, “Keti ulinge cimo kuli ou yala ua vusunga, omuo njinayanda cikuma kumulota.”<verse eid="MAT 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20"/>Kaha vakuluntu vatusasendote na vakuluntu visindiyile vantu linga valombe Mbalambasa kaha Yesu vamutsihe. <verse eid="MAT 27:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21"/>Kaha nguvulu uavehuile naua nguendi, “Kuli ava vantu vavali iya mutonda linga njimihumisile?” Vahandekele nguavo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:21">“Mbalambasa.”<verse eid="MAT 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22"/>Pilato uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Amba vika honi njikalinga nou Yesu ivatumbula Kilistu?” Kaha voshe vahandekele nguavo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:22">“Mushukike.” <verse eid="MAT 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23"/>Kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Vupi muka vuanalingi?” Vuno honi voshe vatambekele cikuma nguavo, “Vamushukike.” <verse eid="MAT 27:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24"/>Kaha honi omo Pilato uamuene nguendi nacimo cauanaho cahi, vuno honi mpindangano ili nakuputuka, uambatele mema na kutana ku mavoko endi ha mesho acivunga, nakuhandeka nguendi, “Yange kunjesi namulonga ha maninga ou yala, limueneni yeni vavenia.” <verse eid="MAT 27:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25"/>Kaha vantu voshe vamukumbuluile nguavo, “Maninga endi akale hali yetu na vana vetu!” <verse eid="MAT 27:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26"/>Kaha uavahanene Mbalambasa, kaha hakumanusula kupupa Yesu, uavahaneneye linga vamushukike.<verse eid="MAT 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Masualale Vashendumuna Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Mako15:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Iuano19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27"/>Ambahoni masualale vanguvulu vambatele Yesu nakumutuala mulipela, kaha vakunguluile civunga coshe ca masualale kuli ikeye. <verse eid="MAT 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28"/>Vamushuluile, nakumuzika kazaku kakuvenga. <verse eid="MAT 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29"/>Kaha vavindile cilongo ca mambimbo vacakele kumutue uendi, kaha vamuakele lihongo mu livoko liendi lia cilio. Vatsikamene ku mesho endi na kumushendumuna nguavo, “Uahinduka, Muene ua Vayunda!” <verse eid="MAT 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30"/>Kaha vamujekuilile mate, kaha vambatele lihongo vamupupile ku mutue. <verse eid="MAT 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31"/>Munima ya kumushendumuna, vamushuluile kazaku, nakumuzika vuzalo vuendi nakumutuala mukumushukika.<verse eid="MAT 27:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Vamushukika ha Cilindakano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mako15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Iuano19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32"/>Omuo vakele nakuya, valiuanene na yala uaku Silene, lizina liendi Simoni, ou yala vamusindiiye kuambata cilindakano ca Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33"/>Kaha omo vahetele ha cihela civasana nguavo Ngolongota (Cije cilumbununa nguaco cihela ca cikola), <verse eid="MAT 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34"/>vamuhanene viniu linga anue, va vikumbasanene na niangua, vuno honi omo uamakeleleko, kavinuine. <verse eid="MAT 27:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35"/>Kaha omo vamanusuile ku mushukika, valipangezelele vuzalo vuendi hhakati kavo mukuta nkela, <verse eid="MAT 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36"/>ambahoni vatumamene hamavu oku vali nakumutalela. <verse eid="MAT 27:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37"/>Kaha helu lia mutue uendi vahakeleho cimueso cavije vamuhisile navio nguavio, “Ou ikeye Yesu, Muene ua Vayunda.” <verse eid="MAT 27:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38"/>Honi vamushukikile na mihuza vavali, umo kucilio umo kucimoshue. <verse eid="MAT 27:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39"/>Kaha vaje vakele nakuhita vamushauile, nakuningangesa mitue yavo. <verse eid="MAT 27:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40"/>Kaha vahandekele nguavo, “Yove uatondele kusiula njivo ya Njambi nakuitunga mu matangua atatu, liovole yove vavenia! Nga u Muna Njambi, huma ha cilindakano.” <verse eid="MAT 27:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41"/>Nankuma vakuluntu vatusasendote na va valongisi va lishiko na vakuluntu vamushendumuine nguavo, <verse eid="MAT 27:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42"/>“Uovuela vakuavo, vuno honi kasa kuliovola ikeye vavenia. Ikeye Muene ua Isaleli, ashuluke kuhuma hacilindakano, kaha tumutsiliela. <verse eid="MAT 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43"/>Uatsiliela muli Njambi, eceni Njambi amuohiele hano vene, nga amuzanga, omuo uahandekele nguendi, ‘Yange Muna Njambi!’ ” <verse eid="MAT 27:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44"/>Kaha na mihuza vaje vavamushukikile hamo nendi vamutukile navo naua.<verse eid="MAT 27:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kutsa ca Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mako15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Iuano19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45"/>Honi kuhuma mutania kutuala ha hola ya mucitatu ya mutania uacinguezi kuakele milima ha mavu hoshe. <verse eid="MAT 27:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46"/>Kaha ha hola ya mucitatu ya mutania uacinguezi Yesu ualilile mukutambakana nguendi, “Eloi, Eloi, lema sambakatani?” Kulumbununa nguavo, “Njambi yange, Njambi yange, vika uanjisezela?”<verse eid="MAT 27:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47"/>Kaha vamo vantu vaje vemanene kuje omo vovuile eci, vahandekele nguavo, “Ou yala alinakusana Eliya.” <verse eid="MAT 27:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48"/>Kaha umo uavo hajevene uashatukile nakukambata mupelo, kaha ua umbuitikile mu viniu via kushasha naku ukutilila ku lihongo kaha uamuhanene linga anue.<verse eid="MAT 27:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49"/>Vuno honi vamo vahandekele nguavo, “Vandameneni, tuyeni tumone indi Eliya eja nakumuovola.”<verse eid="MAT 27:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50"/>Kaha Yesu ualilile nakutambakana naua, kaha uecelele cimbembesi cendi.<verse eid="MAT 27:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51"/>Kaha taleni, ntanga ya mu njivo ya Njambi yatavukile hhakati, kuhuma kuilu nakuheta ha mavu. Kaha mavu aningangele, kaha na mavue atavukile, <verse eid="MAT 27:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52"/>na vihilo naua navio viashokolokele, kaha mivila yaingi ya vaje vaka kulela vaje vatsile vaisanguile. <verse eid="MAT 27:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53"/>Kaha omo vahumine mu vihilo hanima yakusanguka ca Yesu, vaile mu nganda ya kulela nakukalisholola ku vantu vavengi.<verse eid="MAT 27:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54"/>Omo uje mukuluntu ua masualale na vaje vakele navo vaje vakele nakuniunga Yesu, vamuene mandunduma na vije vialingiuile, kaha vovuile liova cikuma nakuhandeka nguavo, “Muavusunga vene ou uapuile Muna Njambi!”<verse eid="MAT 27:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55"/>Kuje vene kuakele naua na vampuevo vavengi, vaje vakele nakutalela alahako, vaje vakavele Yesu kuhuma ku Ngalileya oku tele vali nakumupangela. <verse eid="MAT 27:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56"/>Vamo vavo vapuile Maliya Mangandalena, na Maliya vaina ya Tiango na Yosefa, na vaina ya vana va Zembendeo.<verse eid="MAT 27:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vatsinda Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mako15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Iuano19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57"/>Omo cinguezi cahetele, kuezile yala umo ua kufuka uaku Alamatiya, lizina liendi Yosefa, uje na ikeye naua uapuile ndongisi ua Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58"/>Uahile kuli Pilato nakulomba muvila ua Yesu. Ambahoni Pilato uashikile nguendi linga vamuhaneuo. <verse eid="MAT 27:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59"/>Kaha Yosefa uambatele muvila ua Yesu naku uzengela ha ntanga ya iha ya liniu, <verse eid="MAT 27:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60"/>kaha ua ulangekele mu cihilo caciha cendi vavenia, cije cacokuele mu livue, kaha uakokelele livue liakama ku cikolo ca cihilo, kaha uaile. <verse eid="MAT 27:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61"/>Maliya Mangandalena na Maliya mukuavo vatumamene kuje oku vanatalesa ha cihilo.<verse eid="MAT 27:61"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vaka Kuniunga ku Cihilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62"/>Liamukuavo, hanima ya litangua liakulivuahesela lije likelio litangua lia Sapalalo, vakuluntu va tusasendote na Vafaliseo valikunguluilile kuli Pilato, <verse eid="MAT 27:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63"/>kaha vahandekele nguavo, “Muene, tuanuka muje uje muka kukuisa uahandekele tele aciyoya nguendi, ‘Hanima ya matangua atatu njikasanguka naua.’ <verse eid="MAT 27:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64"/>Nankuma shika vaje tuniungi linga vaniunge muacili cihilo noho ha litangua lia mucitatu. Keti ngoconi hamo vandongisi vendi vakeja nakuiva muvila uendi, kaha vakaleka vantu nguove, ‘Nasanguka kuvatsi,’ kaha aua makuli akukotokela akapua amapi cikuma kupulakana aje akulivanga.”<verse eid="MAT 27:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65"/>Pilato uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Muli na mukakuniunga ua masualale, yeni mukaniunge muacili cihilo kuya muje mumuaselamo.”<verse eid="MAT 27:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66"/>Nankuma vaile nakuniunga cije cihilo, kaha vaciniungile mukuhaka kasateso ku livue nakuhakako muka kuniunga.<verse eid="MAT 27:66"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28"/>
  <para style="s">Kusanguka ca Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Mako16:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Iuano20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1"/>Honi hanima ya sapalalo, ha ntsimbu yakuca ca litangua liakulivanga musondo, Maliya Mangandalena na Maliya mukuavo vaile mukumona ku cihilo. <verse eid="MAT 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2"/>Kaha taleni, kuakele mandunduma akama, omuo kangelo ua Muene uashulukile kuhuma muilu, kuija nakuhumisa livue lije liakele ku cihilo kaha uatumameneho. <verse eid="MAT 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3"/>Cifua cendi cafuile ngue muhiato, kaha vuzalo vuendi vuatokele too ngue mpemba. <verse eid="MAT 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4"/>Omuo ya liova lia kangelo, vaje vaka kuniunga ku cihilo vajajele cikuma kaha valezumukile. <verse eid="MAT 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5"/>Vuno honi uje kangelo uahandekele kuli vaje vampuevo nguendi, “Keti muvue liova, omuo njatantekeya nguange mulinakutonda Yesu, uje ivashukikile. <verse eid="MAT 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6"/>Uahimo muno, nasanguka, ngue muje muahandekele. Ijeni, taleni mu cihela muje muakosele. <verse eid="MAT 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7"/>Ambahoni yeni vuasi vuasi, mukaleke vandongisi vendi ngueni, ‘Nasanguka ku vatsi, kaha taleni, nalivanga laja kuya ku Ngalileya, kuje kukeko kumukamumuena.’ Taleni njamileke.” <verse eid="MAT 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8"/>Kaha vaje vampuevo vahumine ku cihilo vuasi vuasi na liova na kujolelela cikuma, vashatukile na kukaleka vandongisi vendi. <verse eid="MAT 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9"/>Kaha taleni, hajevene Yesu ualiuanene navo nakuhandeka nguendi, “Tambokeni.” Kaha vezile kuli ikeye nakumukuata ku viliato viendi nakumulemesa. <verse eid="MAT 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10"/>Ambahoni Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Keti muvue liova, yeni mukalekese vamuanetu vaye ku Ngalileya, kaha kuje kukeko vakanjimuena.”<verse eid="MAT 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vukaleho vua Vaka Kuniunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11"/>Tele vali nakuya, taleni, vamo va masualale vaile mu nganda nakuleka vakuluntu va tusasendote vioshe vije vialingiuile. <verse eid="MAT 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12"/>Kaha omo valiuanene hamolika na vakuluntu nakutumba vutumbe vuavo, vahanene vimbongo masualale <verse eid="MAT 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13"/>nakuhandeka nguavo, “Lekeni vantu ngueni, ‘Vandongisi vendi vanezile vutsiki nakuiva muvila uendi tele tuli mutulo.’ <verse eid="MAT 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14"/>Ngahoni eci ciheta mu matuitui a nguvulu, tukamuzika zika, linga keti mukale muvukalu.” <verse eid="MAT 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15"/>Ambahoni vambatele vije vimbongo kaha valingile ngue muje vavalekesele, kaha lutsimo lua muzimbu ou luashandokelele hhakati ka Vayunda kuheta na lelo lino.<verse eid="MAT 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Alisholola kuli Vandongisi vendi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mako16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Iuano20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Vilinga1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16"/>Honi vandongisi likumi na umo vaile ku Ngalileya, ku munkinda kuje Yesu uavalekele. <verse eid="MAT 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17"/>Kaha omo vamumuene vamulemesele, vuno honi vamo valikanouelele. <verse eid="MAT 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18"/>Kaha Yesu uezile nakuhandeka kuli vakevo nguendi, “Nzili yoshe yakama ya muilu na ya ha mavu vanaihana kuli yange. <verse eid="MAT 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19"/>Nankuma yeni mukapuise mafuti oshe vandongisi, mukavambuitike mu lizina lia Tate, na lia Muana, na lia Cimbembesi Uakulela, <verse eid="MAT 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20"/>valongeseni kuononoka viuma vioshe vije vinjinamishiki, kaha taleni, njikakala neni kutuala ku mamanusuilo a mavu.”<verse eid="MAT 28:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28"/>
</usx>
